<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Jenèz</para>
  <para style="toc1">JENÈZ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jenèz</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jen</para>
  <para style="mt1">JENÈZ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25">Sòm 102:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan kòmansman an Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:4">Job 38:4</ref></char></note>kreye syèl yo ak tè a. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>Latè te san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:23">Jr 4:23</ref></char></note>fòm e vid, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:9">Job 38:9</ref></char></note>tenèb la te sou tout sifas fon an, e Lespri Bondye t ap ajite sou fas dlo a.<verse eid="GEN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:6-9">Sòm 33:6-9</ref></char></note>Bondye te di: “Ke li gen limyè”. Epi te gen limyè. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Bondye te wè ke limyè a te bon. Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:7">És 45:7</ref></char></note>separe limyè a avèk tenèb la. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:16">Sòm 74:16</ref></char></note> te rele limyè a jou, e tenèb la, Li te rele li lannwit. Konsa, te gen aswè, ak maten, yon jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Alò Bondye te di: “Ke vin gen yon gran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:22">És 40:22</ref></char></note>espas nan mitan dlo yo, e ke li separe dlo avèk dlo”. <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Bondye te fè gran espas la. Li te separe dlo ki te anba gran espas la, avèk lo ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 148:4">Sòm 148:4</ref></char></note>anwo gran espas la. Se konsa sa te ye. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Bondye te rele gran espas la syèl. Epi te gen aswè, e te gen maten, yon dezyèm jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Alò Bondye te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:6-9">Sòm 104:6-9</ref></char></note>Ke dlo anba syèl yo vin rasanble nan yon plas, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1-2">24:1-2</ref></char></note>tè sèch la vin parèt”. Konsa, sa te vin fèt. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Bondye te rele pati sèch la tè, ak dlo ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:7">Sòm 33:7</ref></char></note>rasanble yo, lanmè. Epi Bondye te wè ke sa te bon.<verse eid="GEN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Epi Bondye te di: “Ke latè a boujonnen avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:9-13">Sòm 65:9-13</ref></char></note>bagay vèt; plant ki donnen grenn selon espès pa yo, ak bwa k ap donnen fwi avèk grenn nan yo selon espès pa yo”. Konsa, sa te vin fèt. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Latè te pwodwi bagay vèt, plant ki donnen grenn selon espès pa yo, ak pyebwa ki pwodwi fwi avèk grenn sou yo selon espès pa yo. Bondye te wè ke sa te bon. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Te gen aswè, ak maten, yon twazyèm jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Alò Bondye te di: “Ke vin gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:16">Sòm 74:16</ref></char></note>limyè nan gran espas syèl yo pou separe jou avèk nwit lan, e ke yo vin kòm sign pou sezon yo, pou jou avèk lane yo; <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>ke yo vin sèvi pou limyè nan gran espas syèl yo pou bay limyè sou latè”. Konsa, sa te vin fèt. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Bondye te fè de gran limyè, pi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 136:8-9">Sòm 136:8-9</ref></char></note>gran an pou gouvène lajounen, e pi piti a pou gouvène lannwit. Anplis, Li te fè zetwal yo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Bondye te plase yo nan gran espas syèl yo pou bay limyè sou latè, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:35">Jr 31:35</ref></char></note>gouvène lajounen avèk lannwit, e pou separe limyè a avèk tenèb la. Bondye te wè ke sa te bon. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Te gen aswè, e te gen maten, yon katriyèm jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Alò Bondye te di: “Ke dlo yo vin ranpli avèk anpil kreyati vivan, e ke zwazo yo vole anwo tè a nan gran espas syèl yo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Bondye te kreye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:25-28">Sòm 104:25-28</ref></char></note>gwo bèt sovaj lanmè avèk tout kreyati vivan ki fè mouvman. Dlo yo te plen bèt selon espès pa yo, e chak zwazo selon espès pa l. Bondye te wè ke sa te bon. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Bondye te beni yo. Li te di: “Fè pitit, e vin miltipliye. Ranpli dlo nan lanmè yo, e kite zwazo yo vin miltipliye sou tè a.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Te gen aswè ak maten, yon senkyèm jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:19">Jen 2:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Bondye te di, “Ke tè a vin pwodwi kreyati vivan dapre espès pa yo; bèt domestik, reptil, avèk bèt latè selon espès yo”. Se konsa li te fèt. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Bondye te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:21-22">Jen 7:21-22</ref></char></note>bèt latè yo selon espès yo, ak bèt gade yo dapre espès yo, tout bèt ki trennen atè dapre espès yo; epi Bondye te wè ke sa te bon.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Alò Bondye te di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6-8">Sòm 8:6-8</ref></char></note>“Annou fè lòm nan limaj Nou, menm jan ke Nou sanble a, e ke yo vin mèt sou tout pwason nan lanmè, sou zwazo yo nan syèl yo, sou bèt domestik nan chan yo, ak sou tout bèt reptil ki ranpe atè”.<verse eid="GEN 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Bondye te kreye lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1">Jen 5:1</ref></char></note>nan pwòp imaj pa Li, nan imaj Bondye Li te kreye li; mal avèk femèl Li te kreye yo. <verse eid="GEN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Bondye te beni yo; Li te di yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:1-7">Jen 9:1-7</ref></char></note>“Se pou nou vin fekon. Fè pitit pou ranpli latè, e domine sou li; se pou nou vin mèt sou pwason lanmè yo ak zwazo anlè yo, sou chak bèt vivan kab fè mouvman sou tè a”.<verse eid="GEN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Alò Bondye te di, “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:14">Sòm 104:14</ref></char></note>Mwen bannou chak plant ki donnen grenn sou sifas tout tè a, ak chak bwa ki gen fwi avèk grenn li; li va sèvi kòm manje pou nou; <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Epi a chak bèt latè ak chak zwazo syèl a, chak bagay kab fè mouvman ou tè a, bagay ki gen lavi, Mwen te bay chak plant vèt pou manje”; epi se te konsa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 145:15-16">Sòm 145:15-16</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Bondye te wè tout sa Li te kreye yo, e gade byen, sa te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:24-28">Sòm 104:24-28</ref></char></note>trè bon. Te gen aswè, ak maten, sizyèm jou.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Se te konsa syèl yo avèk tè a te fin fèt, avèk tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Det 4:19</ref></char></note>lame yo.<verse eid="GEN 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Egz 20:8-11</ref></char></note>setyèm jou a, Bondye te fin fè travay ke Li te fè yo. Konsa, Li te repoze nan setyèm jou a sou tout travay ke Li te fè yo. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Epi Bondye te beni setyèm jou a. Li te fè li sen, akoz nan li, Li te repoze de tout travay kreyasyon an, ke Li te fè a.<verse eid="GEN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:4-11">Job 38:4-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sa se listwa syèl yo avèk tè a lè yo te kreye, nan jou ke SENYÈ Bondye a e fè tè a avèk syèl la. <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:11">Jen 1:11</ref></char></note>Alò potko gen ti bwa chan ki te parèt nan tè a, ni plant chan ki te boujonnen, paske Senyè Bondye a potko voye lapli sou tè a, e pa t gen moun pou kiltive tè a. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Men yon vapè te konn leve sòti nan tè a pou wouze tout sifas li. <verse eid="GEN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Alò Senyè Bondye a te fòme lòm sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:19">Jen 3:19</ref></char></note> pousyè tè a. Li te respire souf lavi fè l vin antre nan nen l, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">I Kor 15:45</ref></char></note>lòm te devni yon nanm vivan.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Senyè Bondye a te plante yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:10">Jen 13:10</ref></char></note>jaden nan pati lès Eden, e se la Li te mete lòm ke Li te fòme a. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Soti nan tè a, SENYÈ Bondye a te fè grandi chak ab ki bèl pou gade e ki bon pou manje. Avèk yo nan mitan jaden a te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:22">Jen 3:22</ref></char></note>ab lavi a, ak ab konesans a sa ki bon ak sa ki mal la.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Alò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:4">Sòm 46:4</ref></char></note>rivyè te sòti nan Eden pou wouze jaden an. Epi soti la, li te divize ou fè kat rivyè. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Premye rivyè a rele Pischon; li pase antoure tout peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:18">Jen 25:18</ref></char></note>Havila, kote ki gen lò a. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Lò peyi sa a bon; wòch bdelyèm avèk onyx konn twouve la. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Dezyèm rivyè a rele Guihon; li kouri antoure peyi Cush la. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Yo rele twazyèm rivyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:4">Dan 10:4</ref></char></note>Tigrès; li koule nan lès Assyrie. Epi katriyèm rivyè a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>Euphrate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Alò, Senyè Bondye a te pran lòm nan; Li te mete l nan jaden Eden pou kiltive li e pran swen li.<verse eid="GEN 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Senyè Bondye a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:2-3">Jen 3:2-3</ref></char></note>kòmande lòm nan. Li te di l: “Nan nenpòt sa nan jaden an, ou kapab manje, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>men sou ab konesans bon avèk mal la, ou pa pou manje li, paske nan jou ke ou manje li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:15-20">Det 30:15-20</ref> </char></note>ou va mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Alò, Senyè Bondye a te di: “Sa pa bon pou lòm nan rete sèl. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:9">I Kor 11:9</ref> </char></note>fè yon asistan jan li dwe genyen”.<verse eid="GEN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:24">Jen 1:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sòti nan tè a, Senyè Bondye a te fòme chak bèt chan ak chak zwazo syèl la, e Li te mennen yo kote lòm po wè kòman li ta rele yo. Nenpòt jan li te rele yon kreyati vivan, sa te vin non li. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Lòm nan te bay non a tout bèt domestik yo, a tout zwazo syèl yo, e a chak bèt chan, men pou lòm nan, pa t gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18">Jen 2:18</ref></char></note>asistan sanblab ak li.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Alò, Senyè Bondye a te fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:2">Jen 15:2</ref></char></note>Pwofon somèy pran lòm nan, e li te dòmi. Konsa, li te pran youn nan zo kòt li yo, e te fèmen chè a nan plas li. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Senyè Bondye a te fòme yon fanm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:8-9">I Kor 11:8-9</ref></char></note>kòt ke Li te pran nan lòm nan, e Li te pote li bay li.<verse eid="GEN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Lòm nan te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:14">Jen 29:14</ref></char></note>Koulye a sa se zo a zo mwen, e chè a chè mwen. Li va rele fanm akoz li te retire nan lòm.<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19:5</ref> </char>
    </note>“Pou rezon sila a, yon nonm va kite papa li avèk manman li, pou vin jwenn avèk madanm li, epi yo va vin tounen yon sèl chè.” <verse eid="GEN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:7">Jen 3:7</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:11">11</ref></char></note>Epi lòm nan avèk fanm nan te toutouni, e yo pa t wont.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">II Kor 11:3</ref> </char></note>sèpan an te pi koken pase nenpòt bèt chan ke Bondye te fè. Li te di fanm nan: “Vrèman èske Bondye te di: ‘Pinga nou manje nan okenn ab nan jaden an?’”<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Fanm nan te di a sèpan an: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:16">Jen 2:16</ref></char></note>Fwi ki sòti nan ab nan jaden yo, nou kapab manje yo; <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>men nan fwi ki sòti nan ab ki nan mitan jaden an, Bondye te di: Nou pa pou manje nan li, ni touche li, sinon, nou va mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:44">Jn 8:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sèpan an te di fanm nan: “Vrèman, nou p ap mouri!” <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Paske Bondye konnen ke nan jou nou manje nan li, zye nou va vin louvri, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:4">És 14:4</ref> </char></note>nou va vin tankou Bondye, avèk konesans de sa ki bon ak sa ki mal.<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 5:12-19">Wo 5:12-19</ref> </char>
    </note>Lè fanm nan te wè ke pyebwa a te bon pou manje, ke li te yon plezi devan zye li, ke li te byen itil pou vin saj, alò li te pran nan fwi a pou li te manje; epi li te bay osi a mari li ansanm avèk li, pou li te manje. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Zye a toude te vin louvri, e yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:3">És 47:3</ref></char></note>konnen ke yo te toutouni. Pou sa, yo te koud fèy pyebwa ansanm e yo te fè pou yo menm yon tabliye.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Yo te tande son a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref></char></note>SENYÈ Bondye a ki t ap mache nan jaden an nan frechè jounen an, e lòm nan avèk fanm nan te kache tèt yo de prezans SENYÈ Bondye a pami bwa yo nan jaden an. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Alò, Senyè Bondye a te rele lòm nan, e te di l: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:9">Jen 4:9</ref></char></note>Kote ou ye?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Adam te reponn: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:18-19">Egz 20:18-19</ref></char></note>Mwen te tande son Ou menm nan jaden an, e mwen te pè paske mwen te toutouni; alò mwen te kache tèt mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Epi Li te di li, kilès ki te di ou ke ou te toutouni? Èske ou te manje nan pyebwa e M te di ou pa manje a?<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:33">Job 31:33</ref> </char>
    </note>Lòm nan te di: “Fanm ke Ou te ban mwen an, li te ban m ladann, e mwen te manje.” <verse eid="GEN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Alò, Bondye te di a fanm nan: “Kisa ou te fè la a?” Epi fanm nan te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">II Kor 11:3</ref> </char></note>“Sèpan an te twonpe mwen, e mwen te manje l.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>SENYÈ Bondye a te di a sèpan an: “Akoz ke ou te fè sa, ou modi pase tout bèt domestik yo, e plis ke tout bèt sovaj nan chan an. Sou vant ou ou va mache, e se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">És 65:25</ref></char></note>pousyè ke ou va manje tout jou nan vi ou. <verse eid="GEN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Mwen va mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Rev 12:17</ref></char></note>rayisman antre ou menm avèk fanm nan, e antre pitit ou ak pitit li. Li va kraze tèt ou, e ou va kraze talon li.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>A fanm nan Li te di: “Mwen va miltipliye anpil doulè ke ou va gen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:21">Jn 16:21</ref></char></note>fè pitit; ak doulè ou va gen nan pouse pitit; malgre sa, dezi ou va pou mari ou, e li va domine sou ou.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Alò a Adam Li te di: “Akoz ou te koute vwa a fanm ou an, ou te manje nan ab ke Mwen te kòmande e te di Ou pa manje ladann nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:29">Jen 5:29</ref></char></note>tè a ap modi akoz ou menm. Nan redi ou va manje ladann pou tout jou lavi ou. <verse eid="GEN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Se pikan, se zepeng li va fè grandi pou ou; epi ou va manje plant chan an. <verse eid="GEN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Avèk swè figi ou, ou va manje pen, jiskaske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:3">Sòm 90:3</ref></char></note>retounen nan tè a, paske ladann ou te sòti. Paske se pousyè ou ye, e se nan pousyè ou va retounen.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Alò, lòm nan te rele fanm li an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">II Kor 11:3</ref></char></note>Eve, paske se li ki te manman a tout vivan yo.<verse eid="GEN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>SENYÈ Bondye a te fè rad avèk po bèt pou Adam avèk madanm li, e Li te abiye yo. <verse eid="GEN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Alò, SENYÈ Bondye a te di: “Gade byen, lòm nan gen tan vini tankou youn nan Nou, avèk konesans sa ki bon avèk sa ki mal. Koulye a, pou li pa lonje men l, pou pran osi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Jen 2:9</ref></char></note>ab lavi a, manje l e viv jis pou tout tan—” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ Bondye a te voye l deyò jaden Eden nan, pou kiltive tè a, nan sila li te sòti a.<verse eid="GEN 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Alò, Li te pouse lòm nan deyò; epi nan lès jaden Eden nan, Li te estasyone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Egz 25:18-22</ref></char></note>cheriben nan avèk nepe ak flanm ki te vire nan tout direksyon pou veye chemen vè ab lavi a.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Alò, lòm nan te vin nan relasyon avèk madanm li, Ève. Li te vin ansent e li te vin kouche fè Cain. Konsa, li te di: “Mwen gen tan fè yon ti nonm avèk èd SENYÈ a:” <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Ankò, li te bay nesans a frè li, Abel. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:50-51">Luc 11:50-51</ref> </char></note>Abel se te yon bèje bann mouton, men Cain t ap laboure tè a.<verse eid="GEN 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Li te vin rive pi devan ke Cain te pote yon ofrann bay SENYÈ a, ki sòti nan fwi rekòlt tè a. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Eb 11:5</ref></char></note>Abel, osi, sou pati pa l te pote nan premye pòtre twoupo, e nan pòsyon pi gra a nan yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:4">Konsa, SENYÈ a te kontan pou Abel avèk ofrann pa l la, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>men pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:7">I Sam 16:7</ref> </char></note>Cain, avèk ofrann pa li a, Li pa t kontan. Alò, Cain te vin byen fache, e figi li te vin ba.<verse eid="GEN 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Cain: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:4">Jn 4:4</ref></char></note>Poukisa ou fache konsa? Epi poukisa figi ou vin ba konsa? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Si ou fè sa ki bon èske figi ou p ap leve ankò? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:23">Nonb 32:23</ref></char></note>Epi si ou pa fè sa ki bon, peche ap kouche devan papòt ou. Dezi li se pou ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:14-15">Job 11:14-15</ref></char></note>men ou oblije vin mèt li.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Cain te di frè l la, Abel, “An ale nan chan.” Epi li te vin rive ke pandan yo te nan chan an, Cain te leve kont Abel, frè l la, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref> </char></note>touye li.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Cain: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:9">Jen 3:9</ref></char></note>Kote frè ou a, Abel?” Epi li te di: “Mwen pa konnen. Èske mwen se gadyen frè m nan?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Li te di: “Kisa ou te fè la a? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:33">Nonb 35:33</ref> </char></note>Vwa san a frè ou a ap rele ban Mwen sòti nan tè a. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:14">Jen 3:14</ref></char></note>ou modi, soti nan tè a, ki te ouvri bouch li pou resevwa san Abel nan men ou an. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Depi koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15-24">Det 28:15-24</ref></char></note>lè ou kiltive tè a, li p ap bay ou fòs li ankò. Ou va vin yon vagabon k ap mache toupatou sou latè.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Cain te di a SENYÈ a: “Pinisyon mwen an twò di pou m sipòte! <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Byen gade! Jodi a ou gen tan pouse m kite sifas tè a. Konsa, fas ou p ap wè m; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:64-67">Det 28:64-67</ref> </char></note>mwen va vin yon vagabon k ap plede mache toupatou sou latè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:19">Nonb 35:19</ref> </char></note>nenpòt moun ki jwenn mwen va touye m.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di li: “Pou sa, nenpòt moun ki touye Cain, vanjans va tonbe sou li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Jen 4:24</ref></char></note>sèt fwa plis.” Epi SENYÈ a te chwazi yon sign pou Cain, dekwa ke pèsòn ki jwenn li pa ta touye l. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Konsa, Cain te sòti de prezans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:20">II Wa 24:20</ref></char></note> SENYÈ a, e li te al rete sou teren Nod nan pati lès Eden an.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Cain te antre an relasyon avèk madanm li. Li te vin ansent, e li te bay nesans a Hénoc; epi li te bati yon vil. Li te bay vil la non Henoc, menm non ak fis li a. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Alò, Hénoc te fè Irad, e Irad te devni papa a Mehujaël, Mehujaël te vin papa a Metuschaël, e Metuschaël te vin papa a Lémec.<verse eid="GEN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lémec te pran pou li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jen 2:24</ref></char></note>de madanm: youn yo te rele Ada, e non a lòt la se te Tsilla. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada te bay nesans a Jabal. Li te papa a tout sila ki te rete nan tant yo, e ki te okipe bèt yo. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Frè li a te rele Jubal. Li te papa a tout sila ki te jwe ap avèk shaloumo yo. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Epi pou Tsilla, li te bay nesans a Tubal-Cain, yon bòs fòjewon ki fè zouti avèk bwonz ak fè. Sè a Tubal Cain an se te Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lémec te di a madanm li yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada avèk Tsilla, koute vwa m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Nou menm ki madanm a Lémec yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">byen okipe pawòl mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Egz 20:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske mwen te touye yon mesye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">akoz ke li blese m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">e yon gason akoz li frape m.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Si Cain vanje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:15">Jen 4:15</ref></char></note>sèt fwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">alò Lémec swasann-dis-sèt fwa.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adam te antre an relasyon ankò avèk madanm li, epi li te bay nesans a yon fis. Li te rele li Seth, paske li te di “Bondye te chwazi ban mwen yon lòt fis nan plas Abel, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Jen 4:8</ref></char></note>paske Cain te touye li”. <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Pou Seth, li menm, li te bay nesans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:9">Jen 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:38">Luc 3:38</ref></char></note>yon fis, epi li te rele non li Énosch.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Nan lè sa a, lèzòm te kòmanse ap rele non SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Sa se liv jenerasyon Adan yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Nan jou ke Bondye te kreye lòm, Li te fè l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Jen 1:26-27</ref></char></note>nan imaj Bondye. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Li te kreye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19:4</ref> </char></note>mal avèk femèl. Li te beni yo, e Li te rele yo Lòm. Sa vle di “Adam” nan jou ke yo te kreye a.<verse eid="GEN 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Lè Adam te gen tan fin viv san-trant ane, li te vin papa a yon fis ki sanble nèt ak li, nan pwòp imaj pa l. Li te rele li Seth. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Laj a Adam, lè l te fin fè Seth, se te uit-san ane, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Paske tout jou ke Adam te viv yo te nèf-san-trant ane. Konsa, li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seth te viv san-senkant ane, e li te vin papa Énosch. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Alò, Seth te viv uit-san-sèt ane apre li te vin papa Énosch, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Paske tout jou a Seth yo te nèf-san-douz ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Énosch te viv katre-ven-dis ane, e li te vin papa a Kénan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Epi Énosch te viv uit-san-kenz ane apre li te vin papa a Kénan, e li te fè lòt fis ak lòt fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Alò, tout jou a Énosch yo te nèf-san-senk ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kénan te viv pandan swasann-dis ane, e li te vin papa a Mahalaléel. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Epi Kénan te viv uit-san-karant ane lè li te fin fè Mahalaléel, e li te gen lòt fis ak lòt fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Alò, tout jou a Kénan yo te nèf-san-dis ane, e li te mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalaléel te viv swasant senk ane, e li te vin papa Jred. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Epi Mahalaléel te viv ui-san-trant ane apre li te vin papa Jred, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Alò, tout jou a Mahalaléel yo te ui-san-katre-ven-kenz ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Jred te viv san-swasann-de ane, e li te vin papa Hénoc. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Alò, Jred te viv ui-san ane apre li te vin papa Hénoc, e li te gen lòt fis ak lòt fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Paske, tout jou a Jred yo te nèf-san-swasann-de ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Hénoc te viv swasann-senk ane, e li te vin papa Methuschélah. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Alò, Hénoc te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mi 6:8</ref></char></note>mache ansanm avèk Bondye pandan twa san ane apre li te vin papa a Methuschélah, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Paske tout jou Hénoc yo te twa-san-swasant-senk ane. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Hénoc te mache avèk Bondye; e li pa t la ankò, paske Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:10">II Wa 2:10</ref></char></note>pran l.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Methuschélah te viv pandan san-katre-ven-sèt ane, e li te vin papa a Lémec. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Alò Methuschélah te viv sèt san katreven de ane apre li te vin papa a Lémec, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Jou Methuschélah yo te nèf-san-swasant nèf ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lémec te viv san-katre-ven-de ane, e li te vin papa a yon fis. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Alò, li te rele non li Noé, e li te di: “Sila a va bannou repo sou travay di nou fè ak men nou ki leve sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Jen 3:17-19</ref></char></note>tè ke SENYÈ a te modi a.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Alò, Lémec te viv senk-san-katre-ven-kenz ane apre li te vin fè Noé, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Paske tout jou a Lémec te sèt-san-swasann-dis-sèt ane, e li te vin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Noé te gen laj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6">Jen 7:6</ref></char></note>senk-san ane, e li te vin papa a Sem, Cham, ak Japhet.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Alò, li te rive ke lè lèzòm te kòmanse miltipliye sou sifas tè a, e yo te fè pitit fi, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>ke fis Bondye yo te wè ke fi lezòm yo te bèl. Konsa, yo te pran kòm madanm pou yo menm, nenpòt ke yo te chwazi.<verse eid="GEN 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Alò SENYÈ a te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16-17">Gal 5:16-17</ref></char></note>Lespri Mwen p ap lite avèk lòm pou janmè, paske li menm osi se chè. Konsa, jou li yo va san-ven-ane.”<verse eid="GEN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Jeyan yo te sou latè nan jou sa yo, e menm aprè, lè fis Bondye yo te antre nan pitit fi a lòm yo, e te fè pitit avèk yo. Sila yo se te lòm pwisan de tan ansyen yo, lòm gran repitasyon yo.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Alò SENYÈ a te wè ke mechanste lòm te gran sou latè, epi ke chak entansyon ak panse nan kè li te toujou vè lemal. <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:7-10">Jr 18:7-10</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te regrèt ke Li te fè lòm sou latè a, e sa te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">És 63:10</ref></char></note>blese Li nan kè L.<verse eid="GEN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>SENYÈ a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:63">Det 28:63</ref></char></note>“Mwen va efase lòm ke mwen te kreye sou fas tè a, soti nan lòm jis nan tout bèt yo, ak a zwazo anlè yo. Paske mwen regrèt ke m te fè yo.”<verse eid="GEN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Men Noé te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:19">Jen 19:19</ref></char></note>twouve favè nan zye SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Sa yo se achiv jenerasyon Noé yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 6:9">Noé se te yon moun ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">II Pi 2:5</ref></char></note>ladwati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">Jen 17:1</ref></char></note>san fot nan tan pa li a. Noé te mache avèk Bondye. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Noé te vin papa twa fis: Sem, Cham, ak Japhet.<verse eid="GEN 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Alò tè a te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:29">Det 31:29</ref></char></note>konwonpi nan zye Bondye, e latè te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:17">Esd 8:17</ref></char></note>vin plen ak vyolans.<verse eid="GEN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Bondye te gade sou latè, e gade byen, li te vin konwonpi; paske tout chè te vin konwonpi sou tè a nan jan yo te mache. <verse eid="GEN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Alò, Bondye te di a Noé: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:1-4">És 34:1-4</ref></char></note>“Lafen tout chè gen tan parèt devan M; paske latè vin ranpli avèk vyolans akoz yo menm. Gade byen, mwen prè pou detwi yo ansanm ak latè. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Fè pou kont ou yon lach avèk bwa gofè. Ou va fè l avèk chanm, e kouvri li anndan kon deyò avèk kòl rezin. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Se konsa ke ou va fè l: longè lach la va twa san koude (18 pous se yon koude), lajè li va senkant koude, e wotè li va trant koude. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Ou va fè yon fenèt pou lach la, fè l rive yon koude mwens ke wotè li. Konsa, plase pòt lach la rive sou de kote li yo. Fè li ak pi ba, dezyèm, avèk twazyèm etaj.<verse eid="GEN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">II Pi 2:5</ref> </char></note>Mwen menm, Mwen ap mennen delij dlo sou latè pou detwi tout chè ki gen souf lavi ladann, depi anba syèl la. Tout bagay ki sou latè va peri.<verse eid="GEN 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>“Men Mwen va etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:9-16">Jen 9:9-16</ref></char></note>akò Mwen avèk ou. Konsa, ou va antre nan lach la—ou menm avèk fis ou yo, avèk madanm ou yo, madanm a fis ou yo ansanm avèk ou.<verse eid="GEN 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 7:2-15">Jen 7:2-15</ref> </char>
    </note>“Epi soti nan tout chè de tout kalite bèt k ap viv, ou va pote de nan chak espès pou antre nan lach la, pou kenbe yo vivan ak nou. Konsa, yo va mal avèk femèl. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>“Nan zwazo yo selon espès pa yo, nan bèt yo selon espès pa yo, chak sa ki kouri atè reptil selon espès pa l. De nan chak espès va vin kote ou, pou ou ka kenbe yo toujou vivan. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Pou ou menm, pran pou pwòp tèt ou kèk nan tout bagay ki kab manje, e rasanble yo pou ou menm. Yo va sèvi pou ou kòm manje pou ou, ak pou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Konsa Noé te fè l. Selon tout sa ke Bondye te kòmande li, se konsa li te fè l.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Noé: “Antre nan lach la, ou avèk tout lakay ou, paske se ou sèl mwen te wè ki dwat devan mwen nan jenerasyon sila a. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Ou va pran avèk ou sèt nan chak bèt ki pwòp, yon mal avèk yon femèl parèy li. Nan bèt ki pa pwòp yo, yon mal avèk yon femèl parèy li. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Anplis, nan zwazo nan syèl la pa sèt, mal avèk femèl, pou kenbe pòtre yo vivan sou tout sifas tè a. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Paske, apre sèt jou ankò, Mwen va voye lapli sou latè pandan karant jou ak karant nwit. Konsa, Mwen va efase sou fas tè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:7-13">Jen 6:7-13</ref> </char></note>chak èt vivan ke Mwen te fè.”<verse eid="GEN 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:22">Jen 6:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Noé te fè tout bagay jan ke Bondye te mande l la. <verse eid="GEN 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Alò, Noé te gen laj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:32">Jen 5:32</ref></char></note>sis-san ane lè delij la te vini sou latè.<verse eid="GEN 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:18">Jen 6:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Noé avèk fis li yo, avèk madanm li, avèk madanm a fis li yo, avèk li menm te antre nan lach la akoz dlo delij la. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:19-20">Jen 6:19-20</ref> </char></note>Nan bèt ki te pwòp yo, avèk bèt ki pa pwòp yo, zwazo avèk tout sa ki kouri atè yo, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>tout te antre nan lach la ak Noé, de pa de, mal avèk femèl, jan Bondye te kòmande Noé a. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Li te rive apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:4">Jen 7:4</ref></char></note>sèt jou ke dlo delij la te vini sou latè.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nan sis-santyèm ane nan lavi Noé, nan dezyèm mwa, nan di-setyèm jou nan mwa a, nan menm jou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:2">Jen 8:2</ref></char></note>tout sous nan gran fon an te vin pete, e pòt delij yo nan syèl la te vin louvri. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:4-17">Jen 7:4-17</ref> </char></note>Lapli te tonbe sou latè pandan karant jou, ak karant nwit.<verse eid="GEN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>O jis nan menm jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:18">Jen 6:18</ref></char></note>Noé avèk Sem, Cham, avèk Japhet, fis a Noé yo, madanm a Noé, ak twa madanm a fis li yo, te antre nan lach la, <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>yo menm avèk chak bèt selon espès yo, tout bèt domestik selon espès pa yo, tout reptil ki kouri atè selon espès pa yo, ak tout kalite zwazo. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Epi yo te antre nan lach la vè Noé, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:19">Jen 6:19</ref></char></note>de nan tout chè ki te gen souf lavi. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Sila ki te antre yo, mal avèk femèl nan tout chè, te antre jan Bondye te kòmande li a; epi SENYÈ a te fèmen lach la dèyè li.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Konsa delij la te vini sou latè a pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:4">Jen 7:4</ref></char></note>karant jou. Dlo a te vin ogmante e te leve lach la jis li rive anwo tè a. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Dlo a te monte. Li te ogmante anpil sou tè a, e lach la te monte sou dlo a. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Dlo a te vin monte plis toujou sou tè a, jis tout mòn toupatou anba syèl la te vin kouvri. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Dlo a te vin monte pou kenz koude anplis, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:4">Jen 8:4</ref></char></note>mòn yo te vin kouvri.<verse eid="GEN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:7">Jen 6:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout chè ki t ap fè mouvman sou tè a te vin peri, zwazo avèk bèt domestik avèk bèt sovaj, e chak ensèk ki vole ansanm sou latè, ak tout moun. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Tout sa ki te sou tè sèk la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref></char></note>ki te gen souf lavi nan nen yo te vin mouri. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Konsa Li te efase chak bagay ki t ap viv sou fas tè a, soti nan lòm jis rive nan tout bèt, sou sa ki te kouri atè, ak zwazo latè yo. Konsa yo te efase soti sou tè la nèt, e se sèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat 24:38-39</ref> </char></note>Noé ki te rete ansanm avèk sila ki te avèk li nan lach la.<verse eid="GEN 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Dlo a te monte kouvri tout tè a pandan san-senkant jou.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>E Bondye te sonje Noé avèk tout bèt ki te avèk li nan lach la. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Egz 14:21</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè yon van pase sou tè a, e dlo yo te vin bese.<verse eid="GEN 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 7:11">Jen 7:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sous nan fon yo te vin fèmen. Pòtay lapli nan syèl la te fèmen, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:4-12">Jen 7:4-12</ref></char></note>lapli ki te sòti nan syèl la te sispann. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Dlo a te bese ofiramezi sou tè a. E apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:24">Jen 7:24</ref></char></note>san-senkant jou, dlo a te vin mwens.<verse eid="GEN 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Nan setyèm mwa, nan dis-setyèm jou nan mwa a, lach la te vin poze sou mòn Ararat la. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Dlo a te bese toujou jis nan dizyèm mwa a. Nan dizyèm mwa, nan premye jou mwa a, tèt mòn yo te vin vizib.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè karant jou yo fin pase, Noé te ouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:16">Jen 6:16</ref></char></note>fenèt lach la, ke li te fè a. <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>Konsa, li te voye deyò yon kònèy zwazo nwa ki te vole de yon kote a lòt jiskaske dlo a te vin seche sou tè a. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Epi li te voye deyò yon toutrèl sòti kote li, pou wè si dlo a te bese sou fas tè a, <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>men toutrèl la pa t jwenn plas repo pou plante pye li, e li te retounen kote li nan lach la, paske dlo a te sou fas tout tè a. Alò, li te lonje men l deyò, li te pran l, e li te fè l antre nan lach la vè li menm.<verse eid="GEN 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Li te tann pou yon lòt sèt jou ankò, e li te revoye toutrèl la soti nan lach la. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Toutrèl la te vin kote l vè aswè, e gade byen, nan bèk li te gen yon fèy bwa doliv byen fre. Konsa Noé te konnen ke dlo a te bese sou tè a.<verse eid="GEN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Alò, li te tann pou youn lòt sèt jou. Li te revoye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:28">Jr 48:28</ref> </char></note>toutrèl la, e li pa t retounen kote li ankò.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6">Jen 7:6</ref></char></note>sis-san-en ane, nan premye mwa, dlo a te fin seche kite tè a. Konsa, Noé te retire kouvèti lach la. Li te gade, e gade byen, sifas tè a te vin sèch. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Nan dezyèm mwa, nan venn-sèt jou nan mwa a, tè a te sèch.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Alò, Bondye te pale avèk Noé. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>Sòti nan lach la, ou menm avèk madanm ou, fis ou yo, avèk madanm a fis ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Mete deyò avèk ou tout chè vivan ki avèk ou, zwazo, animal, ak tout bèt sila yo ki kouri atè, pou yo kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:22-28">Jen 1:22-28</ref> </char></note>kouple anpil sou latè, pou vin fekon, e miltipliye anpil sou tè a.<verse eid="GEN 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Alò, Noé te sòti, ak fis li yo avèk madanm li, e madanm a fis li yo. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Chak bèt, chak reptil ki kouri atè, e chak zwazo, tout bagay ki fè mouvman sou latè yo, te sòti nan lach la selon espès pa yo.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Konsa, Noé te bati yon lotèl pou SENYÈ a. Li te pran chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:2">Jen 7:2</ref></char></note>bèt ki pwòp, ak chak zwazo ki pwòp, e li te ofri sakrifis ki te brile sou lotèl la.<verse eid="GEN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>SENYÈ a te pran sant dous la. Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Li menm: “Mwen p ap janm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:9">És 54:9</ref></char></note>modi tè a ankò akoz lòm, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Jen 6:5</ref></char></note>lentansyon kè li se lemal depi li te jèn. Ni mwen p ap janm detwi ankò chak bagay vivan jan Mwen te fè a.<verse eid="GEN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>“Pandan tè a la a, lè semans avèk rekòlt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:17">Sòm 74:17</ref></char></note>fredi avèk chalè, sezon chalè ak livè, lajounen avèk lannwit p ap janm sispann.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Konsa, Bondye te beni Noé avèk fis li yo. Li te di yo: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Jen 1:28</ref></char></note>Se pou nou vin fekon, miltipliye, e ranpli latè. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Lakrent nou, ak laperèz nou va vini sou chak bèt latè, ak chak zwazo syèl la. Tout bagay ki kouri atè, ak tout pwason lanmè, tout livre nan men nou. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Chak bagay ki fè mouvman e ki vivan va sèvi kòm manje pou nou. Mwen bannou tout, jan Mwen te bay plant vèt la.<verse eid="GEN 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>“Sèlman, nou pa pou manje chè avèk lavi li, sa vle di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:26">Lev 7:26</ref> </char></note>san li. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Anverite, Mwen va egzije san lavi a paske se pa m. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:28-29">Egz 21:28-29</ref></char></note>Menm soti nan chak bèt Mwen va egzije li. Epi sou chak òm, sou frè a chak òm, Mwen va egzije lavi a yon moun.<verse eid="GEN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:12-14">Egz 21:12-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nenpòt moun ki vèse san lòm, pa lòm san pa l va vèse, paske nan imaj a Bondye, Li te fè lòm. <verse eid="GEN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Epi pou nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:1">Jen 9:1</ref></char></note>se pou nou vin fekon, e miltipliye. Peple tè a anpil, e miltipliye ladann.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Alò, Bondye te pale avèk Noé ak fis li yo avè l. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:18">Jen 6:18</ref></char></note>Mwen menm, Mwen vin etabli akò Mwen avèk nou, e avèk desandan aprè nou yo, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>epi avèk chak kreyati vivan ki avè w: zwazo, bèt kay yo, ak chak bèt ki sou latè avèk nou, tout sa ki sòti nan lach la, menm chak bèt sou tè a.<verse eid="GEN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>“Mwen etabli akò Mwen avèk nou: Tout chè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:21">Jen 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:9">És 54:9</ref></char></note>p ap janm koupe ankò pa dlo delij, ni p ap gen delij ankò pou detwi tè a.”<verse eid="GEN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Bondye te di: “Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:13-17">Jen 9:13-17</ref> </char></note>sign akò ke m ap fè antre Mwen avèk nou, e avèk chak kreyati vivan ki la avèk nou, jis rive pou tout jenerasyon k ap vini yo. <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>Mwen mete lakansyèl Mwen nan nwaj la, epi l ap sèvi kòm yon sign pou akò antre Mwen menm avèk latè a. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Li va rive ke lè m mennen yon nwaj sou latè, ke lakansyèl la ap vizib nan nwaj la, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:42-45">Lev 26:42-45</ref> </char></note>Mwen va sonje akò ki antre Mwen menm avèk nou an, avèk chak kreyati vivan de tout chè. Epi janmen ankò dlo p ap vin yon delij pou detwi tout chè.<verse eid="GEN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>“Lè lakansyèl la nan nwaj la, Mwen va gade sou li, pou m sonje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:13-19">Jen 17:13-19</ref> </char></note>akò ki jis pou tout tan antre Bondye ak tout kreyati vivan pou tout chè ki sou latè yo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Epi Bondye te di a Noé: “Sa se sign akò ke Mwen te etabli antre Mwen ak tout chè ki rete sou tè a.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Alò, fis Noé yo ki te soti nan lach la se te Sem, Cham, ak Japhet. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:25-27">Jen 9:25-27</ref></char></note>Cham te papa Canaan. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Twa sila yo se te fis Noé yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:1-7">Jen 9:1-7</ref> </char></note>nan twa sila yo tout tè a te vin peple.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Alò, Noé te kòmanse kiltive tè a. Li te plante yon chan rezen. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Li te bwè diven, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Pwov 20:1</ref> </char></note>vin sou. Konsa li te dekouvri kò li anndan tant li an.<verse eid="GEN 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Cham, papa Canaan nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:15">Hab 2:15</ref></char></note>te wè papa li toutouni, e li te pale sa a frè l yo deyò a.<verse eid="GEN 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Men Sem avèk Japhet te pran yon abiman, yo te mete li sou chak zepòl li, e yo te mache an aryè pou kouvri nidite papa yo. Figi yo te vire akote pou yo pa wè nidite li.<verse eid="GEN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Lè Noé te leve nan dòmi aprè diven an, li te konnen sa ke pi jenn fis li a te fè l la. <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>Konsa li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:16">Det 27:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“ Canaan se modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 9:23">Jos 9:23</ref> </char>
    </note> Se sèvitè l ap ye anvè frè li yo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Li te di osi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:20">Jen 14:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye a Cham nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">Canaan va sèvitè li.<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:2-5">Jen 10:2-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ke Bondye agrandi Japhet.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Kite li viv nan tant Sem yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Kite Canaan vin sèvitè li.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Noé te viv twa-san-senkant ane aprè delij la. <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Alò, tout jou a Noé yo te nèf-san-senkant ane, e li te mouri.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Alò, sa yo se achiv a jenerasyon yo pou Cham, Sem, ak Japhet, fis Noé yo. Fis te ne pou yo apre delij la.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:5-7">I Kor 1:5-7</ref> </char>
    </note>Fis a Japhet yo te Gomer, Magog, Madaï, Javan, Tubal, Méschec, ak Tiras.<verse eid="GEN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Fis Gomer yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:27">Jr 51:27</ref> </char></note>Aschkenaz, Riphat avèk Togarma.<verse eid="GEN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Fis Javan yo te Elischa, Tarsis, Kittim, ak Dodanim.<verse eid="GEN 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Depi nasyon sila a peyi kot yo te divize nan teritwa pa yo, yo chak selon langaj yo, selon fanmi pa yo, nan pwòp nasyon pa yo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 1:8-10">I Kwo 1:8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Cham yo te Cush, Mitsraïm, Puth, avèk Canaan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Fis a Cush yo te Saba, Havila, Saba, Raema avèk Sabteca. Fis a Raema yo te Séba avèk Dedan.<verse eid="GEN 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Cush te fè osi Nimrod. Li te kòmanse vin pwisan sou latè. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Li te yon nonm fò nan fè lachas devan SENYÈ a. Akoz sa yo abitye di: “tankou Nimrod, yon nonm fò nan lachas devan SENYÈ a”.<verse eid="GEN 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Kòmansman wayòm li an te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:9">Jen 11:9</ref></char></note>Babel, Érec, Accad, avèk Cainé nan peyi a Schinear yo. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>De teritwa sila a, li te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:6">Mi 5:6</ref></char></note>nan Assur, e li te bati Ninive avèk Rehoboth-Hur, Calach, <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>Avèk Résen antre Ninive e Calach, ki se gran vil la.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Mitsraïm te devni papa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:9">Jr 46:9</ref> </char></note>Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim ak Naphtuhim. <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>Avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:12">I Kwo 1:12</ref> </char></note>Patrusim ak Casluhim (kote Filisten yo te sòti a) avèk Caphtorim.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Canaan te vin papa Sidon ki te premye ne a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3">Jen 23:3</ref></char></note>Heth; <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:19-21">Jen 15:19-21</ref></char></note>Jebizyen yo avèk Amoreyen yo, ak Gigazyen yo, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>Evyen yo, Akyen yo, avèk Sinyen yo, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>avèk Avadyen yo, Tsemaryen yo, Amatyen yo, e apre, fanmi Canaran an te gaye toupatou.<verse eid="GEN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 34:2-12">Nonb 34:2-12</ref> </char>
    </note>Teritwa Canaan an te sòti depi Sidon pou pwoche Guérar, jis rive Gaza, kote lè nou pwoche Sodome ak Gomorrhe, avèk Adma ak Tseboïm jis Léscha.<verse eid="GEN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Sa yo se fis Cham yo selon fanmi pa yo, selon langaj yo, selon teritwa yo, selon nasyon pa yo.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Osi a Sem, papa a tout pitit Héber yo, e pi gran frè pou Japhet te fè pitit. <verse eid="GEN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Fis a Sem yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:1-9">Jen 14:1-9</ref> </char></note>Élam, Assur, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:10">Jen 11:10</ref> </char></note>Arpacschad, Lud, avèk Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Fis Aram yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1">Job 1:1</ref> </char></note>Uts, Hul, Guéter avèk Masch.<verse eid="GEN 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Arpacschad te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:12">Jen 11:12</ref></char></note>Schélach, epi Schélach te fè Héber.<verse eid="GEN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 1:19">I Kwo 1:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, te ne a Héber de fis: non a youn te Péleg, paske nan jou pa l la latè te divize. Epi frè l la te rele Jokthan.<verse eid="GEN 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Jokthan te vin papa Almonad ak Schéleph, Hatsarmaveth, Jrach, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>Hadoram, Uzal, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>Obal, Abimaël, Séba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>Ophir, Havila ak Jbab. Tout sa yo te fis pou Jokthan. <verse eid="GEN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Alò andwa kote yo te rete te rive jis nan Méscha lè nou ale vè Sephar, teritwa mòn lès la.<verse eid="GEN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Men sila ki se fis Sem yo, selon fanmi pa yo, selon langaj yo, selon teritwa yo, selon nasyon yo.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Sila yo se fanmi a fis Noé yo selon jenerasyon yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:19">Jen 9:19</ref></char></note>selon nasyon pa yo. Konsa, depi nan sa yo, nasyon yo te separe sou latè apre delij la.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Alò, tout latè te sèvi avèk menm lang avèk menm mo. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Konsa, li te rive ke pandan yo t ap vwayaje vè lès, ke yo te twouve yon gran plèn nan peyi ki rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:10">Jen 10:10</ref></char></note>Schinear, e yo te vin rete la.<verse eid="GEN 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Yo te di youn ak lòt: “Vini, annou fè brik e brile yo byen brile.” Epi yo te sèvi ak brik pou wòch, e yo te sèvi ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:10">Jen 14:10</ref></char></note>azfòt kòm mòtye. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Yo te di: “Vini, annou bati yon gran vil pou pwòp tèt nou, avèk yon kay wo tou won avèk yon twati ki va lonje rive jis nan syèl la. Konsa, annou fè pou pwòp tèt nou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:4">Jen 6:4</ref></char></note> gran non, sof ke sa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:27">Det 4:27</ref></char></note>va vin gaye toupatou sou tout sifas tè a.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:21">Jen 18:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a te vin desann pou wè gran vil avèk kay wo tou won ke fis a lòm yo te fè a. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Senyè a te di: “Gade byen, se yon sèl pèp yo ye, e yo tout gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:1">Jen 11:1</ref></char></note>menm lang, epi men sa ke yo kòmanse fè. Konsa, nenpòt sa yo eseye fè, yo p ap anpeche. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Vini, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Jen 1:26</ref></char></note>annou desann e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:49">Det 28:49</ref></char></note>konfonn langaj yo pou yo pa konprann lang youn lòt.”<verse eid="GEN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:4">Jen 11:4</ref></char></note>gaye yo toupatou sou tout tè a, e yo te sispann bati gran vil la. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Pou koz sa a, yo te rele non vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:10">Jen 10:10</ref></char></note>Babel, akoz ke se la, SENYÈ a te konfonn langaj yo nan tout latè. Depi la, SENYÈ a te gaye yo toupatou sifas a tout tè a.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:22-25">Jen 10:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sa yo se te achiv pou tout jenerasyon a Sem yo. Sem te gen laj santan, lè l te vin papa a Arpacschad, dez ane apre delij la. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Epi Sem te viv senk-santane apre li te vin papa a Arpacschad. Li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Arpacschad te viv trant-senk ane, lè l te vin papa a Schélach. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Konsa, Arpacschad te viv kat-san-twa lane apre li te vin papa a Schélach, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Schélach te viv trantan, e li te vin papa a Héber; <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>epi Schélach te viv kat-san-twazane apre li te vin papa a Héber. Li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Héber te viv pandan trant-kat ane, lè l te devni papa a Péleg; <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>epi konsa, Héber te viv pandan kat-san-trant ane apre li te vin papa a Péleg, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Péleg te viv pandan trant ane, lè l te vin papa a Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Konsa, Péleg te viv pandan de-san-nèf ane apre li te vin papa a Rehu, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Rehu te viv pandan trant-de ane, lè l te vin papa a Serug. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Rehu te viv pandan de-san-sèt ane apre li te vin papa a Serug, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Serug te viv pandan trant ane lè l te vin papa a Nachor. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Epi Serug te viv de-san ane apre li te vin papa a Nachor, e li te fè lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Nachor te viv pandan vent-nèf ane, e li te vin papa a Térach; <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>epi Nachor te viv san-diz-nèf ane apre li te vin papa a Térach, e li te gen lòt fis ak fi.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Térach te viv swasann-dis ane, e li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:2">Jos 24:2</ref></char></note>papa a Abram, Nachor, ak Haran.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Alò sa yo se achiv pou tout jenerasyon a Térach yo. Térach te vin papa Abram, Nachor, avèk Haran.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Haran te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:10">Jen 13:10</ref></char></note>Lot. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Haran te mouri nan prezans papa li, Térach nan peyi nesans li, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref></char></note>Ur pou Kaldeyen yo. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Abram avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:10">Jen 24:10</ref></char></note>Nachor te pran madanm yo pou yo menm. Non a madanm Abram nan se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Jen 17:5</ref></char></note>Saraï, e non a madanm Nachor a se te Milca, fi a Haran an, papa a Milcah avèk Jisca. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:1">Jen 16:1</ref></char></note>Saraï te esteril. Li pa t fè pitit.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Térach te pran Abram, fis li a, e Lot, fis Haran an, pitit a pitit li, ak Saraï, bèlfi li, madanm a Abram, fis li. Konsa, yo te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:7">Jen 15:7</ref></char></note>Ur a Kaldeyen yo ansanm, pou yo ta kapab antre nan peyi Canaan an. Yo te ale jis rive Haran, e yo te rete la.<verse eid="GEN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Jou a Térach yo te de-san-senk ane. Térach te vin mouri Haran.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:7">Jen 15:7</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te di a Abram: “Sòti nan peyi ou ak fanmi ou yo, ak lakay papa ou, pou ale vè yon peyi ke Mwen va montre nou. <verse eid="GEN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:5">Det 26:5</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè ou vin yon gran nasyon. Mwen va beni ou, e fè non ou vin gran. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:13">Za 8:13</ref></char></note>Ou va yon benediksyon. <verse eid="GEN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Mwen va beni sila yo ki beni ou, e sila ki modi ou yo, Mwen va modi yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:13">Jen 22:13</ref></char></note>Konsa, nan ou, tout fanmi sou latè yo va beni.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Alò, Abram te sòti jan SENYÈ a te pale l la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:27-31">Jen 11:27-31</ref> </char></note>Lot te ale avè l. Abram te gen laj swasann-kenz ane lè li te kite Haran. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Abram te pran Saraï madanm li avèk Lot, neve li, ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:6">Jen 13:6</ref></char></note>zafè yo ke yo te ranmase avèk moun ke yo te vin genyen nan Haran, e yo te pati pou peyi Canaan an. Konsa yo te rive Canaan.<verse eid="GEN 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Abram te pase nan peyi a jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:4">Jen 35:4</ref></char></note>Sichem, nan chenn Moré yo. Alò nan tan sa a, Kanaaneyen yo te nan peyi a.<verse eid="GEN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">Jen 17:1</ref></char></note>te parèt a Abram. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:5">Jen 13:5</ref></char></note>A desandan ou yo, Mwen va bay peyi sila a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:7">Alò, li te bati yon lotèl nan plas kote SENYÈ a te parèt a li a.<verse eid="GEN 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Alò, li te kontinye depi la nan mòn nan, nan lès Béthel. Li te monte tant li, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:9-12">Jos 8:9-12</ref> </char></note>Béthel nan lwès, ak Aï nan lès. La li te bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a, e li te rele non a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Abram te vwayaje toujou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:1-3">Jen 13:1-3</ref></char></note>Negev. <verse eid="GEN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Alò te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:1">Jen 26:1</ref></char></note>gwo grangou nan peyi a, ki fè Abram desann an Égypte pou pase yon tan, akoz gwo grangou a te tèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:1">Jen 43:1</ref></char></note>di nan peyi a.<verse eid="GEN 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Li te rive ke lè li te rive toupre Égypte, li te di a Saraï, madanm li: “Gade, mwen konnen ke ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:7">Jen 26:7</ref></char></note>yon fanm ki tèlman bèl! <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:11">Jen 20:11</ref></char></note>Lè Ejipsyen yo wè ou, yo va di: ‘Sa se madanm li.’ Konsa, yo va touye mwen, men yo va kite ou viv. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Souple, di ke se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2-12">Jen 20:2-12</ref> </char></note>sè mwen ou ye, pou sa ale byen pou mwen, e pou mwen kapab viv akoz ou menm.”<verse eid="GEN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Li te vin rive ke lè Abram te antre Égypte, ke Ejipsyen yo te wè ke fanm nan te byen bèl. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Ofisyèl Farawon yo te wè li e te pote lwanj li bay Farawon. Konsa, yo te pran fanm nan fè l antre lakay Farawon an. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Pou sa li te trete Abram byen pou koz li. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:2">Jen 13:2</ref></char></note>te bay li mouton avèk bèf kabwa avèk bourik, ak sèvitè, ni mal ni femèl, ak femèl bourik avèk chamo.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Men SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:18">Jen 20:18</ref></char></note>frape Farawon avèk gwo malè yo akoz Saraï, madanm Abram nan.<verse eid="GEN 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Epi Farawon te rele Abram. Li te di li: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:9-10">Jen 20:9-10</ref> </char></note>Kisa ou fè m la a? Poukisa ou pa t di mwen ke li te madanm ou? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Poukisa ou te di: Li se sè m, pou m te pran l kòm madanm mwen? Alò, men madanm ou, pran l ale.”<verse eid="GEN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Farawon te kòmande mesye pa l yo konsènan li, epi yo te akonpanye l ale, avèk madanm li, ak tout bagay ki te pou li yo.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Alò, Abram te monte kite Égypte vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:9">Jen 12:9</ref></char></note>Negev, li menm avèk madanm li, ak tout bagay ki te pou li, e Lot te avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Epi Abram te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:35">Jen 24:35</ref></char></note>trè rich nan bèt, lajan ak nan lò.<verse eid="GEN 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Li te fè vwayaj li yo ki sòti Negev pou rive jis Béthel, nan plas kote tant li a te ye nan kòmansman an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:8">Jen 12:8</ref></char></note>antre Béthel avèk Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>jis rive nan plas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7-8">Jen 12:7-8</ref> </char></note>lotèl ke li te fè la oparavan an. Epi la Abram te rele non SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:5">Jen 12:5</ref></char></note>Lot, ki te ale avèk Abram, osi te gen bann mouton, twoupo, avèk tant.<verse eid="GEN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Epi tè a pa t kapab sipòte yo toude pou rete ansanm, paske byen yo te tèlman gran ke yo pa t kab rete ansanm.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:7">Jen 36:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Epi te gen konfli antre bèje bèt Abram, ak bèje bèt Lot yo. Epi te gen Kanaaneyen yo avèk Ferezyen yo ki te rete nan peyi a.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:18">Pwov 15:18</ref> </char>
    </note>Alò, Abram te di a Lot: “Silvouplè, pa kite gen konfli antre ou avèk mwen, ni antre bèje pa m ak bèje pa w, paske se frè nou ye. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Èske se pa tout tè a ki pou ou? Silvouplè, annou separe. Si se vè agoch, mwen menm, mwen va ale adwat. Oswa si se adwat, mwen menm, mwen va ale agoch.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Lot te leve zye li, e li te wè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:3">Det 34:3</ref> </char></note>vale Jourdain an ke li te byen wouze. Sa se te avan SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Jen 19:24</ref> </char></note>detwi Sodome avèk Gomorrhe. Li te tankou jaden SENYÈ a, tankou peyi Égypte la lè ou ale vè Zoar. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Konsa, Lot te chwazi pou li menm tout vale Jourdain an, e Lot te vwayaje vè lès. Konsa yo te separe youn ak lòt.<verse eid="GEN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Abram te vin rete nan tè Canaan an, pandan Lot te vin rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:2">Jen 14:2</ref></char></note>gran vil yo nan vale a, e li te deplase tant li yo jis rive Sodome.<verse eid="GEN 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Jen 18:20</ref></char></note>mesye Sodome yo te mechan anpil, e yo te fè peche depase kont SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>SENYÈ a te di a Abram lè Lot fin kite l la: “Koulye a leve ze ou pou gade depi plas la kote ou ye a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:14">Jen 28:14</ref> </char></note>vè nò, vè sid, vè lès ak lwès. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref></char></note>Paske tout peyi ke ou wè a, Mwen va ba ou li, ak desandan ou yo pou tout tan.<verse eid="GEN 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>“Mwen va fè desandan ou yo peple <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:10">Jen 16:10</ref></char></note>tankou pousyè tè, pou si okenn moun pa kapab kontwole pousyè tè a, konsa yo p ap kapab osi kontwole desandan ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Leve, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:17-24">Nonb 13:17-24</ref> </char></note>mache toupatou nan peyi a nan longè li avèk lajè li; paske Mwen va ba ou li”.<verse eid="GEN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Epi Abram te deplase tant li an, li te vin rete akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:13">Jen 14:13</ref></char></note>bwatchenn Mamré yo ki an Hébron, e la li te bati yon lotèl bay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Li te rive nan jou Amraphel yo, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:10">Jen 10:10</ref></char></note>Schinear a, ke Arjoc, wa Ellasar a, Kedorlaomer, wa Élam nan, avèk Tideal, wa Gojim nan, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>ke yo te vin fè lagè avèk Béra, wa Sodome nan, e avèk Birscha, wa Gomorrhe a, Schineab, wa Adma a, ak Schémbeébern wa Tseboïm nan, avèk wa a Béla a, ki se Tsoar.<verse eid="GEN 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Tout sila yo te vini nan yon alyans nan vale Siddim nan (sa vle di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:12">Nonb 34:12</ref> </char></note>Lanmè Sèl la). <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Pandan douz ane yo te sèvi Kedorlaomer, men nan trèzyèm ane a, yo te revòlte.<verse eid="GEN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Nan katòzyèm ane a, Kedorlaomer ak wa ki te avè l yo, te vin bat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 3:13">13</ref></char></note>Rephaïm nan Ashterothkarnaim, Zuzim lan nan Ham, avèk Émim nan Schavé-Kirjathaïm. <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>Avèk Oryen yo nan mòn pa yo nan Séir jiska distans rive nan Al-Paran, ki touprè dezè a. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Epi yo vin retounen rive nan En-Mischpath, (ki se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:26">Nonb 13:26</ref></char></note>Kadès), e yo te bat Amalesit yo nan tout peyi yo, e osi Amoreyen ki te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:2">II Kwo 20:2</ref></char></note>Hatsatson-Thamar yo.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Epi wa Sodome nan avèk wa Gomorrhe a avèk wa Adma ak wa Tseboïm nan, e wa Béla a, (ki se Tsoar); te vin parèt. Yo ranje yo pou fè batay kont yo nan vale Siddim nan, <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>kont Kedorlaomer wa Élam nan, Tideal, wa Gojim nan, Amraphel, wa Schinear nan, ak Arjoc, wa Ellasar a; kat wa kont senk.<verse eid="GEN 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Alò, vale Siddim nan te ranpli avèk fon azfòt yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-22">Jen 14:17-22</ref> </char></note>wa Sodome avèk Gomorrhe yo te sove ale, e kèk tonbe la. Men sila ki te chape yo te sove ale, rive nan tèt mòn yo.<verse eid="GEN 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Yo te pran tout byen Sodome avèk Gomorrhe yo avèk tout manje yo te genyen, e yo te pati. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Anplis, yo te pran Lot, neve a Abram nan avèk tout byen li, e yo te pati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:12">Jen 13:12</ref></char></note>paske li t ap viv Sodome.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Alò, yon moun ki te sove ale te vin di Abram, Ebre a, tout sa. Alò, li t ap viv bò kote chenn Mamré yo, Amoreyen sila a, frè Eschcol e frè Aner, ki te fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:27-32">Jen 21:27-32</ref> </char></note>alyans avèk Abram.<verse eid="GEN 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Lè Abram te tande ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:12">Jen 14:12</ref> </char></note>moun fanmi li te pran an kaptivite, li te Mennen dèzòm ki te enstwi, twa-san-diz-uit òm ki te elve nan kay li pou te pouswiv yo jis rive nan Dan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:16">Jij 7:16</ref></char></note>Li te divize ekip li yo kont yo nan lannwit. Epi li avèk sèvitè li yo te bat yo, e yo te kouri dèyè yo jis rive Choba, ki nan nò Damas la. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Li te mennen fè retounen tout byen yo. Anplis, li te mennen tounen moun fanmi li an, Lot, avèk byen pa l, fanm, avèk lòt moun yo.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Apre Abram te sòti nan masak Kédorlaomer ak wa ki te avè l yo, wa Sodome nan te sòti pou rankontre l nan vale Schavé a, (sa vle di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:18">II Sam 18:18</ref></char></note> Vale a Wa a).<verse eid="GEN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Eb 7:1-10</ref></char></note>Melchisédek, wa Salèm nan te mennen pote pen avèk diven. Alò li menm se te yon prèt a Bondye Pi Wo a. <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>Li te beni li, e te di: “Beni, se Abram a Bondye Pi Wo a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:22">Jen 14:22</ref></char></note>Mèt Syèl la ak tè a. <verse eid="GEN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Beniswa Bondye Pi Wo a, ki te lage lènmi yo nan men ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 14:20">Abram te bay li yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:4">Eb 7:4</ref></char></note>dim de tout bagay.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Wa Sodome nan te di Abram: “Ban mwen moun yo, e ou mèt pran byen yo pou ou menm.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Abram te di a Wa Sodome nan: “Mwen te sèmante a Senyè Bondye Pi Wo a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Sòm 24:1</ref></char></note> Mèt sou syèl la avèk tè a, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>ke mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:16">II Wa 5:16</ref></char></note>p ap pran menm yon fisèl oswa yon sandal, ni yon las, ni anyen ki pou ou, akoz laperèz ke ou ta di ‘se ou ki fè Abram vin rich’. <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Mwen p ap pran anyen sof ke sa ke jennonm yo te manje, ak pòsyon pou mesye ki te ale avè m yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:13">Jen 14:13</ref></char></note>Aner, Eschcol, avèk Mamré; kite yo pran pòsyon pa yo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Abram nan yon vizyon. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:17">Jen 21:17</ref></char></note>Pa pè, Abram, Mwen se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:29">Det 33:29</ref></char></note>pwotèj pou ou. Rekonpans ou va gran.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Abram te di: “O Senyè BONDYE, kisa ou va ban mwen, akoz ke m san pitit, e eritye lakay mwen se Eliézer a Danmas?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Epi Abram te di: “Akoz ke ou pa t ban m pitit pou swiv mwen, pitit ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Jen 14:14</ref></char></note>fèt nan kay mwen an se eritye mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Alò, gade byen, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote li. Li te di l: “Se pa nonm sa k ap eritye ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:28">Gal 4:28</ref></char></note>men youn ki va sòti nan pwòp kò ou, se li ki va eritye ou.”<verse eid="GEN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Konsa, li te mennen li deyò, e te di: “Koulye a, gade vè syèl yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Jen 22:17</ref></char></note>kontwole zetwal yo, si ou kapab kontwole yo.” Epi Li te di li: “Se konsa desandan w ap ye.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Wo 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 4:20-22">20-22</ref> </char>
    </note>Li te kwè nan SENYÈ a, e SENYÈ a konsa, te konsidere sa kòm ladwati li.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Li te di Abram: “Mwen se SENYÈ a ki te mennen ou sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:31">Jn 11:31</ref></char></note>Ur a Kaldeyen yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:15-17">Jen 13:15-17</ref></char></note>bay ou peyi sa a pou posede li.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Abram te di: “O Senyè BONDYE, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:36-40">Jij 6:36-40</ref></char></note>kijan mwen kapab konnen ke m ap genyen l vrè?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Alò li te di li: “Pote ban mwen yon gazèl twazan, yon femèl kabrit twzan, yon mal mouton nan twzan, yon toutrèl, avèk yon jenn pijon.”<verse eid="GEN 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Li te pote bay li tout sa yo, e li te koupe yo an de moso. Li te poze mwatye yo chak fasafas ak lòt, men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:17">Lev 1:17</ref> </char></note>pa t koupe zwazo yo. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Zwazo ki manje vyann yo te desann sou kò bèt yo, e Abram te chase yo ale.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Alò, lè solèy la t ap desann, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21">Jen 2:21</ref></char></note>yon gran rèv te tonbe sou Abram. Epi gade byen, yon gwo tenèb ak gran perèz te vin tonbe sou li.<verse eid="GEN 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Bondye te di Abram: “Konnen byen si ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:6">Trav 7:6</ref> </char></note>desandan ou yo va etranje nan yon peyi ki pa pou yo, kote yo va vin esklav, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:11">Egz 1:11</ref> </char></note>va oprime pandan kat-san ane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Men mwen va osi jije nasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:32-38">Egz 12:32-38</ref></char></note> ke yo va sèvi a, e apre yo va sòti deyò avèk anpil byen. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Men pou ou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:8">Jen 25:8</ref></char></note>ou va ale vè zansèt ou yo anpè. Ou va antere nan yon laj byen avanse. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Alò, nan katriyèm jenerasyon yo va retounen isit la, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:24-28">Lev 18:24-28</ref></char></note>inikite Amoreyen yo poko fini.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Li vin rive ke lè solèy la te fin desann, ke li te fènwa anpil, e gade byen, te parèt yon tòch k ap fè lafimen avèk yon flanbo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:18-19">Jr 34:18-19</ref> </char></note>pase antre mòso sa yo.<verse eid="GEN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Nan jou sa a, SENYÈ a te fè yon akò avèk Abram. Li te di: “A desandan ou yo, Mwen va bay peyi sa a, depi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:1-15">Nonb 34:1-15</ref> </char></note>larivyè Égypte la, jis rive nan gran rivyè a, larivyè Euphrate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:17">Egz 3:17</ref> </char></note>peyi a Kenyen yo, Kenizyen yo, Kadmonyen yo, <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>Itit yo, Ferezyen yo, Rephaïm yo, <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>Amoreyen yo, Kanaaneyen yo, Gigachyen yo, avèk Jebisyen yo.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:30">Jen 11:30</ref> </char></note>Saraï, madanm Abram nan pa t bay li pitit. Li te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:16">Jen 12:16</ref> </char></note>sèvant Ejipsyen ki te rele Agar. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Konsa, Saraï te di Abram: “Alò, gade byen, SENYÈ a te anpeche m fè pitit. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:3-10">Jen 30:3-10</ref> </char></note>Souple, al jwenn sèvant mwen an. Petèt mwen kapab vin gen pitit pa li menm.” Epi Abram te koute vwa a Saraï.<verse eid="GEN 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Apre Abram te viv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Jen 12:4</ref></char></note>dis lane nan peyi Canaan, madanm Abram nan, Saraï te pran Agar, sèvant Ejipsyen li an, e te bay li a mari li Abram kòm madanm li. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Li te al jwenn Agar, li te vin ansent, epi lè l te wè ke li te ansent, mètrès li a te vin meprize nan zye li.<verse eid="GEN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Konsa, Saraï te di Abram: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:35">Jr 51:35</ref> </char></note>Se ou ki gen tò nan bagay sa a. Mwen te bay sèvant mwen an pou li antre nan bra ou, e lè l te wè ke li te vin ansent, mwen te vin meprize nan zye li. Ke SENYÈ a jije antre ou menm avèk mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Men Abram te di a Saraï: “Gade byen, sèvant ou anba pouvwa ou. Fè sa ke ou wè ki bon nan zye ou avèk li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:6">Pou sa, Saraï te rèd avèk li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:9">Jen 16:9</ref> </char></note>li te pran sove ale kite prezans li.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:17-18">Jen 21:17-18</ref> </char></note>zanj lan te twouve li akote yon sous dlo nan savann nan, vè sous la nan wout chemen ki ale Schur la. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Li te di a Agar, sèvant Saraï a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:9">Jen 3:9</ref></char></note>“Kibò ou sòti, e kibò ou prale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Epi li te di: “M ap sove ale kite prezans mètrès mwen an, Saraï.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Epi zanj SENYÈ a te di li: “Retounen bò kote mètrès ou, e soumèt ou anba otorite l.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Plis ke sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:15-18">Jen 22:15-18</ref></char></note>zanj SENYÈ a te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:20">Jen 17:20</ref></char></note>“Mwen va miltipliye desandan ou yo anpil pou yo vin twòp pou konte.”<verse eid="GEN 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Zanj SENYÈ a te di li anplis: “Byen gade, ou ansent, e ou va fè yon fis. Epi ou va rele non li Ismaël ki vle di Bondye tande, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23-24">Egz 2:23-24</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te okipe afliksyon ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Li va yon nonm tankou bourik mawon. Men li va kont tout moun, e men a tout moun va kont li. Epi li va viv yon jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:18">Jen 25:18</ref></char></note>ki kont tout frè li yo.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Epi li te rele non SENYÈ a ki te pale avèk li: “Ou se yon Bondye ki wè a”, paske li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:20">Jen 32:20</ref></char></note>Èske m ap vrèman rete vivan isit lè m fin wè Li”? <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Pou sa, pwi a te rele Lachaï-roi. Gade byen, li la antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:7">Jen 14:7</ref></char></note>Kadès ak Bared.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Alò, Agar te fè yon fis pou Abram. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Jen 12:4</ref></char></note>E Abram te rele fis li a, ke Agar te fè a, Ismaël. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Abram te gen katre-ven-sis ane lè Agar te fè Ismaël pou li a.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Alò, lè Abram te gen laj katre-ven-sèz ane, SENYÈ a te parèt a Abram. Li te di li: “Mwen menm se Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:3">Jen 28:3</ref></char></note>Toupwisan an. Mache devan mwen, e rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:9">Jen 6:9</ref></char></note>san fot. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Mwen va etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>akò Mwen antre Mwen ak Ou, e Mwen va miltipliye ou anpil, anpil.”<verse eid="GEN 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Abram te tonbe atè sou figi li. Bondye te pale avèk li, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Jen 17:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Pou Mwen, koute byen, akò Mwen avè ou a. Ou va papa a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:11">Jen 35:11</ref></char></note>gran kantite nasyon. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Yo p ap rele ou Abram ankò, men non ou va Abraham, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Wo 4:17</ref> </char></note>Mwen ap fè ou papa a yon gran kantite nasyon.<verse eid="GEN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>“M ap fè ou bay anpil fwi, Mwen va fè nasyon yo avè w, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:16">Jen 17:16</ref></char></note>wa yo va soti nan ou menm.<verse eid="GEN 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>“Mwen va etabli akò Mwen antre Mwen ak ou, e desandan ou yo selon tout jenerasyon pa yo kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:13">Jen 17:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 17:19">19</ref></char></note>akò k ap pou tout tan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:24">Jen 26:24</ref></char></note>pou M rete kòm Bondye pou ou ak desandan apre ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>“Mwen va ba ou avèk desandan ou yo peyi kote nou vwayaje yo, tout tè Canaan an, kòm yon posesyon k ap pou tout tan, epi Mwen va Bondye pa yo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Bondye te di anplis a Abraham: “Koulye a pou ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Egz 19:5</ref></char></note>ou va kenbe akò Mwen an, ou menm avèk desandan apre ou yo pou tout jenerasyon. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:22">Jn 7:22</ref></char></note>Sa se akò Mwen, ke nou va kenbe antre Mwen ak nou menm, e desandan apre nou yo: chak mal pami nou va vin sikonsi.<verse eid="GEN 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>“ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:48">Egz 12:48</ref></char></note>“Nou va sikonsi nan chè sou avan chè nou, e sa ap sèvi kòm sign akò antre Mwen ak nou. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Epi chak mal antre nou ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref></char></note>uit jou va sikonsi selon tout jenerasyon nou yo, e osi yon sèvitè ki fèt lakay ou, oswa ki achte avèk lajan a nenpòt etranje ki pa sòti nan desandan pa nou yo. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Yon sèvitè ki fèt lakay nou, oswa ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:44">Egz 12:44</ref></char></note>achte avèk lajan nou va asireman vin sikonsi; konsa akò Mwen va nan chè nou, yon akò pou tout tan. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Men yon mal ki pa sikonsi nan avan chè li, moun sila a va vin retire de pèp li a. Li vyole akò Mwen an.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:24-26">Egz 4:24-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Epi Bondye te di a Abraham: “Konsènan madanm ou, Saraï, ou pa pou rele li Saraï, men Sarah va non li. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Mwen va beni li, Mwen va bay ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Jen 18:10</ref></char></note>yon fis pa li. Alò, Mwen va beni li, e li va yon manman pou anpil nasyon. Wa a pèp yo va sòti nan li.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Nan moman sa a, Abraham te tonbe sou figi li. Li te ri e li te di nan kè l: “Èske yon pitit va fèt a yon nonm santan? Epi èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:7">Jen 21:7</ref></char></note>Sarah, ki gen katre-ven-diz ane va fè yon pitit?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Konsa, Abraham te di a Bondye: “O ke Ismaël kapab viv devan Ou!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Men Bondye te di: “Non, men Sarah, madanm ou an va fè yon fis, e ou va rele non li Isaac. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:2-5">Jen 26:2-5</ref></char></note>Mwen va etabli akò Mwen an avèk li pou yon akò pou tout tan pou desandan apre li yo.<verse eid="GEN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>“Pou Ismaël, Mwen te tande ou. Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:10">Jen 16:10</ref></char></note>fè li bay anpil fwi, e li va miltipliye li anpil, anpil. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Jen 25:12-16</ref></char></note>Li va vin papa a douz prens yo, e Mwen va fè li vin yon gran nasyon.<verse eid="GEN 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>“Men akò Mwen an, Mwen va etabli li avèk Isaac, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Jen 21:2</ref></char></note>Sarah va fè pou ou nan menm sezon sa a, lane pwochèn.”<verse eid="GEN 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Lè Li te fin pale avèk li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:33">Jen 18:33</ref></char></note>Bondye te monte kite Abraham.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Alò, Abraham te pran Ismaël, fis li a, tout sèvitè ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Jen 14:14</ref></char></note>fèt nan kay li, tout ki te achte avèk lajan li, chak mal pami mesye lakay Abraham yo, e li te sikonsi prepis yo nan menm jou sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:9-11">Jen 17:9-11</ref></char></note>jan Bondye te di li a.<verse eid="GEN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Alò, Abraham te gen katre-ven-diz ane lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:11">Wo 4:11</ref> </char></note>li te sikonsi nan chè pwen pye li. <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:16">Jen 16:16</ref></char></note>Ismaël, fis li a te gen trèz ane lè li te sikonsi nan chè pwen pye li.<verse eid="GEN 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Nan menm jou sa a, Abraham te sikonsi, ansanm ak fis li, Ismaël. <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>Tout gason lakay li yo, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Jen 14:14</ref></char></note>fèt lakay li, ki te achte avèk lajan nan men moun etranje, te sikonsi avèk li.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te parèt a li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Jen 13:18</ref></char></note>bwadchenn Marmré yo pandan li te chita akote pòt tant la nan chalè jounen an. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Lè li te leve zye li pou te gade, men twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16">Jen 18:16</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:22">22</ref> </char></note>mesye ki te kanpe anfas li. Lè li te wè yo li te kouri sòti nan pòt tant lan pou rankontre yo, e li te bese tèt li atè. <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>Li te di: “SENYÈ mwen, si koulye a mwen vin twouve favè nan zye nou, souple, pa pase lwen sèvitè nou an. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Souple, kite yon ti dlo ta pote pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:2">Jen 19:2</ref></char></note>lave pye nou, e repoze nou anba pyebwa a. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>Konsa, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:18-19">Jij 6:18-19</ref></char></note>pote yon moso pen, pou nou kapab rafrechi nou menm; apre sa nou kapab kontinye, depi nou fin vizite sèvitè nou an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Epi yo te di: “Fè sa ke ou di a.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Epi Abraham te kouri antre nan tant lan vè Sarah, e te di: “Fè vit, prepare twa mezi farin fen, byen bat li, e fè gato pen.”<verse eid="GEN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Abraham osi te kouri nan pak bèf, li te pran yon jenn bèf byen mou, byen chwazi, e li te bay li a sèvitè li, ki te fè vit pou prepare li. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Li te pran bòl lèt kaye yo avèk lèt fre ak jèn bèf ke li te prepare, e te plase li devan yo; epi li te kanpe bò kote yo anba pyebwa a pandan yo t ap manje.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Alò, yo te di li: “Kote Sarah, madanm ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Epi li te di: “Nan tant lan”.<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Epi li te di: “Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Jen 21:2</ref> </char></note>mwen va retounen bò kote ou nan lè sa ane pwochèn; epi gade byen, Sarah, madanm ou va gen tan gen yon fis.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Epi Sarah t ap koute bò kote pòt la, ki te dèyè li a. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Jen 17:17</ref></char></note>Abraham ak Sarah te vye, byen avanse nan laj. Sarah te depase laj pou fè pitit. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Sarah te ri a tèt li, e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:18">Luc 1:18</ref> </char></note>Lè m gen tan fin vye a, èske m ap gen plezi, e mari mwen ki vye tou?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di Abraham: “Poukisa Sara te ri, e t ap di: ‘Èske vrèman mwen va fè yon pitit lè mwen fin vye a?’<verse eid="GEN 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:17-27">Jr 32:17-27</ref> </char>
    </note>“Èske gen anyen ki twò difisil pou SENYÈ a? Nan lè chwazi a, mwen va retounen a nou menm, nan lè sa a, lane pwochèn, e Sarah va gen yon fis.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Sarah te demanti sa, e te di: “Mwen pa t ri non”; paske li te pè. Epi Li te di: “Non, men ou te ri.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:2">Jen 18:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:22">22</ref> </char></note>mesye yo te leve la e yo te gade pi ba vè Sodome; epi Abraham t ap mache avèk yo pou voye yo ale.<verse eid="GEN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>SENYÈ a te di: “Èske Mwen kab kache Abraham <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:21">Jen 18:21</ref></char></note>sa ke M prè pou M fè a, <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>paske Abraham va anverite vin yon gran nasyon byen fò, e nan li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jen 12:3</ref></char></note>tout nasyon yo va beni? <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:7">Né 9:7</ref></char></note>chwazi li pou l kapab kòmande pitit li yo avèk lakay li, pou kenbe chemen SENYÈ a, pou fè ladwati avèk jistis, pou SENYÈ a kapab fè rive sou Abraham, sa ke Li te pale de li a.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:13">Jen 19:13</ref></char></note>Gwo kri kont Sodome avèk Gomorrhe a byen gran, e peche pa yo grav depase. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:5">Jen 11:5</ref></char></note>desann koulye a, pou wè si yo te fè tout bagay selon gwo kri sa a, ki te vin jwenn Mwen an; epi si se pa sa, m ap konnen.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16">Jen 18:16</ref></char></note>mesye yo te vire kite la, e te ale vè Sodome, pandan Abraham toujou kanpe devan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Abraham te vin pwoche, e te di L: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:7">Egz 23:7</ref></char></note>“Èske Ou vrèman va fè disparèt moun dwat yo ansanm avèk mechan yo? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Sipoze ke gen senkant moun ki dwat nan vil la; èske vrèman Ou va fè l disparèt, e pa prezève kote a pou koz a senkant moun dwat ki ladann yo?<verse eid="GEN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>“Se lwen Ou pou Ou ta fè yon bagay konsa, pou touye moun dwat yo avèk mechan yo pou dwat yo avèk mechan yo vin trete menm jan. Se lwen Ou menm! Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:1-17">Det 1:1-17</ref> </char></note>Jij sou tout latè a p ap aji avèk jistis?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:1">Jr 5:1</ref> </char></note>“Si Mwen twouve nan Sodome, senkant moun dwat nan vil la, alò, Mwen va prezève tout pou koz a yo menm.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Epi Abraham te reponn: “Alò gade byen, mwen te tante pale ak SENYÈ a, malgre mwen pa plis ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:19">Jen 3:19</ref></char></note>pousyè avèk sann. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Vin sipoze ke senkant dwat yo manke senk, èske Ou va detwi tout vil la akoz senk lan?” Epi li te di: “Mwen p ap detwi li si Mwen twouve karant-senk ki la.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Epi li te pale ankò, e te di: “Sipoze ke gen karant ki twouve la?” Epi li te di: “Mwen p ap fè li pou koz a karant lan.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Alò li te di: “O ke SENYÈ a pa vin fache avè m, e mwen va pale; sipoze se trant ki twouve la?” Epi Li te di: “Mwen p ap fè li si Mwen twouve trant lan.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Epi li te di: “Koulye a byen gade, mwen te tante pale avèk SENYÈ a; sipoze se ven ki twouve la?” Epi li te di: “Mwen p ap detwi li pou koz a ven yo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Alò li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:39">Jij 6:39</ref></char></note>“O ke Senyè a pa vin fache avè m! M ap pale sèl fwa sa; sipoze ke se dis ki twouve la?” Epi li te di: “Mwen p ap detwi li pou koz a dis yo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Depi lè ke li fin pale ak Abraham nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:22">Jen 17:22</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te pati, e Abraham te retounen nan kote pa li.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:2-22">Jen 18:2-22</ref></char></note>de zanj te vini Sodome nan aswè lè Lot te chita nan pòtay Sodome nan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:1">Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:2-5">Jen 18:2-5</ref></char></note>Lot te wè yo, li te leve pou rankontre yo. Li te bese ba avèk figi li atè. <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>Epi li te di: “Koulye a, gade byen, frè m yo, souple vire akote nan kay sèvitè ou a, pou pase nwit lan. Lave pye nou, pou nou kapab leve bonè pou fè wout nou.” Malgre sa, yo te di: “Non, men nou va pase nwit lan nan lari a.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Men li te plede avèk yo avèk fòs. Konsa yo te vire akote vè li e te antre lakay li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:6-8">Jen 18:6-8</ref></char></note>e li te prepare yon gwo manje pou yo. Anplis li te kwit pen san ledven a, e yo te manje.<verse eid="GEN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Avan yo gen tan kouche, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:13">Jen 13:13</ref></char></note>mesye Sodome yo te antoure kay la, ni jèn, ni vye, tout moun ki te sòti nan tout katye yo. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Konsa, yo te rele Lot e te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:22">Lev 18:22</ref></char></note>“Kote mesye sa yo ki te vin kote ou aswè a? Mennen yo bannou pou nou kapab antre an relasyon avèk yo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Men Lot te sòti kote yo nan pòtay la, e te fèmen pòt la dèyè l. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>Li te di: “Souple, frè m yo, pa aji avèk mechanste. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Byen gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:24">Jij 19:24</ref></char></note>mwen gen de fi ki pa janm antre an relasyon avèk yon gason. Souple, kite m mennen yo deyò pou nou, e fè avèk yo sa ke nou pito, men pa fè anyen avèk mesye sa yo, akoz se anba pwotèj twati mwen yo gen tan vini.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Men yo te di: “Mete ou akote.” Anplis ke sa yo te di: “Sila te antre tankou etranje, e deja <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Egz 2:14</ref></char></note>l ap aji kòm jij. Pou sa a, nou va trete ou pi mal pase yo.” Epi yo te peze rèd kont Lot, e yo te prèt pou kase pòt la.<verse eid="GEN 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1">Jen 19:1</ref></char></note>mesye yo nan kay la te lonje men yo rale Lot anndan avèk yo, e yo te fèmen pòt la.<verse eid="GEN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Yo te frape mesye ki te nan pòtay kay la pou yo vin avèg, ni piti ni gran, pou yo fatige kò yo e pou yo pa t ka twouve pòt la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:28-29">Det 28:28-29</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Konsa, de mesye yo te di Lot: “Kilès ankò ke ou gen isit la? Yon bofis, fis ou yo, e nenpòt moun ou gen nan vil la, mennen yo sòti kite plas sa a, <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>paske nou prèt pou detwi plas sila a, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Jen 18:20</ref></char></note>plent pa yo gen tan vin tèlman gran devan SENYÈ a, ke SENYÈ a te voye nou pou detwi li.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Lot te ale deyò pou te pale avèk bofis li yo, ki te prèt pou marye avèk fi li yo, e li te di: “Leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:21-45">Nonb 16:21-45</ref> </char></note>sòti kite plas sila a, paske SENYÈ a va detwi vil la.” Men li te sanble a bofis li a ke se yon blag ke li t ap fè.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Lè maten an te rive, zanj yo te bourade Lot. Yo te di l: “Leve, pran madanm ou avèk de fis ou yo ki isit la, oswa ou va vin disparèt nan pinisyon vil la.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Men li te fè reta. Pou sa, mesye sa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:15">Det 5:15</ref></char></note>sezi men l avèk men madanm li avèk men a de fi li yo, paske konpasyon SENYÈ a te sou li. Yo te mennen li deyò, e yo te mete l deyò vil la.<verse eid="GEN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Lè yo te mennen yo deyò, youn nan yo te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:6">Jr 48:6</ref></char></note>Sove ale pou lavi ou! Pa gade dèyè, e pa rete nan okenn kote nan vale a. Sove ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:10">Jen 14:10</ref></char></note>mòn yo, oswa ou va detwi nèt.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Men Lot de di yo: “Alò, li pa konsa, mèt mwen yo! <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Koulye a gade byen, sèvitè nou an gen tan twouve favè nan zye nou, nou te montre jan mizerikòd nou gran nan sove vi m, men mwen p ap kapab chape nan mòn yo, paske malè a va gen tan rive sou mwen, e mwen va mouri. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Gade byen, vil sila a ase pre pou m sove ale ladann, e li piti. Souple, kite mwen chape pa la. Èske li pa piti? Konsa vi m kapab sove.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Li te di li: “Gade byen, mwen ba ou demann sa a tou, pou pa detwi vil la sou sila ou te pale a. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Fè vit, chape rive la, paske mwen pa kapab fè anyen jiskaske ou rive la.” Pou sa yo te rele vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:10">Jen 13:10</ref> </char></note>Tsoar.<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Solèy la te gen tan fin leve sou tè a lè Lot te rive Tsoar. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Epi SENYÈ a te fè souf avèk dife ki sòti nan syèl la, tonbe tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23">Det 29:23</ref></char></note>lapli sou Sodome avèk Gomorrhe. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23">Det 29:23</ref></char></note>Li te detwi vil sila yo, ak tout vale a, ak tout moun ki te rete nan vil yo, ansanm ak sa ki te grandi nan tè a. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Men madanm li ki te dèyè li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:17">Jen 19:17</ref></char></note>gade dèyè, e li te tounen yon pilye sèl.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Alò, Abraham te leve granmmaten. Li te ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:22">Jen 18:22</ref></char></note>plas kote li te kanpe devan SENYÈ a, <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>epi li te gade anba vè Sodome avèk Gomorrhe, vè tout teren nan vale a. Li te wè, e gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:2">Rev 9:2</ref> </char></note>lafimen te monte tankou lafimen ki sòti nan founo.<verse eid="GEN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Se konsa li rive ke lè Bondye te detwi vil yo nan vale a, ke Li te sonje Abraham. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">II Pi 2:7</ref> </char></note>voye Lot deyò dega a, lè li te boulvèse vil yo nan sila Lot te rete.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Lot te kite Tsoar e monte. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:17-19">Jen 19:17-19</ref> </char></note>rete nan mòn yo avèk de fi li yo avè l, paske li te pè rete Tsoar. Li te rete nan yon kav, li menm avèk de fis li yo. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Alò premye ne a te vin di a pi Jèn nan: “Papa nou vin vye, e nou pa gen gason sou latè pou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:2-4">Jen 16:2-4</ref> </char></note>antre nan nou apre sistèm sou tè a. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Vini, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34">Luc 21:34</ref> </char></note>annou fè papa nou bwè diven, e annou kouche avè l pou nou kapab prezève fanmi nou an pa papa nou.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Pou sa, yo te fè papa yo bwè diven menm nwit lan, e premye ne a te antre kouche avèk papa li. Li pa t konnen ni lè li te kouche a, ni lè li te leve a.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Jou swivan an, premye ne a te di a pi Jèn nan, “Gade byen, yè swa mwen te kouche avèk papa m. Annou fè li bwè diven aswè a tou, epi ou menm antre kouche avè l, pou nou prezève fanmi nou an ak papa nou.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Alò, yo te fè papa yo bwè diven nan nwit lan tou, epi pi Jèn nan te leve e kouche avè l. Epi li pa t konnen ni lè li te kouche a, ni lè li te leve a.<verse eid="GEN 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Konsa tou de fi a Lot yo te vin ansent pa papa yo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Premye ne a te fè yon fis, e li te rele non li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:9">Det 2:9</ref></char></note>Moab. Li se papa a Moabit yo jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Epi pou pi Jèn nan, li te fè yon fis tou, e li te rele li Ben-Ammi. Li se papa a tout fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:19">Det 2:19</ref></char></note>Ammon yo jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Alò Abraham te vwayaje soti la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1">Jen 18:1</ref></char></note>vè peyi Negev la. Li te vin rete antre Kàdes ak Schur, e li te pase yon tan kon etranje nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:1-6">26:1-6</ref></char></note>Guérar. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Abraham te di selon Sarah, madanm li: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1">Jen 18:1</ref></char></note>Li se sè mwen”. Alò, Abimélec, wa nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:1-2">Jen 26:1-2</ref></char></note>Guérar a te vin pran Sarah.<verse eid="GEN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Men Bondye te vini a Abimélec nan yon rèv nan nwit, e Li te di li: “Veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:7">Jen 20:7</ref></char></note>ou se yon moun ki fin mouri akoz fanm ke ou te pran an, paske li marye.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Alò, Abimélec pa t gen tan pwoche li, epi li te reponn: “Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:23-25">Jen 18:23-25</ref></char></note>èske Ou va detwi yon nasyon, malgre li san fot? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:13">Jen 20:13</ref></char></note>li menm, li pa t di mwen: ‘Li se sè mwen?’ Epi li menm, li te di: ‘Li se frè m.’ Nan entegrite kè m, ak inosans men m, mwen te fè sa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Konsa, Bondye te di li nan rèv la: “Wi, Mwen konnen ke nan entegrite kè ou, ou te fè sa, e Mwen osi te anpeche ou pou ou pa t peche kont Mwen. Se pou sa Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:26-34">I Sam 25:26-34</ref> </char></note>pa t kite ou touche li. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Alò, pou sa, remèt madanm a nonm sa a. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:5">I Sam 7:5</ref></char></note>se yon pwofèt ke li ye. Li va priye pou ou e ou va viv. Men si ou pa remèt li, konnen ke ou va anverite mouri, ou menm avèk tout moun sa yo ki pou ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Konsa, Abimélec te leve granmmaten. Li te rele tout sèvitè li yo, e te di tout bagay sa yo pou yo tande. Mesye sa yo te gen gwo laperèz.<verse eid="GEN 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:11-20">Jen 12:11-20</ref> </char>
    </note>Alò, Abimélec te rele Abraham. Li te di li: “Kisa ou te fè nou? Epi kijan mwen te peche kont ou ke ou te pote sou mwen ak wayòm mwen yon gran peche? Ou te fè m bagay ou pa ta janm dwe fè.”: <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Epi Abimélec te di a Abraham: “Sak rive ou ki fè ou fè bagay sa a?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Abraham te di: “Paske, mwen te reflechi ke asireman, pa gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:15">Né 5:15</ref></char></note>lakrent Bondye nan plas sa a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:12">Jen 12:12</ref></char></note>yo va touye mwen akoz madanm mwen. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Anplis de sa, vrèman li se sè mwen, fi a papa m, men pa fi a manman m, e li te vin madanm mwen. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Lè li te rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-9">Jen 12:1-9</ref></char></note> Bondye te fè m vwayaje pou kite kay papa m, mwen te di li: ‘Men yon gras ke ou va fè m: tout kote nou ale, di pa mwen menm: ‘Li se frè m.’’”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:16">Jen 12:16</ref></char></note>Abimélec te pran mouton avèk bèf avèk sèvitè li yo, mal ak femèl. Li te bay yo a Abraham, e li te remèt madanm li, Sarah bay li.<verse eid="GEN 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Abimélec te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:9">Jen 13:9</ref></char></note>Byen gade, peyi mwen an devan ou. Etabli ou kote ou pito.”<verse eid="GEN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>A Sarah, li te di: “Byen gade, mwen te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:5">Jen 20:5</ref></char></note>frè ou mil pyès an ajan. Veye byen, li se revandikasyon ou devan zye tout moun ki avèk ou. E devan tout, ke ou egzonore.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 12:13">Nonb 12:13</ref> </char>
    </note>Abraham te priye a Bondye, e Bondye te geri Abimélec avèk madanm li, avèk mennaj li yo, pou yo te vin fè pitit. <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:17">Jen 12:17</ref></char></note>Paske SENYÈ a te fèmen vant yo a tout kay Abimélec la akoz Sarah, madanm Abraham nan.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:16-21">Jen 17:16-21</ref> </char>
    </note>Epi SENYÈ a te bay atansyon a Sarah jan Li te pale a, e SENYÈ a te fè sa pou Sarah jan li te pwomèt la. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Trav 7:8</ref> </char></note>Alò, Sarah te vin ansent, e li te anfante yon fis pou Abraham nan vyeyès li, nan lè chwazi ke Bondye te pale li a. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Abraham te rele non a fis ki te fèt a li menm nan, ke Sarah te fè pou li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:19-21">Jen 17:19-21</ref> </char></note>Isaac. <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Epi Abraham te sikonsi fis li a, Isaac lè l te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Jen 17:12</ref> </char></note>laj uit jou, jan Bondye te kòmande li a. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Alò, Abraham te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Jen 17:17</ref></char></note>laj san ane lè fis li a, Isaac te vin fèt a li menm.<verse eid="GEN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Sarah te di: “Bondye te fè m fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:13">Jen 18:13</ref></char></note>gwo ri. Tout moun ki tande va ri avèk mwen.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Epi li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-13">Jen 18:11-13</ref> </char></note>kilès ki ta di a Abraham ke Sarah ta bay tete a timoun? Paske mwen ba li yon fis nan vyeyès li.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Pitit la te grandi e li te vin sevre. Abraham te fè yon gwo fèt nan jou ke Isaac te sevre a.<verse eid="GEN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Alò, Sarah te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:1-15">Jen 16:1-15</ref> </char></note>fis Agar a, Ejipsyen an, ke li te fè pou Abraham nan, t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29">Gal 4:29</ref> </char></note>moke l. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Akoz sa, li te di Abraham: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:30">Gal 4:30</ref></char></note>Mete bòn sa a deyò ansanm avèk fis li a! Paske fis a sèvant sa a p ap vin eritye avèk fis mwen an, Isaac.”<verse eid="GEN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:18">Jen 17:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bagay sa a te twouble Abraham anpil akoz fis li a. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Men Bondye te di a Abraham: “Pa enkyete akoz pwoblèm jènjan sa a avèk sèvant ou an. Nenpòt sa ke Sarah di ou, koute li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Wo 9:7</ref> </char></note>se nan Isaac desandan ou yo va vin nome. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:10">Jen 16:10</ref></char></note>fis sèvant lan, Mwen va fè yon nasyon tou, akoz ke li menm se desandan ou.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Konsa, Abraham te leve bonè nan maten. Li te pran pen avèk yon kwi dlo, e li te bay yo a Agar. Li te vin mete yo sou zepòl li, li te ba li jènjan an, e li te voye li ale. Li te pati e li te vwayaje nan dezè Beer-Schéba a.<verse eid="GEN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Lè dlo ki te nan kwi a, te fin sèvi, li te kite jènjan an anba yon ti ab. <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>Alò, li te ale chita nan distans yon flèch kab tire, e li te di: “Pa kite m wè jènjan an k ap mouri.” Konsa, li te chita anfas li; li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:26">Jr 6:26</ref> </char></note>leve vwa li, e li te kriye.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Egz 3:7</ref></char></note>tande jènjan an t ap kriye, epi zanj Bondye a te rele Agar depi nan Syèl la. Li te di l: “Kisa ou gen, Agar? Pa pè, paske Bondye te tande vwa jènjan an kote li ye a. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Leve, ale fè jènjan an leve, e kenbe li nan men, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:10">Jen 16:10</ref></char></note>paske Mwen va fè yon gran nasyon ak li.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Epi Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:31">Nonb 22:31</ref> </char></note>ouvri zye l, e li te wè yon pwi dlo. Li te ale plen po a avèk dlo, e li te bay jènjan an bwè ladann.<verse eid="GEN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye te avèk jènjan an, e li te grandi. Li te viv nan dezè a e li te vin yon achè. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:18">Jen 25:18</ref></char></note>Li te viv nan dezè Paran an, e manman l te pran yon madanm pou li nan peyi Égypte la.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan tan sa a ke Abimélec avèk Picol, chèf lame li, te pale avèk Abraham. Li te di l: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:28">Jen 26:28</ref></char></note>Bondye avèk ou nan tout sa ou fè <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Pou sa, fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:12">Jos 2:12</ref></char></note> sèman ban mwen menm isit la devan Bondye ke ou p ap twonpe ni mwen, ni pitit mwen yo, ni posterite mwen yo, men selon tout gras ke m te montre ou, ou va montre m tou, nan peyi kote ou te demere kon yon etranje a.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Abraham te di: “Mwen fè sèman sa a.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Men Abraham te plenyen bay Abimélec akoz pwi dlo ke sèvitè Abimélec yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:15-22">Jen 26:15-22</ref> </char></note>te sezi a.<verse eid="GEN 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Abimélec te reponn: “Mwen pa konnen kilès ki te fè ou bagay sa a. Ou pa t di m sa, ni mwen pa t tande sa, jis rive jodi a.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Abraham te pran mouton avèk bèf, e li te bay yo a Abimélec. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:31">Jen 26:31</ref></char></note>yo de a te fè yon akò. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Abraham te mete sèt jèn mouton femèl ki sòti nan bann mouton apa pou kont yo. <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimélec te di a Abraham: “Kisa sa vle di; sèt jèn mouton femèl ke ou te mete apa pou kont yo?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Li te di: “Ou va pran sèt jèn mouton femèl sa yo nan men m pou yo kapab devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:48">Jen 31:48</ref></char></note>temwen pou mwen ke mwen te fouye pwi sa a.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Pou sa, li te rele plas sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:14">Jen 21:14</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba, paske se la ke yo de a te fè sèman an.<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Alò, yo te fè yon akò nan Beer-Schéba. Konsa, Abimélec avèk Picol, kòmandan lame a, te leve retounen nan peyi Filisten yo.<verse eid="GEN 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Abraham te plante la yon pyebwa tamaris nan Beer-Schéba, e la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:8">Jen 12:8</ref></char></note>li te rele sou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Letènèl la. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Epi Abraham te demere <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:19">Jen 22:19</ref></char></note>nan peyi Filistyen yo pandan anpil jou.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Alò, li te vin pase apre bagay sa yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-16">Det 8:2-16</ref> </char></note>Bondye te fè Abraham pase yon eprèv. Li te di li: “Abraham!” Epi li te reponn: “Men mwen”.<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Li te di: “Pran koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:12">Jen 22:12</ref></char></note>fis ou a, sèl fis ou a, ke ou renmen an, Isaac, epi ale nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">II Kwo 3:1</ref></char></note>Morija. Ofri li la kòm yon ofrann ki brile, sou youn nan mòn yo ke Mwen va di ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Alò, Abraham te leve granmmaten. Li te sele bourik li, e li te pran de nan jennonm sèvitè li yo avè l, ansanm avèk Isaac, fis li a. Konsa, yo te fann bwa pou ofrann brile a, e yo te leve ale nan plas kote Bondye te di li a.<verse eid="GEN 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Nan twazyèm jou a, Abraham te leve zye li, e li te wè plas la nan yon distans. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Abraham te di a jèn sèvitè li yo: “Rete isit la avèk bourik la. Mwen menm avèk jènjan an va ale lòtbò a. Nou va adore, e retounen bò kote nou.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Abraham te pran bwa dife pou ofrann brile a. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:17">Jn 19:17</ref></char></note>poze li sou Isaac, fis li a, e li te pran nan men l dife ak kouto a. Epi yo de a te mache avanse ansanm.<verse eid="GEN 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isaac te pale avèk papa li, Abraham, e te di li: “Papa m!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Epi li te reponn: “Men mwen, fis mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Konsa, li te di l: “Gade, men dife a avèk bwa, men kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38-42">Egz 29:38-42</ref></char></note>jèn mouton an ye pou fè sakrifis la?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Abraham te di: “Bondye va fè pwovizyon Li menm pou jèn mouton an, fis mwen.” Epi yo de a te mache avanse ansanm.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Alò yo rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Jen 22:2</ref></char></note>plas ke Bondye te di li a, epi Abraham te bati yon lotèl la. Li te ranje bwa, li te mare fis li a, Isaac, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Eb 11:17-19</ref></char></note>poze li sou lotèl la anwo tout bwa yo. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Abraham te lonje men l, e li te pran kouto a pou touye fis li a.<verse eid="GEN 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:7-11">Jen 16:7-11</ref> </char></note>zanj SENYÈ a te rele li depi nan syèl la e te di: “Abraham, Abraham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Li te reponn: “Men mwen isit la.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Li te di: “Pa lonje men ou kont jènjan an, ni pa fè l anyen. Paske koulye a Mwen konnen ke ou krent Bondye, akoz ke ou pa t refize bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2-16">Jen 22:2-16</ref> </char></note>fis ou a, sèl fis ou ban Mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Alò, Abraham te leve zye li pou te gade, e byen wè, yon belye ki te kenbe pa kòn li, nan yon rakbwa. Abraham te ale pran belye a, e li te ofri li kòm ofrann brile a nan plas a fis li a. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Abraham te rele non plas sa a Jehova-Jiré, Bondye Va Fè Pwovizyon. Jis jounen jodi a, yo kon di, “Nan mòn SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:8">Jen 22:8</ref></char></note> va gen pwovizyon.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Alò, zanj SENYÈ a te rele Abraham yon dezyèm fwa soti nan syèl la, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:9">Sòm 105:9</ref></char></note>Pou kont Mwen menm, Mwen te sèmante, deklare SENYÈ a, akoz ou te fè bagay sa a, e ou pa t refize fis ou a, sèl fis inik ou an, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>anverite Mwen va beni ou anpil. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:22">Jr 33:22</ref> </char></note>miltipliye posterite ou tankou zetwal syèl yo, ak tankou grenn sab lanmè ki arebò lanmè yo, epi posterite ou va posede pòtay lènmi pa yo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jen 12:3</ref> </char></note>Nan posterite ou, tout nasyon sou latè yo va beni, akoz ke ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:19">Jen 18:19</ref></char></note>obeyi vwa Mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:5">Jen 22:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi Abraham te retounen vè jèn sèvitè yo. Yo te leve e te ale ansanm Beer-Schéba. Konsa, Abraham te rete Beer-Schéba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Li te vin rive apre bagay sa yo ke yo te pale ak Abraham e te di: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:29">Jen 11:29</ref></char></note>Milca osi te fè pitit pou frè ou, Nahor: <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>Uts se premye ne li, epi Buz frè li, avèk Kemuel, papa Aram nan <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>epi Késed, Hazo, Pildasch, Jidlaph, ak Bethuel.” <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Bethuel te vin papa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:15">Jen 24:15</ref></char></note>Rebecca. Uit de Milcah sa yo te fè pitit pou Nahor, frè Abraham nan. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Konkibin li ki te rele Réuma, osi te fè Thébach, Gaham, Tahasch, ak Maaca.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Alò, Sarah te viv pandan san-ven-sèt ane. Men sa yo ki te lane a Sarah. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Sarah te mouri nan Kirjath-Arba (sa vle di Hébron) nan peyi Canaan an. Abraham te vini pou fè dèy pou li, e kriye pou li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:5">Jos 14:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Konsa, Abraham te leve kite mò li a. Li te pale a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:15">Jen 10:15</ref></char></note>fis a Heth yo. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Mwen menm se yon etranje k ap demere pami nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Trav 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:30">Jen 49:30</ref> </char></note>Ban mwen yon kote pou antèman pami nou pou m kapab antere mò a kote mwen p ap wè li.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Fis a Heth yo te reponn Abraham. Yo te di l: <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>“Koute nou, mèt mwen, ou menm, se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Jen 14:14</ref></char></note>prens Bondye pami nou. Antere mò ou a nan pi bon chwa ou nan tonm pa nou yo. Nanpwen pèsòn ki va refize ou yon plas antèman pou mò ou a.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Abraham te leve e te bese devan moun yo nan peyi a, fis a Heth yo. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>Li te pale avèk yo, e te di: “Si se volonte ou pou m antere mò mwen an kote mwen p ap wè l, koute mwen, e pale ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9">Jen 25:9</ref></char></note>Ephron fis Tsochar a pou mwen, <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>ke li kapab ban mwen kav Macpéla ki pou li a, ki nan pwent chan li an. Pou tout pri ke li fò, ke li ban mwen li devan nou kòm yon lye antèman an.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Alò, Ephron te chita pami fis a Heth yo. Ephron, Ethyen an, te reponn Abraham nan prezans fis a Heth yo, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:18">Jen 23:18</ref></char></note>tout moun yo ki t ap antre nan pòtay vil la. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Non, mèt mwen, koute mwen; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:21-24">II Sam 24:21-24</ref> </char></note>mwen ba ou chan an, e mwen ba ou kav ki ladann nan. Nan prezans a tout fis a pèp mwen yo, mwen ba ou li pou ou fè antèman mò ou a.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Konsa, Abraham te bese devan pèp peyi a. <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>Li te pale a Ephron nan prezans tout pèp peyi a, e te di: “Silvouplè, si ou va sèlman koute mwen, mwen va bay pri a chan an. Aksepte li nan men m pou m kapab antere mò mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Konsa, Ephron te reponn Abraham e te di li: <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>“Mèt mwen, koute mwen. Yon mòso tè ki vo kat-san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Egz 30:13</ref></char></note>pyès lajan, kisa sa ye antre mwen avèk ou? Alò, antere mò ou a.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Abraham te koute Ephron. Konsa, Abraham te peze pou Ephron lajan ke li te nonmen nan prezans tout fis a Heth yo, kat-san pyès lajan, nan sistèm komès nòmal.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:26">II Sam 14:26</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Pou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9">Jen 25:9</ref></char></note>chan Ephron ki te nan Macpéla a, ki te pozisyone vè Mamre a, chan an avèk kav ki te ladann nan, tout bwa ki te nan chan an, ki te anndan limit li yo, te sede <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>a Abraham kòm posesyon nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:10">Jen 23:10</ref></char></note>prezans fis a Heth yo, devan tout moun ki te antre nan pòtay vil li a. <verse eid="GEN 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Apre sa, Abraham te antere Sarah, madanm li nan kav la nan chan Macpéla ki anfas Mamre a, (sa vle di Hébron) <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Konsa, fis a Etyen yo te bay papye tè a enkli ak kav la; yo te transfere li a Abraham pou yon landwa antèman.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11">Jen 18:11</ref></char></note>Abraham te vin vye, byen avanse nan laj. Epi SENYÈ a te beni Abraham nan tout bagay. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Abraham te di a sèvitè li a, sila ki te gen plis laj lakay li a, ki te an chaj tout sa ke li te posede: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:9">Jen 24:9</ref></char></note>Souple, mete men ou anba kwis mwen. <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>Mwen va fè ou sèmante devan SENYÈ a, Bondye syèl la avèk Bondye tè a, ke ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:3">Det 7:3</ref></char></note>p ap pran yon madanm pou fis mwen ki sòti nan fi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:15-19">Jen 10:15-19</ref></char></note>Kananeyen yo, pami moun m ap viv yo, <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>men ke ou va ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Jen 12:1</ref></char></note>peyi mwen, kote relasyon mwen yo, e pran yon madanm pou fis mwen an, Isaac.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Sèvitè a te di li: “Sipoze ke fanm nan pa vle swiv mwen pou vini nan peyi a? Èske mwen dwe mennen fis ou a retounen nan peyi kote ou te soti a?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Abraham te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:8">Jen 24:8</ref></char></note>“Veye ke ou pa pran fis mwen an pou fè l retounen la! <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>SENYÈ a, Bondye syèl la ki te pran m, fè m sòti lakay papa m, peyi natal mwen, ki te pale avèk mwen; Li te sèmante ak mwen, e Li te di: ‘A desandan ou yo, Mwen va bay tè sa a’. Li va voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:20-23">Egz 23:20-23</ref> </char></note>zanj Li devan ou, e ou va pran yon madanm pou fis mwen an soti la. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>Men si fanm nan pa vle swiv ou, alò ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:17-20">Jos 2:17-20</ref></char></note>va lib de sèman pa m nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:6">Jen 24:6</ref></char></note>Sèlman, pa fè fis mwen an retounen la.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Alò, sèvitè a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2">Jen 24:2</ref></char></note>plase men l anba kwis mèt li, Abraham, e li te sèmante devan li sou zafè sila a.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Epi sèvitè a te pran dis chamo pami chamo mèt li yo, e li te pati avèk yon seleksyon plizyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:22-53">Jen 24:22-53</ref></char></note>bon bagay a mèt li nan men l. Li te leve pou ale nan Mésopotamie pou rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31-32">Jen 11:31-32</ref></char></note>vil Nahor. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Li te fè chamo yo bese a jenou deyò vil la toupre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:42">Jen 24:42</ref></char></note>pwi a nan aswè, nan lè ke fanm yo te vin rale dlo.<verse eid="GEN 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:27-42">Jen 24:27-42-48</ref> </char></note>“O Senyè, Bondye a mèt mwen an, Abraham, souple, lese mwen twouve siksè jodi a, e montre lanmou ak dousè Ou anvè mèt mwen, Abraham. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:43">Jen 24:43</ref></char></note>m ap kanpe akote sous la, e fi a pèp vil yo ap parèt pou rale dlo. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Koulye a, kite sa fèt ke a fi ke mwen di: ‘Souple, desann veso ou pou m kab bwè’, e ki reponn: ‘Bwè, e mwen va bay bèt ou yo dlo tou’: lese ke se sila ke Ou te chwazi pou sèvitè ou a, Isaac. Konsa nou va konnen ke Ou te montre lanmou ak dousè Ou a mèt mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Avan li te fin pale, gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:20">Jen 22:20</ref></char></note>Rebecca ki te ne a Bethuel, fi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:29">Jen 11:29</ref></char></note>Milca a, fanm Nachor, frè Abraham nan te parèt ak veso sou zepòl li. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Fi a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:11">Jen 12:11</ref></char></note>trè bèl, yon vyèj, e gason pa t janm antre nan relasyon avè l. Li te desann nan sous la, li te ranpli veso li, e li t ap monte.<verse eid="GEN 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Alò, sèvitè a te kouri bò kote li, e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:7">Jn 4:7</ref></char></note>Souple, kite mwen bwè yon ti dlo nan veso ou a.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 24:14-46">Jen 24:14-46</ref> </char>
    </note>Li te di: “Bwè, mèt mwen.” Byen vit li te desann veso li rive nan men li, e li te bay li bwè. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Lè li te fin ba li bwè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:14">Jen 24:14</ref></char></note>li te di: “Mwen va rale dlo osi pou chamo ou yo, jiskaske yo fin bwè”. <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Imedyatman li te vide veso li nan basen pou bèt yo, li te kouri retounen nan pwi a pou rale dlo, e li te rale pou tout chamo li yo. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:12-52">Jen 24:12-52</ref> </char></note>Antretan, nonm nan t ap veye li an silans, pou konnen si SENYÈ a te fè vwayaj li a vin yon siksè, ou non.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Epi pandan chamo yo te fin bwè, nonm nan te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:47">Jen 24:47</ref></char></note>bag lò ki peze yon mwatye sik (sis gram nan) avèk de braslè pou ponyèt li, ki te peze dis sik an lò, <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>epi li te mande: “Se fi a ki moun ou ye? Souple, fè m konnen, èske gen lojman lakay papa ou?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Li te di li<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:15">Jen 24:15</ref></char></note>: “Mwen se fi Bethuel la, fis Milca, ke li te fè pou Nahor a.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Ankò fi a te di li: “Nou gen ase, nan pay avèk manje, ak espas pou lojman”.<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Alò, mesye a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:48-52">Jen 24:48-52</ref> </char></note>bese byen ba, e li te adore SENYÈ a. <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>Li te di: “Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye a mèt mwen an, Abraham, ki pa t abandone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:10">Jen 32:10</ref></char></note>lanmou avèk konpasyon Li ak verite Li anvè mèt mwen. Pou mwen, SENYÈ a te dirije m nan chemen lakay de frè a mèt mwen yo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:12">Jen 29:12</ref></char></note>fi a te kouri pou pale tout kay manman l de bagay sa yo. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Fi a te gen yon frè ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:5-13">Jen 29:5-13</ref> </char></note>Laban. Laban te kouri deyò kote mesye a nan sous la. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Lè li te wè bag la avèk braslè yo sou ponyèt sè li, e lè li te tande pawòl a Rebecca yo, sè li, ki te di: “Se sa ke mesye a te di mwen,” li te ale kote mesye a. Gade byen, li te kanpe akote chamo yo nan sous la. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:13">Jen 29:13</ref></char></note>“Antre non, beni a SENYÈ a! Poukisa ou kanpe deyò, Paske m gen tan prepare kay la avèk yon plas pou chamo yo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Alò, mesye a te antre nan kay la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:24">Jen 43:24</ref></char></note>Laban te dechaje chamo yo, e li te bay pay avèk manje pou chamo yo, ak dlo pou lave pye li, avèk pye a mesye ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Men lè manje a te plase devan li, li te di: “Mwen p ap manje jiskaske mwen pale de misyon mwen an.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:33">Laban te di: “Pale toujou”.<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Li te di: “Mwen se sèvitè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2">Jen 24:2</ref></char></note>Abraham. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1">Jen 24:1</ref></char></note>beni mèt mwen an anpil, jiskaske li vin reyisi anpil. Li te bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:2">Jen 13:2</ref></char></note>bann mouton ak twoupo, lò ak lajan, sèvitè ak sèvant yo, e chamo ak bourik. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:1-7">Jen 21:1-7</ref></char></note>Sarah, madanm a mèt mwen an te fè yon fis pou mèt mwen an nan vyeyès li. Li te bay li tout sa li posede. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2-4">Jen 24:2-4</ref></char></note>Mèt mwen an te fè m sèmante pou di: ‘Ou pa pou pran yon madanm pou fis mwen ki sòti nan fi Kananeyen yo, nan peyi kote m ap viv la, <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>men ou va ale kote lakay papa m, nan moun fanmi pa m yo, e pran yon madanm pou fis mwen an.’<verse eid="GEN 24:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 24:5">Jen 24:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen te di a mèt mwen an: ‘Sipoze ke fanm nan pa swiv mwen.’<verse eid="GEN 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>“Li te di mwen: ‘<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:7">Jen 24:7</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a devan Sila mwen te mache a, va fè vwayaj ou a reyisi. Ou va pran yon madanm pou fis mwen an pami moun fanmi mwen yo, ak lakay papa m. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Epi konsa, ou va lib de sèman mwen an, si lè ou rive pami moun fanmi mwen yo, yo pa ba ou li. Si se sa a,ou va lib de sèman mwen an.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:11-12">Jen 24:11-12</ref> </char></note>mwen te vini jodi a nan sous la, e te di: ‘O SENYÈ, Bondye a mèt mwen an, Abraham, si koulye a ou va fè vwayaj ke m ap fè a reyisi. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:13">Jen 24:13</ref></char></note>mwen ap kanpe vè sous la, kite sa fèt ke jèn fi ki sòti pou rale dlo a, e ke mwen di: “Souple, kite m bwè yon ti dlo nan veso ou a”, <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>epi li di mwen: ‘Ou mèt bwè, e mwen va tire dlo pou chamo ou yo tou,’ kite sa fèt ke se li ke SENYÈ a te chwazi pou fis a mèt mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>“Avan mwen te fin pale nan kè mwen, gade byen, Rebecca te parèt avèk veso li sou zepòl li, e li te desann nan sous la pou tire. Mwen te di li: ‘Souple, kite m bwè.’”<verse eid="GEN 24:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 24:18-19">Jen 24:18-19</ref> </char>
    </note>“Li te byen vit desann veso a sou zepòl li, e li te di: ‘Bwè’, e mwen va bay bèt ou yo dlo tou’: Alò, mwen te bwè, e li te bay bèt yo dlo tou.<verse eid="GEN 24:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 24:23-24">Jen 24:23-24</ref> </char>
    </note>“Mwen te mande li konsa: ‘Fi a ki moun ou ye?’ Epi li te reponn: ‘Fi a Bethuel la, fis a Nachor, ke Milca te bay li a.’ Epi konsa, mwen te mete bag la nan nen li, e braslè yo nan ponyèt li.<verse eid="GEN 24:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>“Epi mwen te bese byen ba, mwen te adore SENYÈ a, e te beni SENYÈ a, Bondye a mèt mwen an, Abraham, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:27">Jen 24:27</ref></char></note>ki te gide mwen nan bon chemen pou pran fi nan fanmi mèt mwen an pou fis li. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Alò, koulye a, si w ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29">Jen 47:29</ref></char></note>aji avèk dousè e verite avèk mèt mwen an, fè m konnen. Men si se pa sa, kite m konnen, pou m kapab vire swa adwat, swa agoch.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Laban avèk Bethuel te reponn: “Afè sa a sòti nan SENYÈ a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:24-29">Jen 31:24-29</ref> </char></note>Alò nou pa kapab pale ou ni byen, ni mal. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Men Rebecca la devan ou, pran li pou ou ale, e ke li vin madanm a fis mèt ou a, jan SENYÈ a te pale a.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Lè sèvitè Abraham nan te tande pawòl sa yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:26">Jen 24:26</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 24:48">48</ref></char></note>bese tèt li atè devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Sèvitè a te mete deyò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:10-22">Jen 24:10-22</ref> </char></note>bagay ki fèt ak lajan avèk lò, ak vètman, e li te bay yo a Rebecca. Li te osi bay kèk bagay ki koute byen chè a frè li avèk manman li. <verse eid="GEN 24:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Li menm avèk mesye ki te avè l yo te manje, bwè e te pase nwit lan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Lè yo te leve nan maten li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:56-59">Jen 24:56-59</ref> </char></note>Voye mwen ale vè mèt mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Men frè li avèk manman li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:4">Jij 19:4</ref></char></note>“Kite fi a rete avèk nou pandan kèk jou, annou di di jou. Apre li kapab ale”.<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Li te reponn yo: “Pa anpeche m, paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:40">Jen 24:40</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a ki te fè chemen mwen an reyisi. Voye m ale pou m kapab retounen bò kote mèt mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Epi yo te di: “Nou va rele fi a pou mande li volonte pa li.”: <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Alò, yo te rele Rebecca e te di li: “Èske ou va ale avèk mesye sila a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Epi li te reponn: “M ap prale.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Konsa yo te voye Rebecca, sè yo a ale, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:8">Jen 35:8</ref></char></note>bòn li yo, sèvitè Abraham nan ak mesye pa li yo. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Yo te beni Rebecca, e te di li: “Ke ou menm, sè nou, kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:36">Nonb 10:36</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">Jen 22:17</ref> </char></note>devni manman a dè milye de dizèn de milye, e ke desandan ou yo kapab posede pòtay a sila ki rayi yo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Epi Rebecca te leve avèk bòn li yo, yo te monte chamo yo, e yo te swiv mesye a. Konsa sèvitè a te pran Rebecca, e li te pati.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Alò, Isaac t ap sòti nan yon vwayaj vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:14">Jen 16:14</ref></char></note>Lachaï-roi, paske li t ap viv nan Negev. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Isaac te ale deyò pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:8">Jos 1:8</ref> </char></note>fè meditasyon nan chan an nan aswè. Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:2">Jen 18:2</ref> </char></note>li te leve zye li pou gade, gade byen, chamo yo t ap vini.<verse eid="GEN 24:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Rebecca te leve zye li, e lè li te wè Isaac, li te desann chamo a. <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>Li te di sèvitè a: “Kilès mesye sa a k ap mache nan chan an vin jwenn nou an?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Epi sèvitè a te reponn: “Li se mèt mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Konsa, fi a te pran vwal la, e li te kouvri tèt li.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Sèvitè a te di Isaac tout sa ke li te fè. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Epi Isaac te mennen li nan tant li. Li te pran Rebecca, e li te vin madanm li, e li te renmen li. Konsa Isaac te konsole lè manman li te fin mouri.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Alò, Abraham te pran yon lòt madanm, ki te rele Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">I Kwo 1:32-33</ref></char></note>Li te fè pou li Zimran, Jokschan, Madian, Jischbak, avèk Schuach. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Jokschan te vin papa a Séba avèk Dedan. Epi fis Dedan yo te Aschurim, Letuschim, avèk Leummim. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Epi fis a Madian yo te Épha, Epher, Hénoc, Abida, avèk Eldaa. Tout sa yo se te fis a Ketura yo. <verse eid="GEN 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:35-36">Jen 24:35-36</ref> </char></note>Alò Abraham te bay tout sa li te posede a Isaac; <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>men a fis a fanm konkibin yo, li te bay yo kado pandan li te toujou ap viv la, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:14">Jen 21:14</ref></char></note>voye yo lwen fis li a vè lès, nan peyi lès la.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Sa yo se tout ane lavi ke Abraham te viv, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Jen 12:4</ref> </char></note>san-swasann-kenz ane. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Abraham te respire dènye souf li. Li te mouri yon granmoun byen mi, e li te byen satisfè avèk lavi. Konsa, li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:17">Jen 25:17</ref></char></note>ranmase vè pèp li. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Fis li yo, Isaac avèk Ismaël te antere li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:17-18">Jen 23:17-18</ref> </char></note>kav Macpéla a, nan chan Ephron an, fis Tsochar, Etyen an, anfas Mamré, <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Jen 23:3-16</ref></char></note>chan ke Abraham te achte nan men fis a Heth yo. La, Abraham te antere avèk madanm li, Sarah. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Li te vin rive apre mò Abraham nan, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:3">Jen 26:3</ref></char></note>Bondye te beni fis li a, Isaac, epi Isaac te viv toupre Lachaï-roi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Alò, sa yo se achiv a desandan a jenerasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:5">Jen 16:5</ref></char></note>Ismaël yo, fis Abraham nan, ke Agar, Ejipsyen an, sèvant a Sarah a, te fè ak Abraham; <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>epi sa yo se non <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:29">I Kwo 1:29</ref></char></note>fis Ismaël yo, selon non yo, nan lòd nesans pa yo: Nebajoth, premye ne a Ismaël la, Kédar, Adbeel, Mibsam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>Mischma, Duma, Massa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Hadad, Théma, Jethur, Naphisch avèk Kedma. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Sila yo se fis Ismaël yo e sa se non yo, pa vil, e pa anplasman yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:20">Jen 17:20</ref></char></note>douz prens yo selon tribi pa yo.<verse eid="GEN 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Sa yo se lane lavi Ismaël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:16">Jen 16:16</ref></char></note>san-trant-sèt ane. Li te respire dènye souf li, e li te mouri, epi yo te ranmase li vè pèp li. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Yo te deplase soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:7">I Sam 15:7</ref></char></note>Havila jis rive nan Schur ki nan kote lès Égypte lè yon moun ap pwoche Assyrie; li te rete la malgre sa te fè ènmi avèk tout paran li yo.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Alò, sa yo se achiv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:2">Mat 1:2</ref> </char></note>jenerasyon ki swiv Isaac yo, fis Abraham nan: Abraham te vin papa Isaac.<verse eid="GEN 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Lè Isaac te gen laj karant ane, li te pran Rebecca, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:23">Jen 22:23</ref></char></note>fi Bethuel la, Araméen an nan kote Paddan-Aram, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:29">Jen 24:29</ref></char></note>sè Laban an, Araméen an, pou vin madanm li. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Isaac te priye a SENYÈ a anfavè madanm li, akoz li te esteril. Konsa, SENYÈ a te reponn li, e Rebecca, madanm li an te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:10">Wo 9:10</ref> </char></note>ansent.<verse eid="GEN 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Men pitit yo te an konfli anndan vant li. Li te di: “Si se sa, poukisa mwen viv?” Li te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:9">I Sam 9:9</ref></char></note>mande a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>SENYÈ a te di li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-16">Jen 17:4-16</ref> </char></note>Gen de nasyon nan vant ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">De pèp va vin separe sòti nan vant ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Yon pèp va pi pwisan ke lòt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Pi gran an va sèvi pi jèn nan.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Lè jou li yo pou akouche te rive, gade, te gen jimo nan vant li. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Premye a te vin parèt byen wouj. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:11">Jen 27:11</ref></char></note> Li te kouvri toupatou tankou yon rad ki plen plim sou li. Yo te nonmen li Ésaü. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Apre, frè li a te vin parèt avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:13">Os 12:13</ref></char></note>men li ki t ap kenbe talon pye a Ésaü. Akoz sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:36">Jen 27:36</ref></char></note>yo te rele li Jacob. Isaac te gen swasant ane lè madanm li te bay nesans a yo.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Lè gason sa yo te grandi, Ésaü te vin fò nan lachas, yon nonm ki fèt pou chan a. Men Jacob te yon nonm byen trankil, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Eb 11:9</ref> </char></note>viv nan tant. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Alò, Isaac te renmen Ésaü akoz ke li te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:19">Jen 27:19</ref></char></note>gou pou vyann bèt sovaj, men Rebecca te renmen Jacob.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Lè Jacob te fin kwit yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:38">II Wa 4:38</ref></char></note>soup, Ésaü te vin antre pandan li t ap kite chan an, e li te grangou anpil. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>Konsa, Ésaü te di Jacob: “Souple, ban m goute bagay wouj sa ki la a, paske mwen grangou anpil.” Se pou sa yo te rele non li Edom.<verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Men Jacob te di: “Premyeman vann mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:16-17">Det 21:16-17</ref> </char></note>dwa nesans ou an.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Ésaü te di: “Gade byen, mwen prèt pou mouri, e konsa pou ki bagay yon eritaj ap sèvi mwen?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Jacob te di: “Premyeman, sèmante ban mwen.” Li te sèmante ba li. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Eb 12:16</ref> </char></note>vann dwa nesans li an bay Jacob.<verse eid="GEN 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Jacob te bay Ésaü pen avèk yon soup pwa. Li te manje e bwè, e li te leve al fè wout li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Konsa Ésaü te vin rayi dwa nesans li an.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Alò, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:10">Jen 12:10</ref></char></note>gwo grangou nan peyi a, ki te fèt apre gwo grangou ki te fèt nan jou Abraham yo. Isaac te ale Guérar vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:1-2">Jen 20:1-2</ref></char></note>Abimélec, wa Filisten yo.<verse eid="GEN 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Senyè a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref></char></note>parèt a li menm e te di: “Pa desann an Égypte. Rete nan peyi ke Mwen va montre ou a. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Rete pou yon tan nan peyi sa a, Mwen va avèk ou, e Mwen va beni ou, paske a ou menm ak desandan ou yo, Mwen va bay tout peyi sa yo, e Mwen va etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Jen 22:16-18</ref></char></note>sèman ke Mwen te sèmante a papa ou a, Abraham.<verse eid="GEN 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Jen 15:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen va miltipliye desandan ou yo tankou zetwal nan syèl la, e va bay tout tè sa yo a desandan ou yo. E nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Jen 22:18</ref></char></note>desandan ou yo, tout nasyon latè yo va beni, <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>akoz Abraham te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Jen 22:16</ref></char></note>obeyi Mwen, e kenbe chaj Mwen, Kòmandman Mwen yo, règleman Mwen yo, avèk lwa Mwen yo.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Konsa, Isaac te viv Guérar.<verse eid="GEN 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Lè mesye yo nan plas la te mande li de madanm li, li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Jen 12:13</ref></char></note>Li se sè mwen,” paske li te pè pou di “madanm mwen” akoz li te panse: “mesye yo nan zòn sa a ta kapab touye mwen pou Rebecca, paske li bèl.”<verse eid="GEN 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Li te rive lè li te rete la pandan anpil tan, ke Abimélec, wa Filisten yo t ap gade nan yon fenèt, e gade, li te wè Isaac ki t ap karese madanm li, Rebecca. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Alò, Abimélec te rele Isaac e te di: “Gade sa, vrèman li se madanm ou! Kòman ou te fè di mwen: ‘Li se sè mwen’”?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaac te di li: “Akoz ke mwen te di: ‘Mwen ta kapab mouri akoz li.’”<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 20:9">Jen 20:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abimélec te di: “Kisa ke ou te fè nou la a? Yon moun nan pèp la ta kapab fasilman vin kouche avèk madanm ou, e ou t ap fè nou vin koupab pou peche sa a.”<verse eid="GEN 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Konsa, Abimélec te bay tout pèp la lòd, e te di: “Moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:15">Sòm 105:15</ref></char></note>touche mesye sa a, oswa madanm li, asireman va mete a lanmò.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Alò, Isaac te simen nan peyi sa a, e li te rekòlte nan menm ane a san fwa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1">Jen 24:1</ref></char></note>Senyè a te beni li. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>Mesye a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:22">Pwov 10:22</ref> </char></note>vin rich e li te kontinye vin pi rich jiskaske li te vin ranmase anpil gwo richès. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:35">Jen 24:35</ref></char></note>Li te posede anpil bann mouton, twoupo avèk anpil chan bèt, jiskaske Filisten yo te vin anvi li. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:25-30">Jen 21:25-30</ref> </char></note>tout pwi ke sèvitè a papa li yo te fouye nan jou Abraham yo, papa li, Filisten yo te bouche lè yo te ranpli yo avèk tè.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Alò, Abimélec te di a Isaac: “Kite nou, paske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:9">Egz 1:9</ref></char></note>twò fò pou nou.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Konsa, Isaac te pati la. Li te vin rete nan vale Guérar a, e li te fè anplasman la. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isaac te fouye pwi yo ankò, pwi ki te fouye nan jou papa li yo, Abraham, paske Filisten yo te bouche yo apre mò Abraham nan. Epi li te bay yo menm non ke papa li te bay yo.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Men lè sèvitè Isaac yo te fouye nan vale a, e te twouve la yon pwi dlo ki t ap boujonnen, <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>bèje Guérar yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:25">Jen 21:25</ref></char></note>goumen avèk bèje Isaac yo e te di: “Dlo a se pa nou!” Alò, li te nonmen pwi a Ések akoz ke yo te fè kont ak li. <verse eid="GEN 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Yo te fouye yon lòt pwi, yo te goumen sou sila a tou e li te nonmen li Sitna. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Li te deplase la, li te fouye yon lòt pwi, e yo pa t goumen sou li. Li te bay li non a Rehoboth, paske li te di: “Koulye a, Bondye vin bannou plas, e nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:6">Jen 17:6</ref></char></note>rekòlte anpil fwi nan peyi a.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Alò, li te kite la pou monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:19">Jen 22:19</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:2">Jen 26:2</ref></char></note>te parèt a li menm nan nwit lan, e te di: “Mwen se Bondye a papa ou, Abraham. Pa pè, paske Mwen avè w. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Jen 22:17</ref></char></note>beni ou, e Mwen va fè desandan ou yo miltipliye pou koz a sèvitè Mwen an, Abraham.”<verse eid="GEN 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Konsa, li te bati yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7-8">Jen 12:7-8</ref> </char></note>lotèl la, li te rele non SENYÈ a, e te monte tant li la. La sèvitè Isaac yo te fouye yon pwi.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Jen 21:22</ref></char></note>Abimélec te vin kote li soti Guérar, avèk konseye li, Ahuzath, avèk Picol, kòmandan lame a. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Isaac te di yo: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:7">Jij 11:7</ref></char></note>Poukisa nou vin kote m, kòmsi nou rayi mwen, e te pouse mwen lwen nou?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Yo te di: “Nou wè byen klè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22-23">Jen 21:22-23</ref> </char></note>ke SENYÈ a te avèk ou. Alò, nou te di: ‘Annou fè yon sèman antre nou menm, e kite nou fè yon akò avèk ou, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>ke ou p ap fè nou okenn mal, menm jan ke nou pa t touche ou, nou pa t fè ou anyen sof ke byen, e w ap voye nou ale anpè.’ Koulye a, ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:31">Jen 24:31</ref></char></note>beni a SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="GEN 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:3">Jen 19:3</ref></char></note>li te fè yon gwo fèt manje pou yo, yo te manje e bwè.<verse eid="GEN 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Nan maten, yo te leve bonè. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:31">Jen 21:31</ref></char></note>te sèmante a youn lòt, epi Isaac te voye yo ale kite li anpè.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Li te vin rive nan menm jou a, ke sèvitè Isaac yo te antre e te avèti li de yon pwi ke yo te fouye. Yo te di li: “Nou gen tan twouve dlo.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Konsa, li te rele li Schiba, akoz sa yo rele vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:31">Jen 21:31</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Lè Ésaü te gen karant ane, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:8">Jen 28:8</ref></char></note>li te marye avèk Judith, fi Béeri a, Etyen an, e Basmath, fi a Elon an, Etyen an. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:46">Jen 27:46</ref></char></note>Yo te mennen traka pou twouble Isaac avèk Rebecca.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive lè Isaac te vye, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:10">Jen 48:10</ref> </char></note>zye li te twò fèb pou wè, ke li te rele Ésaü, pi gran nan pitit li yo. Li te di li: “Fis mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Ésaü te reponn li: “Men mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:10">Jen 48:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isaac te di: “Gade byen, koulye a, mwen vin vye. Mwen pa konnen jou ke m ap mouri an. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Ebyen, souple pran flèch ou yo avèk banza ou, e ale nan chan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:28">Jen 25:28</ref></char></note>fè lachas jibye pou mwen. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Prepare yon manje ki gen bon gou, jan ou konnen ke m renmen li an, e pote ban mwen pou m kab manje, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:19-31">Jen 27:19-31</ref> </char></note>nanm mwen kapab beni ou avan ke m mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Rebecca t ap koute pandan Isaac t ap pale avèk fis li a, Ésaü. Alò, lè Ésaü te ale nan chan pou fè lachas jibye pou kapab pote lakay, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:28">Jen 25:28</ref></char></note>Rebecca te di fis li a, Jacob: “Veye byen, mwen te tande papa ou pale ak frè ou a Ésaü. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>‘Pote pou mwen kèk jibye e prepare yon manje bon gou pou mwen, pou mwen kapab manje, e beni ou nan prezans SENYÈ a, avan ke m mouri.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Alò, pou sa, fis mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:13-43">Jen 27:13-43</ref> </char></note>koute lòd ke mwen pral ba ou a. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Ale koulye a, ale nan bann twoupo a. Chwazi de jèn kabrit ladann, pou m kapab prepare yo kòm yon bon manje pou papa ou, jan li renmen li an. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Konsa, ou va pote li bay papa ou, pou li kapab manje, pou li kapab beni ou avan ke li mouri”.<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Jacob te reponn a manman l, Rebecca: “Gade byen, Ésaü, frè m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:25">Jen 25:25</ref></char></note>byen kouvri avèk plim, e po m byen swa. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:21-22">Jen 27:21-22</ref> </char></note>Petèt papa m va manyen m. Konsa, mwen ta vin tankou yon twonpè nan zye li, e mwen ta rale sou mwen yon madichon olye yon benediksyon.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Men manman li te di li: “Ke madichon ou tonbe sou mwen, fis mwen! Sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:8">Jen 27:8</ref></char></note>obeyi vwa m, e ale chache yo pou mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Li te ale chache yo e te pote yo bay manman l. Manman l te fè yon manje bon gou jan papa l te renmen an. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Alò, Rebecca te pran pi bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27">Jen 27:27</ref></char></note>vètman Ésaü a, pi gran fis li a, ki te avèk li nan kay la, e te mete yo sou Jacob, pi jèn fis li a. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Li te mete po kabrit sou men li, ak nan pati kou li ki te swa. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Osi li te bay Jacob, fis li a, manje bon gou a avèk pen ke li te fè a.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Konsa, li te vini kote papa l, e te di: “Papa m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Epi li te di: “Men mwen. Kilès ou ye, fis mwen?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Jacob te di a papa l: “Mwen menm se Ésaü, premye ne ou a. Mwen te fè sa ou te mande m nan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:31">Jen 27:31</ref></char></note>Leve, souple, e chita pou manje nan jibye mwen an, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:4">Jen 27:4</ref></char></note>nanm ou kapab beni mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Isaac te di fis li a: “Kòman ou reyisi fè sa vit konsa, fis mwen?” Epi li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:12">Jen 24:12</ref></char></note>Paske SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a te fè sa rive m.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Alò, Isaac te di Jacob: “Souple, vin pi pre pou m kapab manyen ou, fis mwen, pou si ou se vrèman fis mwen an Ésaü, o non.”<verse eid="GEN 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Jacob te pwoche papa li. Li te manyen li, e te di: “Vwa a se vwa a Jacob, men men yo se men Ésaü.”: <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Li pa t rekonèt li, paske men li te kouvri avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:16">Jen 27:16</ref></char></note>plim tankou men frè l la, Ésaü. Epi akoz sa, li te beni li. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Li te di: “Èske vrèman ou se fis mwen an, Ésaü?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Epi li te reponn: “Se Mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Konsa, li te di: “Pote ban mwen, e mwen va manje nan jibye fis mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:4">Jen 27:4</ref></char></note>pou m kapab beni ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Li te pote ba li, e li te manje. Li te osi pote diven e li te bwè. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Epi Isaac, papa li, te di li: “Souple, pwoche pou bo m, fis mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Li te vin pre, e te bo li. Lè li te santi sant vètman li, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Eb 11:20</ref></char></note>beni li, e te di: “Ou wè, sant fis mwen an tankou sant a yon chan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:10">Sòm 65:10</ref></char></note>ke SENYÈ a te beni.<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Koulye a, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:39">Jen 27:39</ref></char></note>Bondye kapab ba ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:28">lawouze syèl la, ak grès tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:28">anpil sereyal chan avèk diven nèf.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Ke anpil pèp vin sèvi ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">e ke nasyon yo bese devan ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Vin mèt sou frè ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">e lese fis a manman ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">vin bese a ou menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jen 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Modi va sila ki modi ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Beni va sila ki beni ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Depi li rive ke Isaac te fin beni Jacob, e Jacob te apèn sòti nan prezans Isaac, papa l, Ésaü, frè l la te vin sòti nan fè lachas. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Li menm tou te fè manje bon gou, e li te pote l bay papa l. Li te di a papa l: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:19">Jen 27:19</ref></char></note>Ke papa m leve manje nan jibye fis li a, pou ou kapab beni mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Isaac, papa li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:18">Jen 27:18</ref></char></note>Kilès ou ye?” Konsa, li te di: “Mwen se fis ou, premye ne a, Ésaü.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Alò, Isaac te vin tranble avèk vyolans, e te di: “Alò kilès sa ki te fè lachas jibye a, ki te pote ban mwen, ke m te manje tout li avan ou te vini, e ke mwen te beni li an? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:3-4">Jen 28:3-4</ref> </char></note>Wi, e li va beni.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Lè Ésaü te tande pawòl a papa li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:19">Jen 27:19</ref></char></note>li te kriye avèk gwo kri ak yon vwa byen fò, e li te di papa l: “Beni m tou o papa mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Men li te reponn: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:19">Jen 27:19</ref></char></note>Frè ou a te vini twonpe m, e li te rache benediksyon ou an.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Li te di: “Èske se pa t yon verite yo te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26-32">Jen 25:26-32-34</ref> </char></note>Jacob, paske li te pran plas mwen de fwa sa yo? Li te pran dwa nesans mwen an, e gade, koulye a li pran benediksyon mwen.” Epi li te di: “Èske ou pa t rezève yon benediksyon pou mwen?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isaac te reponn Ésaü: “Gade byen, mwen te fè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:28-29">Jen 27:28-29</ref> </char></note>mèt ou, e tout moun nan fanmi li, mwen te bay li yo kòm sèvitè. Avèk sereyal avèk diven nèf mwen te bay li soutyen. Alò, pou ou, kisa m kapab fè, fis mwen?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Ésaü te di a papa li: “Èske se yon sèl benediksyon ou genyen, papa mwen? Beni mwen menm tou, o papa m.” Konsa, Ésaü te leve vwa l e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Eb 12:17</ref> </char></note>kriye.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Eb 11:20</ref> </char></note>Isaac, papa l te reponn e te di li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Gade byen, nan grès bon tè fètil ou va rete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">e lwen lawouze k ap soti anwo syèl la.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Pa nepe ou, ou va viv, e frè ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Jen 25:23</ref></char></note>ou va sèvi li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Men li va rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:20-22">II Wa 8:20-22</ref></char></note>ke lè ou vin toumante,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">ou va kase jouk la sou kou ou.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Epi Ésaü te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:3-11">Jen 32:3-11</ref></char></note>pote yon rayisman kont Jacob akoz benediksyon an ke papa l te beni li. Konsa, Ésaü te di nan kè l: “Jou doulè pou mò papa m prèt pou fini, alò, mwen va touye frè m, Jacob.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Alò, lè pawòl pi gran fis la te rive a Rebecca, li te voye rele pi jèn fis li a, Jacob, e te di li: “Gade byen, frè ou a, Ésaü ap plenyen li menm de ou menm avèk entansyon pou touye ou. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Pou sa, fis mwen, obeyi vwa m, e leve sove ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref></char></note>Charan, vè frè mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:29">Jen 24:29</ref></char></note>Laban! <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Rete avè l pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Jen 31:41</ref></char></note>kèk jou jiskaske kòlè frè ou a vin bese, <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>jiskaske kòlè frè ou a vin bese, e bliye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:12-35">Jen 27:12-35</ref> </char></note>sa ou te fè li a. Alò, mwen va voye chache ou la. Poukisa mwen ta oblije pèdi nou toude nan yon sèl jou?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Rebecca te di Isaac: “Mwen bouke viv akoz fi Heth yo. Si Jacob pran yon fanm nan fi a Heth yo, tankou sila, nan fi peyi yo, ki byen ki kab rive nan vi m?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Alò, Isaac te rele Jacob, li te beni li, li te kòmande li, e li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:3-4">Jen 24:3-4</ref> </char></note>Ou p ap pran yon fanm nan fi Canaan yo.” <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>“Leve ale Paddan-Aram, lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:3-4">Jen 24:3-4</ref></char></note>Bethuel, papa a manman ou. De la, pran yon madanm pami fi a Laban yo, frè manman ou an.<verse eid="GEN 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>“Ke Bondye Toupwisan an kapab beni ou, bay ou anpil fwi, e fè ou miltipliye pou yo kapab devni yon gran fòs kantite moun. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Ke li kapab osi bay ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:2">Jen 12:2</ref></char></note>benediksyon Abraham nan, pou ou menm, ak pou desandan ou yo osi, ke ou kapab posede peyi kote w ap demere a, ke Bondye te bay a Abraham nan.”<verse eid="GEN 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:43">Jen 27:43</ref></char></note>Isaac te voye Jacob ale. Li te ale Paddan-Aram a Laban, fis a Bethuel la, Arameyen an, frè Rebecca, manman a Jacob ak Ésaü.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Epi Ésaü te wè ke Isaac te beni Jacob e te voye li ale Paddan-Aram pou pran pou li menm yon madanm, e ke lè li te beni li, li te bay li lòd, e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:1">Jen 28:1</ref></char></note>Ou pa pou pran yon madanm nan fi a Canaan yo,” <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>epi ke Jacob te obeyi papa li, ak manman li, li te ale Paddan-Aram.<verse eid="GEN 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Konsa Ésaü te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:3">Jen 24:3</ref></char></note>fi Canaan yo pa t plè papa li Isaac. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Konsa, Ésaü te ale kote Ismaël, e li te marye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Jen 26:34</ref></char></note> anplis ke madanm yo li te gen deja, Mahalath, fi Ismaël la, fis Abraham nan, sè Nebajoth la.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Konsa, Jacob te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:23">Jen 26:23</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba e te ale vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4-5">Jen 12:4-5</ref></char></note>Charan. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Li te vini nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>sèten kote pou te pase nwit lan la, akoz solèy la te gen tan fin kouche. Li te pran youn nan wòch yo, li te mete l anba tèt li, e li te kouche la nan plas sila a.<verse eid="GEN 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Li te fè yon rèv, e li te gade yon nechèl yo te mete sou latè, tèt li te rive nan syèl la. Epi gade, zanj Bondye yo t ap monte desann sou li. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Epi, gade byen, SENYÈ a te kanpe anwo li. Li te di: “Mwen se SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:3">Jen 26:3</ref></char></note>Bondye papa Abraham nan ak Bondye Isaac la. Tè sa kote ou kouche a, Mwen va bay ou li pou ou menm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref></char></note>desandan ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Desandan ou yo va tankou pousyè latè, e ou va gaye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Jen 13:14-15</ref> </char></note>nan lwès, nan lès, nan nò, ak nan sid. Konsa, nan ou avèk desandan ou yo, tout fanmi sou latè yo va beni.<verse eid="GEN 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>“Gade byen, Mwen avèk ou. Mwen va kenbe ou nenpòt kote ou ale, e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:21">Jen 48:21</ref></char></note>va fè ou retounen nan peyi sa a. Paske Mwen p ap kite ou jiskaske Mwen fin fè tout sa ke M te pwomèt nou an.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Alò, Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:15">I Wa 3:15</ref></char></note>leve nan dòmi an, e li te di: “Anverite SENYÈ a nan plas sila a, e mwen pa t konnen.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Li te pè, e li te di: “Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:35">Sòm 68:35</ref></char></note>A la etonnan plas sa a etonnan! Sila a pa lòt ke lakay Bondye, e sa se pòtay Syèl la.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Konsa, Jacob te leve bonè nan maten. Li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11">Jen 28:11</ref></char></note>wòch ke li te plase anba tèt li a, e li te etabli li tankou yon pilye. Li te vide lwil sou tèt pilye a. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Li te rele plas sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:23">Jij 1:23</ref></char></note>Béthel, men oparavan non a vil sa a se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:6">Jen 35:6</ref></char></note>Luz.<verse eid="GEN 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Epi Jacob te fè yon sèman. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref> </char></note>Si Bondye ale avèk mwen, si Li va kenbe mwen nan vwayaj sila ke m ap fè a, e Li va ban mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:8">I Tim 6:8</ref> </char></note>manje pou m manje, ak rad pou m mete, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>pou m ka retounen lakay papa m anpè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:17">Det 26:17</ref></char></note>pou SENYÈ a va Bondye pa m, <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>alò, wòch sila a, ke m etabli tankou pilye a, va devni Lakay Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref></char></note>Nan tout sa ke ou ban mwen, mwen va anverite bay yon dim a Ou menm.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Alò, Jacob te ale nan vwayaj li a, e li te vini nan peyi ki te pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3-33">Jij 6:3-33</ref> </char></note>fis a lès yo. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Lè li te gade, li te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:10-11">Jen 24:10-11</ref> </char></note>pwi nan chan an, e gade byen, te gen twa bann mouton ki te kouche la akote li, paske se te avèk pwi sa a ke yo te bay tout bèt yo dlo. Alò, wòch la sou bouch pwi a te byen laj. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Lè tout bèje mouton yo te rasanble la, yo te konn woule wòch la sòti nan bouch pwi a, pou te bay mouton yo dlo, e te remete wòch la nan plas li sou bouch pwi a.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Jacob te di yo: “Frè m yo, kibò nou sòti?”: Yo te reponn: “Nou sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:10">Jen 28:10</ref></char></note>Charan.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Li te di yo: “Èske nou konnen Laban, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:24-29">Jen 24:24-29</ref> </char></note>fis Nachor a?” Epi yo te di: “Nou konnen li.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Li te mande yo: “Èske tout bagay ale byen pou li?” Epi yo te reponn: “Wi, tout bagay ale byen pou li. Men fi li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:16">Egz 2:16</ref></char></note>Rachel k ap vini avèk mouton yo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Li te di: “Gade byen, li toujou gwo lajounen; li poko lè pou rasanble bèt. Bay bèt yo dlo, e mete yo nan patiraj toujou.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Men yo te di: “Nou pa kapab jiskaske tout bèje mouton yo fin rasanble, e yo woule wòch la sòti nan bouch pwi a. Se nan lè sa a nou va bay mouton yo dlo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Pandan li t ap pale avèk yo, Rachel te parèt avèk mouton papa l yo, paske li te yon bèje. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Lè Jacob te wè Rachel, fi Laban an, frè manman li, ak mouton Laban yo, frè manman l, Jacob te pwoche. Li te woule wòch la sòti nan pwi a, e li te bay dlo a bann mouton Laban an, frè manman l lan. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Epi Jacob te bo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:4">Jen 33:4</ref></char></note>Rachel. Li te leve vwa li, e li te kriye. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Jacob te di Rachel ke li te yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:5">Jen 28:5</ref></char></note>moun fanmi papa l, e ke li te fis a Rebecca. Li te kouri di papa l sa.<verse eid="GEN 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:29-31">Jen 24:29-31</ref></char></note>Laban te tande nouvèl Jacob la, fis a sè li, li te kouri pou ale rankontre avè l e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:4">Jen 33:4</ref></char></note>anbrase li. Li te bo li, e te mennen li lakay li. Konsa, Jacob te eksplike Laban tout bagay sa yo. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Laban te di li: “Anverite, ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:23">Jen 2:23</ref></char></note>zo mwen avèk chè mwen.” Konsa, li te rete avèk li pandan yon mwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Alò Laban te di a Jacob: “Akoz ke ou se moun fanmi mwen, èske sa vle di ke ou ta dwe sèvi mwen gratis? Di m, kisa pou m bay ou kòm salè?”<verse eid="GEN 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Alò, Laban te gen de fi. Non pi gran an se te Léa, e lòt la se te Rachel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Epi zye a Léa yo te fèb, men Rachel te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:11">Jen 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 12:14">14</ref> </char></note>byen bèl nan figi l, ni nan fòm li. <verse eid="GEN 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Alò Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:67">Jen 24:67</ref></char></note>renmen Rachel, e konsa li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:12">Os 12:12</ref></char></note>Mwen va sèvi ou pandan sèt ane pou fi ou ki pi jèn nan, Rachel.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Laban te di: “Li pi bon pou m bay ou li pase pou m ta bay li a yon lòt gason. Rete avè m.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Jacob te sèvi sèt ane pou Rachel, men yo te parèt a li menm kòmsi se te kèk jou akoz lamou li te gen pou li.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Konsa, Jacob te di a Laban: “Ban mwen madanm mwen, paske tan mwen an gen tan fin konplete, pou m kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 15:1">Jij 15:1</ref></char></note>antre nan relasyon avè l.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Laban te rasanble tout mesye yo nan plas la, e li te fè yon gwo fèt.<verse eid="GEN 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Men nan aswè, li te pran fi li, Léa, e li te mennen li kote Jacob. Li te antre an relasyon avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Laban osi te bay sèvant li, Zilpa, pou Léa kòm sèvant. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Nan maten, gade byen, li vin parèt ke se te Léa! Konsa, li te di a Laban: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:18">Jen 12:18</ref> </char></note>“Kisa sa ou te fè m la a?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:25">“Èske se pa pou Rachel ke m te sèvi ou a? Poukisa ou fè m desepsyon sila a?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Men Laban te di: “Se pa koutim peyi nou pou fè maryaj a pi jèn nan avan premye ne a. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Konplete semèn nan avèk sila a, e nou va bay ou lòt la tou; pou sèvis sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Jen 31:41</ref></char></note>ou va sèvi m yon lòt sèt ane.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Jacob te fè sa, li te konplete semèn nan avèk fi a, e li te ba li fi li, Rachel, kòm madanm li. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Laban osi te bay sèvant li, Bilha a fi li, Rachel kòm sèvant li. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Alò, Jacob te antre an relasyon ak Rachel osi, e vrèman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:17-18">Jen 29:17-18</ref> </char></note>li te renmen Rachel plis ke Léa, e li te sèvi avèk Laban pandan yon lòt sèt ane.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te wè ke Léa te manke renmen, e Li te ouvri vant li, men Rachel te rete san pitit. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Léa te vin ansent. Li te fè yon fis, e li te nonmen li Reuben, paske li te di: “Akoz ke SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:11">Jen 16:11</ref></char></note>wè doulè mwen, asireman koulye a mari mwen va renmen m.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Li te vin ansent ankò, li te fè yon fis, e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:15">Det 21:15</ref> </char></note>“Akoz ke SENYÈ a te tande ke mwen te rayi, pou sa Li te ban mwen fis sila a osi.” Alò, li te bay li non Siméon.<verse eid="GEN 29:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Li te vin ansent ankò, li te fè yon fis. Konsa, li te di: “Alò fwa sa a mari mwen va vin atache a mwen, paske mwen te fè twa fis pou li.” Pou sa, li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:5">Jen 49:5</ref> </char></note>Lévi.<verse eid="GEN 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Epi li te vin ansent ankò. Li te fè yon fis, e li te di: “Fwa sa, mwen va louwe SENYÈ a.” Pou sa li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:8">Jen 49:8</ref></char></note>Juda. Epi konsa, li te vin sispann fè pitit.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Alò, lè Rachel te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Jen 29:31</ref></char></note>li pa t fè pitit pou Jacob, li te vin jalou. Li te di a Jacob: “Ban mwen pitit, oswa, m ap mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Epi chalè Jacob te brile kont Rachel. Li te di: “Èske mwen nan plas Bondye, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:18">Jen 20:18</ref></char></note>anpeche vant ou bay fwi a?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Li te reponn: “Men sèvant mwen an, Bilha, antre an relasyon avèk li pou li kapab pouse fè sou jenou mwen yo. Konsa, pa li menm, mwen kapab fè timoun tou.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:2">Jen 16:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:3-4">Jen 16:3-4</ref> </char></note>li te ba li sèvant li, Bilha kòm madanm, e li te antre nan relasyon avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Bilha te vin ansent, e li te fè yon fis pou Jacob.<verse eid="GEN 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Alò, Rachel te di: “Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:24">Sòm 35:24</ref></char></note>ban mwen rezon. Li te vrèman tande vwa m, e Li te ban mwen yon fis.” Pou sa, li te nonmen li Dan.<verse eid="GEN 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Sèvant a Rachel la, Bilha te vin ansent ankò, e li te fè pou Jacob yon dezyèm fis. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Alò, Rachel te di: “Avèk gwo lit mwen te mennen avèk sè mwen an, mwen te vrèman vin genyen l.” Epi li te nonmen li Nephtali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Lè Léa te wè ke li pa t fè pitit ankò, li te pran sèvant li a, Zilpa, e li te bay li a Jacob kòm madanm. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Sèvant a Léa a, Zilpa te fè yon fis pou Jacob. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Konsa, Léa te di: “A la chans!” Epi li te nonmen li Gad.<verse eid="GEN 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Sèvant Léa a, Zilpa te fè pou Jacob yon dezyèm fis. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Epi Léa te di: “A la kontan mwen kontan! Pou sa, fanm yo va rele mwen kontan.” Epi li te nonmen li Aser.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Alò, nan jou rekòlt ble yo, Reuben te sòti pou twouve mandragò nan chan an, e li te pote yo bay manman li, Léa. Alò, Rachel te di a Léa: “Souple, ban m kèk nan mandragò fis ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Men Léa te di l: “Èske se yon ti bagay sa ye pou ou pou pran mari mwen? Konsa, èske ou ta renmen pran mandragò a fis mwen yo tou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Rachel te reponn: “Pou sa, li kapab kouche avè ou aswè a, kòm twòk pou mandragò a fis ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Lè Jacob te sòti nan chan an nan aswè, alò, Léa te sòti pou rankontre li. Li te di l: “Ou oblije antre an relasyon ak mwen aswè a, paske vrèman mwen te achte ou avèk mandragò a fis mwen yo.” Epi li te kouche avèk li nan nwit lan.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Bondye te okipe Léa, e li te fè yon senkyèm fis pou Jacob. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Epi Léa te di: “Bondye te ban mwen salè mwen, akoz ke m te bay sèvant mwen an a mari mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Léa te vin ansent ankò, e li te fè yon sizyèm fis pou Jacob. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Alò Léa te di: “Bondye te ban mwen yon bon kado! Koulye a mari mwen va rete avè m akoz ke mwen fè sis fis pou li.” Alò li te nonmen li Zabulon.<verse eid="GEN 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Apre sa li te fè yon fi, e li te nonmen li Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:19-20">I Sam 1:19-20</ref> </char></note>Bondye te sonje Rachel. Li te okipe li, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Jen 29:31</ref> </char></note>louvri vant li. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Konsa, li te vin ansent, e li te fè yon fis. Konsa, li te di: “Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:1">És 4:1</ref></char></note>retire repwòch mwen.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Li te rele li Joseph, e li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:17">Jen 35:17</ref></char></note>Ke SENYÈ a ban m yon lòt fis.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Alò, li te rive ke lè Rachel te fè Joseph, Jacob te di a Laban: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:54-56">Jen 24:54-56</ref> </char></note>Voye mwen ale, pou mwen kapab ale nan pwòp plas mwen e nan pwòp peyi mwen. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Ban mwen madanm mwen yo, ak pitit mwen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:18-27">Jen 29:18-27</ref> </char></note>pou sila mwen te sèvi ou yo. Kite mwen pati, paske ou menm ou konnen sèvis ke m te rann ou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Men Laban te di li: “Si sa fè ou plezi, rete avè m; mwen devine <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:18-27">Jen 29:18-27</ref> </char></note>ke Bondye te beni mwen akoz ou menm.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Li te pale toujou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:15">Jen 29:15</ref></char></note>“Nonmen salè ou, e mwen va ba ou li”.<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Men li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:6">Jen 31:6</ref></char></note>“Ou menm ou konnen jan mwen te sèvi ou, ak jan bèt ou yo te byen okipe avè m. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Paske ou pa t gen anpil lè m te vini an, yo vin miltipliye anpil, e SENYÈ a te beni ou tout kote ke m vire. Men koulye a, se lè pou mwen okipe pwòp lakay mwen tou?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Epi Laban te di: “Kisa mwen kapab ba ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Epi Jacob te reponn: “Ou pa bezwen ban m anyen. Si w ap fè yon sèl bagay pou mwen, mwen va okipe bann ou yo ankò, epi kenbe yo. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Kite mwen pase nan tout bann mouton ou yo, pou retire chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:8">Jen 31:8</ref></char></note>mouton ki takte, oswa trase, avèk tout sa ki nwa pami ti mouton yo, chak sa ki takte oswa trase pami kabrit yo. Se sa yo ki va sèvi kòm salè mwen. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Konsa entegrite mwen va reponn pou mwen pita, lè ou vin parèt konsènan salè mwen. Chak sa ki pa takte, oswa trase pami kabrit yo, e ki nwa pami jenn mouton yo, si li twouve avè m, konsidere ke mwen te vòlè l.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Laban te di li: “Sa bon. Kite sa fèt selon pawòl ou.”<verse eid="GEN 30:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Alò, nan menm jou sa a, li te rete tout mal kabrit ki te trase, oswa takte, ak tout femèl kabrit ki te takte, chak ki te gen blan ladann, ak tout nwa pami mouton yo, e li te bay fis li yo okipe yo. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Epi li te mete yon distans twa jou antre li menm avèk Jacob, e Jacob te bay manje a tout rès bann mouton yo pou Laban.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Jacob te pran bwa vèt nan pye sikrèn, pye zanmann, ak pye bwadòm, e li te kale tras blan nan yo pou fè parèt blan ki te nan bwa yo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Li te plase bwa li te kale yo devan bann mouton yo, nan flèv dlo yo, e nan basen dlo kote bann mouton yo te vin bwè a. Se la yo te kwaze lè yo te vin pou bwè. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Alò, bann mouton yo te kwaze kote bwa kale yo, e yo te fè pote sa ki te trase, takte e pentle yo.<verse eid="GEN 30:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Jacob te separe ti mouton yo, e te fè bann mouton yo rete anfas, pou yo t ap gade tout sa ki te trase yo, ak tout nwa yo, ki te nan bann mouton Laban yo. Li te mete pwòp bann mouton li yo apa, pou yo pa t avèk bann mouton Laban yo. <verse eid="GEN 30:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Anplis de sa, nenpòt kilè bèt ki pi fò nan bann mouton yo ta kwaze, Jacob ta mete bwa yo devan zye a bèt ki nan basen dlo yo, pou yo ta kwaze akote bwa yo; <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>men lè bann mouton an te fèb, li pa t mete yo ladann. Konsa pi fèb yo te vin pou Laban, e pi fò yo pou Jacob.<verse eid="GEN 30:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:16">Jen 12:16</ref></char></note>nonm nan te vin pwospere anpil. Li te vin gen gwo bann mouton, sèvant ak sèvitè, chamo avèk bourik.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Alò, Jacob te tande pawòl fis Laban yo ki te vin di: “Jacob te retire tout sa ki te pou papa nou, e avèk sa ki te pou papa nou, li te fè tout richès li.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Jacob te wè konpòtman Laban, e gade byen, li pa t emab anvè li jan li te ye avan an.<verse eid="GEN 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di a Jacob: “Retounen nan peyi a zansèt ou yo, a moun ou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref></char></note>mwen va avèk ou.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Alò Jacob te voye rele Rachel avèk Léa vè bann mouton li nan chan an. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Konsa, li te di yo: “Mwen wè ke konpòtman papa nou anvè mwen menm pa emab jan li te ye lontan an, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Jen 21:22</ref></char></note>Bondye a papa m nan te avèk mwen. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:29">Jen 30:29</ref></char></note>Nou konnen ke mwen te sèvi papa nou avèk tout fòs mwen. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Malgre sa, papa nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:25">Jen 29:25</ref></char></note>twonpe mwen, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Jen 31:41</ref></char></note>chanje salè mwen dis fwa, men Bondye pa t kite li fè m donmaj. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:32">Jen 30:32</ref></char></note>li te pale konsa: ‘Takte yo se salè ou’, alò, tout bann mouton yo te bay pitit takte. Epi si li te pale konsa ke trase yo te salè ou, alò tout bann mouton yo te bay pitit trase. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Konsa Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:1-6">Jen 31:1-6</ref> </char></note>retire bèt yo nan men papa ou, e Li te ban mwen yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Epi li te rive ke lè bann mouton yo a t ap kwaze, ke mwen te leve zye mwen, mwen te wè nan yon rèv, e gade byen, mal kabrit ki t ap kwaze yo te trase, takte, e mele.<verse eid="GEN 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>“Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:7-11">Jen 16:7-11</ref></char></note>zanj Bondye a te di mwen nan rèv la: ‘Jacob,’ epi mwen te di: ‘Men mwen.’<verse eid="GEN 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>“Li te di: ‘Koulye a leve zye ou, pou wè ke tout mal kabrit ki t ap kwaze yo te trase, takte, e mele, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Egz 3:7</ref> </char></note>Mwen te wè tout sa ke Laban te fè ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Mwen menm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-19">Jen 28:13-19</ref> </char></note>Bondye a Béthel la, kote ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-20">Jen 28:18-20</ref> </char></note> vide lwil sou yon pilye, kote ou te fè sèman a Mwen menm nan. Konsa, leve, kite tè sa a, e retounen nan peyi nesans ou a.’”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Rachel avèk Léa te di li: “Èske nou gen yon pati nan eritaj lakay papa nou an ki rete? <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Èske li pa rekonèt nou kòm etranje? Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:20-27">Jen 29:20-27</ref> </char></note>li gen tan vann nou. Anplis, li te manje tout byen nou ranmase. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Vrèman, tout byen ke Bondye te rachte nan men papa nou yo, se pou nou avèk pitit nou ke yo ye. Alò, fè sa ke Bondye te di ou fè a.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Alò, Jacob te leve. Li te mete pitit li yo avèk madanm li yo sou chamo yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>Konsa, li te voye pouse tout bèt yo avèk tout byen ke li te rasanble yo, bèt ke li te vin gen nan Paddan-Aram yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Jen 35:27</ref></char></note>pou ale nan peyi Canaan vè papa li, Isaac.<verse eid="GEN 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Lè Laban te ale pou taye plim mouton li yo, Rachel te vòlè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:30-34">Jen 31:30-34</ref></char></note>zidòl lakay ki te pou papa li yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Konsa, Jacob te twonpe Laban, Arameyen an. Li pa t di li ke li t ap sove ale. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Li te sove ale avèk tout sa ke li te genyen, epi li te leve pou travèse lariviyè Euphrate la, ak figi li byen fikse vè peyi mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:25">Jen 37:25</ref></char></note>Galaad yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Lè yo te di Laban nan twazyèm jou ke Jacob te sove ale a, <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>li te pran moun fanmi li yo, pou l te kouri dèyè li pandan sèt jou. Konsa, li te vin rive devan li nan ti kolin nan peyi Galaad yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 20:3">Jen 20:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye te parèt a Laban, Arameyen an, nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:11">Jen 31:11</ref></char></note>rèv nan nwit lan. Li te di li: “Fè atansyon pou ou pa pale a Jacob ni byen, ni mal.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Laban te vin rive devan Jacob. Alò Jacob te monte tant li nan peyi kolin yo, e Laban avèk moun pa li yo te rete nan peyi kolin Galaad yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Alò, Laban te di a Jacob: “Kisa ou te fè m la a lè ou te twonpe m e fè eskalad avèk fi mwen yo tankou prizonyè ki sou nepe? <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Poukisa ou te sove ale an sekrè? Ou fè m desepsyon sa a, e ou pa di m sa pou m ta kapab voye ou ale avèk jwa, ak chante, tanbouren ak ap? <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Ou pa t menm kite m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:55">Jen 31:55</ref></char></note>bo fis mwen yo, ak fi mwen yo. Alò, ou gen tan fè betiz. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Li nan pouvwa mwen pou m fè nou mal, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:5-53">Jen 31:5-53</ref> </char></note>Bondye a papa ou a te pale avèk mwen yèswa. Li te di: ‘Pinga ou pale ni byen, ni mal a Jacob’. <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Alò, vrèman ou te sòti paske ou te anvi wè lakay papa ou, men poukisa ou te vòlè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19">Jen 31:19</ref></char></note>dye mwen yo?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Jacob te reponn Laban: “Akoz ke m te pè, paske mwen te panse ke ou ta rachte fi ou yo nan men mwen pa lafòs. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:9">Jen 44:9</ref></char></note>Sila ki twouve avèk dye ou yo p ap viv. Nan prezans tout fanmi nou yo, montre m sa ki pou ou nan byen mwen yo, e pran li pou ou menm.” Paske Jacob pa t konnen ke Rachel te gen tan vòlè yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Alò, Laban te antre nan tant Jacob la, nan tant Léa a, ak nan tant sèvant yo, men li pa t twouve yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Alò, Rachel te pran zidòl lakay yo. Li te mete yo nan sèl chamo a, e li te chita sou yo. Konsa, Laban te manyen toupatou nan tant lan, men li pa t twouve yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Li te di a papa li: “Pa kite mèt mwen an fache avè m, pwiske mwen p ap ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:32">Lev 19:32</ref></char></note>leve devan ou, paske se règ mwen ki sou mwen.” Alò, li te chache, men li pa t jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19">Jen 31:19</ref></char></note>zidòl kay yo.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Alò, Jacob te vin fache. Li te konfwonte Laban. Jacob te di l: “Ki tò mwen te fè ou? Ki peche mwen te fè konsa pou ou vin pouswiv mwen tou cho konsa? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Malgre ou gen tan manyen tout afè m, kisa ou te twouve ladan yo ki pou lakay ou? Mete li isit la devan moun pa m avèk moun pa ou yo, pou yo ka pran yon desizyon antre nou de a.<verse eid="GEN 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>“Pandan ventan mwen te la avè w. Mouton ou yo avèk kabrit ou yo pa janm pèdi pitit, ni mwen pa t manje belye nan bann mouton ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Sa ki te chire pa bèt sovaj, èske m pa te pote yo bay ou? Mwen te fè pèt la pou kont mwen. Se konsa ou te egzije sa ki nan men m, sof ke sa ki vòlè nan lajounen, sof ke sa ki vòlè nan lannwit. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Konsa mwen te ye: Nan lajounen, solèy la te manje m, fredi nan lannwit, e dòmi te vòlè sove ale nan zye mwen. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Pandan ven ane sa yo, mwen te lakay ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:27-30">Jen 29:27-30</ref> </char></note>Mwen te sèvi ou katòz ane pou de fi ou yo, sis ane pou bann mouton ou yo, e ou te fè chanjman salè mwen dis fwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Si Bondye a papa m nan, Bondye a Abraham nan pa t pou mwen, vrèman koulye a ou t ap kab voye m ale men vid. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Egz 3:7</ref> </char></note>Bondye te wè afliksyon mwen, ak travay di ke men m te gen tan fè, epi Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:24-29">Jen 31:24-29</ref> </char></note>rann jijman an yèswa.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Laban te reponn a Jacob: “Fi yo se fi m, pitit yo se pitit mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:1">Jen 31:1</ref></char></note>bann mouton yo se bann mouton mwen. Tout sa ou wè la yo se pa m. Men kisa m ka fè nan jou sa pou sila yo, a fi mwen yo, oswa a pitit pa yo ke yo te fè? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Alò, kounye a vin non, annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:27-32">Jen 21:27-32</ref> </char></note>fè yon akò, ou menm avèk mwen menm. Annou fè li kòm yon temwen antre ou menm avèk mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Konsa, Jacob te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Jen 28:18</ref></char></note>yon gwo wòch. Li te fè l kanpe tankou yon pilye. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Jacob te di a tout relasyon fanmi pa li a: “Sanble wòch”! Epi yo te pran wòch yo. Yo te fè yon gwo pil, e yo te manje la akote pil la. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Alò Laban <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:34">Jos 22:34</ref></char></note>te rele la Jegar-Sahadutha, men Jacob te rele l Galed.<verse eid="GEN 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Laban te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:27">Jos 24:27</ref></char></note>Gwo pil wòch sa se yon temwen antre ou menm avèk mwen menm jodi a.” Konsa, li te rele l Galed, <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>epi osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:29">Jij 11:29</ref></char></note>Mitspa, paske li te di: “Ke Bondye kapab gade antre ou menm avèk mwen lè nou vin absan de youn lòt. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Si ou maltrete fi mwen yo, oswa si ou pran madanm anplis ke fi mwen yo, malgre pèsòn pa avèk nou, ou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:23">Jr 29:23</ref> </char></note>Bondye se temwen antre ou menm avèk mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Laban te di a Jacob: “Gade byen gwo pil sa a, e veye byen gwo pilye ke m etabli antre ou menm avèk mwen an. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Gwo pil sa a se yon temwen. Pilye a se yon temwen ke mwen p ap pase vè gwo pil sa a pou fè ou mal, e ou p ap pase gwo pil sa a vè mwen pou fè m mal. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Bondye Abraham nan ak Bondye Nachor a, Bondye a papa pa yo a, vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:5">Jen 16:5</ref></char></note>jij antre nou menm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Konsa Jacob te sèmante pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:42">Jen 31:42</ref></char></note>krent a papa l, Isaac. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Alò, Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:12">Egz 18:12</ref></char></note>ofri yon sakrifis sou mòn nan. Li te rele tout gwo fanmi li yo pou vin manje pen. Yo te manje pen sa a, e yo te pase nwit lan sou mòn nan.<verse eid="GEN 31:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Granmmaten, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:28">Jen 31:28</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 31:43">43</ref></char></note> Laban te leve. Li te bo fis li yo ak fi li yo, e li te beni yo. Alò, Laban te retounen nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Alò, pandan Jacob te fin pran wout li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:16-17">II Wa 6:16-17</ref></char></note>zanj Bondye yo te rankontre li. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Jacob te di lè li te wè yo: “Sa se lame Bondye a.” Konsa, li te nonmen plas sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:38">Jos 21:38</ref></char></note>Mahanaïm.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Alò, Jacob te voye mesaje yo devan li kote frè li Ésaü nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:16">Jen 14:16</ref></char></note>Séir a nan teritwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:30">Jen 25:30</ref></char></note>Édom an. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Li te bay mesaje yo lòd, e li te di: “Konsa ou va pale a mèt mwen an, Ésaü: ‘Men sa ke sèvitè ou, Jacob di ou: Mwen te vin rete avèk Laban, e mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Jen 31:41</ref></char></note>demere la jis rive koulye a. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Mwen gen bèf avèk bourik, avèk bann mouton, sèvitè avèk sèvant. M ap voye pou di mèt mwen sa, pou m kapab vin jwenn favè nan zye w.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Mesaje yo te retounen vè Jacob. Yo te di li: “Nou te rankontre frè ou Ésaü. Konsa, li ap vin kote ou avèk kat-san òm.”<verse eid="GEN 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Epi Jacob te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:11">Jen 32:11</ref></char></note>pè anpil, e byen twouble. Li te divize moun ki te avè l yo, bann mouton, twoupo bèf ak chamo pou fè de konpanyen. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Konsa, li te di: “Si Ésaü ta vin atake youn nan konpanyen yo, alò, konpanyen ki rete a va chape.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Jacob te di: “O Bondye a papa m nan Abraham e Bondye a papa m nan Isaac, O SENYÈ ki te di mwen an: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref></char></note>‘Retounen nan peyi ou, e a moun fanmi ou yo, e mwen va fè ou vin pwospere,’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>mwen pa merite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:27">Jen 24:27</ref></char></note>tout lanmou, mizerikòd ak fidelite ke ou te montre sèvitè ou a; paske se sèl avèk baton mwen ke m te travèse rivyè Jourdain an, men koulye a nou vin de konpanyen. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 59:1-2">Sòm 59:1-2</ref></char></note>Delivre mwen, souple <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:41-42">Jen 27:41-42</ref></char></note>anba men frè m nan, anba men Ésaü; paske mwen pè li, pou li pa vin atake mwen avèk manman yo, ak timoun yo. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Paske ou te di: ‘Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:14">Jen 28:14</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè nou vin pwospere, e fè desandan nou yo vin tankou sab lanmè a, k ap twò gran pou konte.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Epi li te pase nwit lan la. Alò, li te chwazi nan sa li te gen avè l yo kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:11">Jen 43:11</ref></char></note>kado pou frè li, Ésaü: <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>De-san kabrit femèl, ven kabrit mal, de-san femèl mouton, ak ven mal, <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>trant chamo ki t ap bay lèt a pitit pa yo, karant bèf avèk dis towo, ven bourik femèl, ak dis ti bourik.<verse eid="GEN 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Li te livre yo nan men a sèvitè li yo. Chak ekip te mache pou kont li, e li te di a sèvitè li yo: “Pase devan m, e mete yon espas antre de bann yo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Li te kòmande sila ki te devan an e li te di li: “Lè frè m Ésaü vin rankontre ou, e mande ou: ‘Pou kilès ou ye, kibò w prale, e pou kilès bèt sa yo ki devan ou yo ye?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Alò, ou va di: ‘Se pou sèvitè ou, Jacob. Se yon kado ke li voye bay mèt mwen, Ésaü. Men gade byen, li la dèyè nou.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Li te kòmande osi a dezyèm nan, a twazyèm nan, ak tout sa ki te swiv ekip yo, e li te di: “Se konsa nou va pale avèk Ésaü lè nou rankontre li. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Ou va di: ‘Gade, men sèvitè ou Jacob dèyè nou an tou.’ Paske li te di: ‘Mwen va satisfè li avèk kado ki ale devan m yo. E apre, mwen va wè figi li. Petèt li kapab aksepte mwen.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Epi kado a te pase devan li, e li menm te pase nwit lan menm kote li te fè kan an.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Alò, li te leve pandan menm nwit lan, e li te pran de madanm li yo avèk de sèvant li yo, onz pitit li yo, e li te travèse lariviyè a bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:16">Det 3:16</ref></char></note>Jabbok la. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Li te pran yo, e li te voye yo travèse dlo a. Konsa, li te voye travèse ak tout sa li te genyen.<verse eid="GEN 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Konsa, Jacob te rete tout sèl, e yon nonm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Os 12:3-4</ref></char></note>vin lite avèk li jis rive granmmaten. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Lè li te wè ke li pa t genyen l, li te touche gwo jwenti janm li (anwo kote l tache nan kò a), epi li te vin dejwente pandan li t ap lite avè l. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Epi nonm nan te di: “Lage m, paske jou a pwòch.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Men Jacob te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:4">Os 12:4</ref></char></note>Mwen p ap lage ou amwenske ke ou beni m.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Alò, li te di li: “Kòman yo rele ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Li te reponn: “Jacob.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Li te di: “Yo p ap rele ou Jacob ankò, men Israël; paske ou te lite avèk Bondye, e avèk lòm, epi ou te reyisi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Jij 13:17-18</ref> </char></note>Jacob te mande li: “Souple, di m non ou.” Li te reponn: “Poukisa ou mande m non mwen?” Epi li te beni li la. <verse eid="GEN 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Konsa, Jacob te nonmen kote sa Peniel, paske li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:13">Jen 16:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te wè Bondye fasafas, malgre sa, vi mwen te prezève.”<verse eid="GEN 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Alò, solèy la te leve sou li nan menm moman li t ap travèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:8">Jij 8:8</ref></char></note>Peniel la, e li te bwate akoz gwo janm nan. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Pou sa, jis jounen jodi a, fis Israël yo pa manje tandon ki tache nan gwo janm nan avèk anch ki sou jwenti a, akoz ke li te touche jwenti gwo janm nan tandon ki tache nan anch lan.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Alò, Jacob te leve zye li. Li te gade, e gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:6">Jen 32:6</ref> </char></note>Ésaü t ap vini, ak kat-san òm avèk li. Konsa, li te divize pitit yo pami Léa avèk Rachel avèk de sèvant yo. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Li te mete sèvant li yo devan, Léa avèk pitit li yo dèyè yo, e Rachel avèk Joseph an dènye. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Men li menm te pran devan yo. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:2">Jen 42:2</ref></char></note>bese jis atè sèt fwa, jiskaske li te rive toupre frè li a.<verse eid="GEN 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Ésaü te kouri al jwenn li. Li te anbrase li, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:14-15">Jen 45:14-15</ref> </char></note>tonbe nan kou li e li te bo li. Konsa, yo te kriye. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Li te leve zye li pou wè fanm yo, e li te di: “Se kilès? Sila yo ki avèk ou la a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Epi Jacob te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:9">Jen 48:9</ref> </char></note>Pitit ke Bondye nan gras li te bay sèvitè ou.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Alò, sèvant lakay yo te vin pwoche avèk pitit pa yo, e yo te bese ba. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Léa tou te apwoche avèk pitit li yo. Yo te bese ba. Apre, Joseph te vini avèk Rachel, e yo te bese ba.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Ésaü te di: “Kisa ou vle di ak tout ekip sa yo ke m rankontre la a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Jacob te reponn: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:5">Jen 32:5</ref> </char></note>Pou jwenn favè nan zye a mèt mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Men Ésaü te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">Jen 27:39-40</ref> </char></note>Mwen gen kont mwen, frè m; kite sa ou genyen yo rete pou ou.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Jacob te di: “Non, souple, si koulye a mwen twouve favè nan zye ou, alò, pran kado a nan men m, paske mwen wè figi ou tankou yon moun ki vin wè figi a Bondye, e ou te byen resevwa m. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Souple, pran kado ki te pote pou ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:43">Jen 30:43</ref></char></note>paske Bondye te aji avèk gras anvè mwen, e akoz sa m gen anpil:” Konsa, li te vin ankouraje l, e li te aksepte li.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Konsa, Esaü te di: “Annou fè vwayaj nou. Ann ale, e mwen va ale devan nou.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Men Jacob te di li: “Mèt mwen, ou konnen ke timoun yo frajil, e ke bann mouton avèk twoupo k ap bay tete yo se yon tèt chaje pou mwen. Si yo pouse twòp, menm pou yon jou, yo va mouri. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Souple, kite mèt mwen an pase devan sèvitè li. Mwen menm mwen va avanse pi dousman, selon nesesite bèt ki devan m yo, ak selon vitès a timoun yo, jis lè m rive vè mèt mwen an nan Séir.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Ésaü te di: “Souple, kite mwen ba ou kèk nan moun ki avè m yo.” Men li te di: “Poukisa ou fè sa? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:13">Rt 2:13</ref> </char></note>Kite mwen jwenn favè nan zye a mèt mwen an.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Konsa, Ésaü te fè wout li pou Séir menm jou sa a. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Jacob te vwayaje a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:27">Jos 13:27</ref> </char></note>Succoth. Li te bati pou li menm yon kay, e li te fè pak pou tout bèt li yo, epi pou sa, yo rele plas la Succoth.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Alò, Jacob te rive san pwoblèm nan vil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:1">Jos 24:1</ref></char></note>Sichem nan peyi Canaan, lè li te sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:2">Jen 28:2</ref></char></note>Paddan-Aram. Li te fè kan an devan vil la. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref></char></note>Li te achte yon mòso tè kote li te monte tant li nan men fis Hamor yo, papa Sichem nan, pou sòm a san pyès lajan. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Alò, la li te monte yon lotèl, e li te rele li El-Elohé-Israël.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:21">Jen 30:21</ref></char></note>Dina, fi Léa te fè pou Jacob la te sòti pou vizite fi peyi yo nan kote sa a. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Lè Sichem, fis Hamor a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:30">Jen 34:30</ref></char></note>Evyen an, prens nan peyi a te wè li, li te pran li, e pa lafòs, li te kouche avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Li te vrèman atire a Dina, fi Jacob la. Li te renmen fi a, e li te pale ak dousè avè l. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Alò, Sichem te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:2">Jij 14:2</ref></char></note>pale avèk papa l Hamor. Li te di: “Fè m jwenn jèn fi sa a pou madanm.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Alò, Jacob te tande ke li te vyole Dina, fi li a, men fis li yo te avèk bèt yo nan chan an. Alò, li te rete san pale jis lè yo te vin antre.<verse eid="GEN 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Hamor, papa a Sichem, te vin deyò a pou pale avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Alò, fis a Jacob yo te sòti nan chan an lè yo te tande koze sa a. Konsa, mesye yo te blese. Yo te vin byen fache, akoz ke li te fè yon choz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:20-30">Det 22:20-30</ref></char></note>meprizab an Israël lè li te kouche avèk fi Jacob la, paske yon bagay konsa pa t dwe fèt.<verse eid="GEN 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Men Hamor te pale avèk yo. Li te di: “Nanm fis mwen an, Sichem anvi fi ou a anpil. Pou sa, silvouplè, ba li li pou yo marye. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Annou marye yo youn pou lòt. Bay fi ou yo a nou menm, e pran fi nou yo pou ou menm. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Konsa, ou va viv avèk nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:9">Jen 13:9</ref></char></note>peyi a va vin ouvri devan nou. Viv ladann, e fè afè nou yo ladann.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Sichem te di osi a papa ak frè a Dina, “Kite mwen twouve favè nan zye nou. Konsa, mwen va bannou nenpòt sa ke nou mande m. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Mande m tan kòm pèyman avèk kado, e mwen va bannou nenpòt sa nou mande mwen, men ban mwen fi a pou marye.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Konsa, fis Jacob yo te reponn Sichem avèk papa li Hamor avèk desepsyon, akoz ke li te vyole Dina, sè yo a. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Yo te di yo: “Nou pa kapab fè bagay sa a, pou bay sè nou an a yon moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4">Jen 17:4</ref></char></note>pa sikonsi. Sa ta yon wont pou nou tout. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Sou yon sèl kondisyon nou ta kapab dakò: si nou va vini tankou nou. Sa vle di ke chak mal nan nou ta vin sikonsi. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Konsa, nou va bay sè nou yo a nou menm, nou va viv avèk nou e vin yon sèl pèp. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Men si nou pa koute nou pou vin sikonsi, alò, n ap pran sè nou an e ale.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Alò, pawòl pa yo a te parèt rezonab a Hamor avèk Sichem, fis Hamor a. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Jennonm sa a pa t pèdi tan pou fè bagay la, paske li te tèlman kontan avèk fi Jacob la. Epi li te jwenn respe depase tout moun ki lakay papa li a. <verse eid="GEN 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Konsa, Hamor, avèk fis li a, Sichem te vini nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rt 4:1</ref></char></note>pòtay vil yo, li te pale avèk mesye nan vil yo, e li te di: <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>“Moun sa yo se zanmi nou yo ye; pou sa, annou kite yo viv nan peyi a pou fè komès ladann, paske, gade byen, peyi a ase gran pou yo. Annou pran fi yo an maryaj, e bay fi nou yo a yo menm.<verse eid="GEN 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>“Se sèl sou kondisyon sa a ke moun sa yo va vin dakò pou vin viv avèk nou, pou vin yon sèl pèp; ke chak mal pami nou vin sikonsi tankou yo menm tou deja sikonsi a. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Se pa ke bèt, byen ak tout zannimo yo va vin pou nou? Sèlman annou vin dakò avèk yo, e yo va viv avèk nou.”<verse eid="GEN 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Tout sa yo ki te sòti nan pòtay lavil la te koute Hamor, avèk fis li a, Sichem. Konsa, chak mal te sikonsi, tout moun ki te sòti nan pòtay vil la.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Alò, li te rive nan twazyèm jou a, lè yo te nan doulè, de nan fis a Jacob yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:5-7">Jen 49:5-7</ref></char></note>Siméon avèk Lévi, frè a Dina yo, yo chak te pran nepe yo. Yo te vini sou vil la san yo pa konnen, e yo te touye tout mal yo. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Yo te touye Hamor avèk fis li a, Sichem, avèk lam file a nepe yo. Yo te pran Dina soti lakay Sichem nan, e yo te ale. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Fis Jacob yo te vini sou mò yo. Yo te piyaje vil la akoz ke yo te vyole sè yo a. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Yo te pran bann mouton, twoupo ak bourik, sa ki te nan vil la, ak sa ki te nan chan an. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Epi yo te kaptire e piyaje tout byen yo, tout pitit yo, madanm yo, menm tout sa ki te lakay yo.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Alò Jacob te di a Siméon avèk Lévi: “Nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:25">Jos 7:25</ref></char></note>pote pwoblèm pou mwen akoz ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:21">Egz 5:21</ref></char></note>fè m vin rayi pa abitan peyi yo, pami Kananeyen avèk Ferezyen yo. Epi akoz ke gason nou yo pa anpil, yo va rasanble kont mwen, pou atake mwen, e mwen va vin detwi, mwen menm avèk tout lakay mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Men yo te di: “Èske yo ta dwe trete sè nou an tankou yon pwostitiye?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Alò, Bondye te di a Jacob: “Leve ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>Béthel e rete la. Fè yon lotèl la pou Bondye ki te parèt devan ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:43">Jen 27:43</ref></char></note>lè ou te sove ale sou frè ou a, Ésaü.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Alò, Jacob te di moun lakay li yo, ak tout sa ki te avè l yo: “Mete deyò tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19-34">Jen 31:19-34</ref> </char></note>dye etranje yo ki pami nou, pirifye nou, e chanje rad nou. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Annou leve monte Béthel. Mwen va fè yon lotèl la pou Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:6">Sòm 107:6</ref></char></note>ki te reponn mwen nan jou detrès mwen an, e ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref></char></note>avèk mwen nan tout kote ke m te konn ale yo.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Alò, yo te bay Jacob tout dye etranje ke yo te genyen yo, ak zanno ki te nan zòrèy yo, e Jacob te antere kache yo anba chenn ki te toupre Sichem nan. <verse eid="GEN 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Pandan yo t ap vwayaje, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:16">Egz 15:16</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz te vin sou vil ki te ozanviwon yo, e yo pa t swiv fis a Jacob yo.<verse eid="GEN 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Alò, Jacob te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>Luz (sa vle di, Béthel), ki nan peyi Canaan an, li menm avèk tout moun ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:3">Jen 35:3</ref></char></note>Li te bati yon lotèl la, e li te rele plas la, El-Béthel, akoz ke se la Bondye te revele Li menm a li lè li te sove ale kite frè l la.<verse eid="GEN 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Alò, Débora, nouris Rebecca a, te mouri, e li te antere anba Béthel anba chenn nan. Bwa sa a te rele Allon-bacuth (ki vle di chenn k ap kriye a).<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Alò, Bondye te vin parèt a Jacob ankò lè li te sòti Paddan-Aram, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:29">Jen 32:29</ref></char></note>beni li. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Jen 17:5</ref></char></note>Bondye te di li: “Non ou se Jacob. Yo p ap rele ou Jacob ankò, men Israël va non ou.” Konsa li te rele li Israël.<verse eid="GEN 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Bondye osi te di li: “Mwen se Bondye Toupwisan an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:1-7">Jen 9:1-7</ref></char></note>Fè fwi, e vin miltipliye. Yon nasyon ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:4">Jen 48:4</ref></char></note>gwo konpanyen nasyon va soti nan ou, e wa yo va sòti nan ou. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref></char></note>Peyi ke M te bay Abraham, ak Isaac la, Mwen va ba ou li, ak desandan apre ou yo.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:22">Jen 17:22</ref></char></note>Bondye te monte kite li nan plas kote Li te pale avèk li a.<verse eid="GEN 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Jacob te etabli yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Jen 28:18-19</ref> </char></note>pilye nan plas kote Li te pale avèk li a, yon pilye wòch. Li te vide yon bwason kòm ofrann sou li; epi osi li te vide yon lwil sou li. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Alò, Jacob te nonmen plas kote Bondye te pale avèk li a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>Béthel. <verse eid="GEN 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Yo te vwayaje sòti Béthel. Lè te toujou gen yon distans pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:19">Jen 35:19</ref></char></note>Éphrata, Rachel te kòmanse fè pitit li, e li te soufri yon doulè ki te difisil. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Lè li te nan doulè rèd konsa, fanm saj la te di l: “Pa pè koulye a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:24">Jen 30:24</ref></char></note>ou va gen yon lòt gason.”<verse eid="GEN 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Li te rive, ke pandan nanm li t ap pati (paske li t ap mouri), ke li te nonmen li Ben-Oni; men papa li te rele li Benjamin.<verse eid="GEN 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:7">Jen 48:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rachel te mouri e li te antere nan wout pou ale Éphrata a (sa vle di, Bethléem). <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Jacob te monte yon pilye sou tonm li an, e sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:2">I Sam 12:2</ref></char></note>pilye a tonm Rachel jiska jounen jodi a.<verse eid="GEN 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Israël te avanse e li te monte tant li an pi lwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:8">Mi 4:8</ref></char></note>tou Migdal-Éder a. <verse eid="GEN 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Konsa, li te rive ke pandan Israël t ap viv nan peyi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Jen 49:4</ref></char></note>Reuben te ale kouche avèk Bilha, youn nan fanm a papa li yo, e Israël te tande koze sa a. Alò, te gen douz fis fèt pa Jacob— <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Jen 49:4</ref></char></note>fis a Léa yo: Reuben, premye ne a Jacob la, ak Siméon, Lévi, Juda, Issacar avèk Zabulon, <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:22-24">Jen 30:22-24</ref></char></note>fis a Rachel yo: Joseph avèk Benjamin; <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:5-8">Jen 30:5-8</ref> </char></note>fis a Bilha yo, sèvant Rachel la: Dan avèk Nephthali; <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:10-13">Jen 30:10-13</ref></char></note>fis Zilpa yo, sèvant Léa a: Gad avèk Aser. Sa yo se fis Jacob yo ki te fèt a li menm nan Paddan-Aram.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Jacob te vini vè papa li, Isaac nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Jen 13:18</ref></char></note>Mamré pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:15">Jos 14:15</ref></char></note>Kirjath-Arba (ki se Hébron), kote Abraham avèk Isaac te demere a.<verse eid="GEN 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Alò, jou Isaac yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Jen 25:26</ref></char></note>san-katre-ven ane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>Isaac te rann dènye souf li. Li te mouri, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:8">Jen 25:8</ref></char></note>rasanble vè moun li yo, yon granmoun anpil laj. Konsa, Ésaü avèk Jacob te antere li.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Alò, sa yo se achiv jenerasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:30">Jen 25:30</ref></char></note>Ésaü yo, (sa vle di, Edom).<verse eid="GEN 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Ésaü te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Jen 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 36:25">Jen 36:25</ref></char></note>pran madanm pami fi Canaan yo: Ada, fi Elon an, Etyen an, Oholibama, fi Ana a, ak gran fi a Tsibeon an, Evyen an. <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>Anplis, Basamath, fi Ismaël la, sè Nebajoth la.<verse eid="GEN 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada te fè Eliphaz bay Ésaü, e Basamath te fè Réuel; <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Epi Oholibama te fè Jéusch, Jaelam, ak Koré. Sa yo se fis Ésaü ki te fèt a li menm nan peyi Canaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:5">Jen 12:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi Ésaü te pran madanm li yo, fis ak fi li yo avèk tout lakay li, bèt li yo avèk tout bèf li yo, ak tout byen ke li te ranmase nan peyi Canaan yo, e li te ale nan yon lòt peyi, lwen frè li a, Jacob. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Paske byen yo te vin twò gran pou yo ta viv ansanm, e peyi kote yo te demere a pa t kab pran yo akoz tout bèt yo te genyen yo. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Konsa, Ésaü te viv nan peyi kolin yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:3">Jen 32:3</ref></char></note>Séir. Ésaü se menm avèk Édom.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Alò, sa yo se achiv a jenerasyon Ésaü yo, papa a Edomit yo nan peyi kolin yo nan Séir.<verse eid="GEN 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Alò men non a fis Ésaü yo: Éliphaz, fis Ada a madanm Ésaü a, Réuel, fis Basamath la, madanm a Ésaü a.<verse eid="GEN 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Fis Éliphaz yo te: Théman, Omar, Tsepho, Gaetham, ak Kenaz.<verse eid="GEN 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Thimna te fanm lakay Éliphaz, fis Ésaü a; li te fè Amalek pou Éliphaz. Sila yo se fis Ada yo, madanm Ésaü a.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Sa yo se fis Réuel yo: Nahath, Zérach, Schamma, ak Mizza. Sa yo se te fis Basamath yo, madanm Ésaü a.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Sa yo se te fis madanm Ésaü a, Oholibama, fi Ana a, ki te pitit pitit Tsibeon an: li te fè pou Ésaü, Jéusch, Jaelam, ak Koré.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Men chèf a fis Ésaü yo. Fis Éliphaz yo, premye ne Ésaü a, se chèf Théman, chèf Omar, chèf Tsepho, chèf Kenatz, <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>chèf Koré, chèf Gaetham, chèf Amalek. Sa yo se chèf ki te desandan Eliphaz nan peyi Edom an. Sa yo se fis a Ada yo.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Men fis Réuel, ki te fis Ésaü yo: chèf Nahath, chèf Zérach, chèf Schamma, chèf Mizza. Sa yo se chèf ki te desandan a Réuel yo, nan peyi Edom an. Sa yo se fis a Basamath, madanm a Ésaü a.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Sa yo se fis a Oholibama yo, madanm a Ésaü a; chèf Jéusch, chèf Jaelam, chèf Koré. Sa yo se chèf ki te desandan pa Oholibama a, madanm a Ésaü a, fi a Ana a.<verse eid="GEN 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Sila yo se fis a Ésaü yo (sa vle di Édom), e sa yo se chèf yo.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Sila yo se fis Séir yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:6">Jen 14:6</ref></char></note>Oryen an, pèp peyi a: Lothan, Schobal avèk Tsibeon ak Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>epi Dischon, Etser avèk Dischan. Sa yo se te chèf a Oryen yo, fis Séir yo, nan peyi Édom an.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Fis a Lothan yo se te Hori avèk Hémam. Sè a Lothan an se te Thimna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Men fis a Schobal yo: Alvan, Manahath, Ébal, Schepho, avèk Onam.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Men fis a Tsibeon yo: Ajja ak Ana. Se te Ana ki te twouve sous cho nan dezè a lè l t ap fè gadyen bourik yo pou papa l, Tsibeon.<verse eid="GEN 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Men pitit a Ana yo: Dischon avèk Oholibama, fi a Ana a.<verse eid="GEN 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Men fis Dischon yo: Hemdan, Eschban, Jithran, avèk Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Men fis a Etser yo: Bilhan, Zavvan avèk Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Men fis a Dischan yo: Uts avèk Aran.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Men chèf Oryen yo: chèf Lothan, chèf Schobal, chèf Tsibeon, ak chèf Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>chèf Dischon, chèf Etser, chèf Dischan. Sa se chèf a Oryen yo, chèf ki te nan peyi Séir yo.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Men wa ki te renye nan peyi a Édom yo, avan ke yon wa te vin renye pami zanfan Israël yo.<verse eid="GEN 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Béla, fis Beor, te renye sou Édom; epi non vil pa l la te Dinhaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Béla te mouri e Jbab, fis Zérach, a Botsra te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Jbab te vin mouri; epi Huscham nan peyi Temanit yo te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Huscham te mouri; epi Hadad, fis a Bedad la te vin renye nan plas li. Se te li menm ki te frape Madian nan chan Moab la. Non a vil sa a se te Avith.<verse eid="GEN 36:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadad te mouri; epi Samia ak Masréka te vin renye nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samia te mouri; epi Saül ak Rehoboth sou larivyè Euphrate la te vin renye nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 36:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Saül te mouri; epi Baal-Hanan, fis Acbor a te vin renye nan plas li.<verse eid="GEN 36:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Baal-Hanan, fis Acbor te mouri, epi Hadar te vin renye nan plas li. Non a vil sa a se te Pau; epi non madanm li te Mehéthabeel, fi a Mthred, fi a Mézahab la.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Men non a chèf ki te desandan Ésaü yo, selon tribi yo, selon teritwa yo, pa non yo; chèf Timna, chèf Alva, chèf Jetheth, <verse eid="GEN 36:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>chèf Oholibama, chèf Éla, chèf Pinon, <verse eid="GEN 36:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>chèf Kenaz, chèf Théman, chèf Mibtsar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>chèf Magdiel, chèf Iram.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Sa se chèf Édom yo (sa vle di pou Ésaü, papa a Edomit yo), selon abitasyon yo, ak peyi yo te posede yo.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Alò, Jacob te viv nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:8">Jen 17:8</ref></char></note>peyi kote papa li te konn demere a, nan peyi Canaan an.<verse eid="GEN 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Sa yo se achiv a jenerasyon Jacob yo. Joseph, lè l te gen laj dis-sèt ane, li t ap okipe bann mouton an avèk frè l yo, pandan li te toujou nan jennès li, ansanm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:25-26">Jen 35:25-26</ref></char></note>fis Bila yo, ak fis Zilpa yo, madanm a papa l yo. Epi Joseph te pote yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:22-24">I Sam 2:22-24</ref></char></note>move rapò sou yo, bay papa li.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Alò, Israël te renmen Joseph plis ke tout lòt fis li yo, akoz ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:20">Jen 44:20</ref> </char></note> fèt nan vyeyès li; epi li te fè pou li yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:23-32">Jen 37:23-32</ref> </char></note>vètman plen tout koulè. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Frè li yo te wè ke papa yo te renmen li plis ke tout frè li yo. Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:41">Jen 27:41</ref></char></note> vin rayi li, e yo pa t kapab pale avèk li an amitye.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Alò, Joseph <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Jen 28:12</ref></char></note>te fè yon rèv, e lè l te repete l bay frè l yo, konsa, yo te vin rayi li plis. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Li te di yo: “Souple, koute rèv sa a ke m te fè a. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>Gade byen, nou t ap mare pakèt rekòlt yo nan chan an, e gade byen, pakèt pa nou yo te vin antoure pa m nan e yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:6-9">Jen 42:6-9</ref> </char></note>bese devan pakèt pa mwen yo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Alò, frè li yo te di li: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:26">Jen 49:26</ref></char></note>Èske vrèman ou ap vin renye sou nou? Oswa èske ou ap vin gouvène sou nou?” Epi yo te vin rayi li plis pou rèv li yo, ak pawòl li yo.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Alò li te vin fè yon rèv toujou, li te eksplike li bay frè li yo. Li te di: “Gade, mwen te fè yon lòt rèv; e gade byen, solèy la, lalin lan avèk onz zetwal yo t ap bese ba devan mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Li te eksplike li bay papa li avèk frè li yo. Papa li te reprimande li e te di l: “Kisa sa ye, rèv sa ou te fè a? Èske mwen, manman ou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:29">Jen 27:29</ref></char></note>frè ou yo vrèman ap vin bese atè devan ou?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Trav 7:9</ref></char></note>Frè li yo te fè jalouzi akoz li, men papa li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:28">Dan 7:28</ref></char></note>kenbe pawòl sa yo nan tèt li.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Epi frè li yo te ale mennen bann mouton an Sichem. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Israël te di Joseph: “Èske frè ou yo p ap okipe bann mouton an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:18-20">Jen 33:18-20</ref> </char></note>Sichem? Vini pou mwen ka voye ou bò kote yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Epi li te reponn: “Mwen va ale”.<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Alò, li te di li: “Ale koulye a pou okipe afè frè ou yo ak afè bann mouton an, e vin pote nouvèl ban mwen.” Epi li te ale nan vale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Jen 13:18</ref></char></note>Hébron an e li te rive Sichem. <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>Yon mesye te twouve li, e gade byen, li t ap mache toupatou nan chan an. Konsa, mesye a te mande li: “Kisa w ap chache?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Li te di: “Mwen ap chache frè m yo. Souple, fè m konnen kote yo ap fè patiraj pou bann mouton an.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Alò, mesye a te di: “Yo te deplase isit la, paske mwen te tande yo di: ‘Annou ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:13">II Wa 6:13</ref> </char></note>Dothan.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Epi Joseph te swiv frè li yo, e li te twouve yo Dothan. <verse eid="GEN 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Lè yo te wè li depi nan distans, e avan li te parèt kote yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:13">Sòm 31:13</ref></char></note>fè konplo pou mete li a lanmò.<verse eid="GEN 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Yo te di youn ak lòt: “Men sila ki fè rèv la ap vini! <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Alò, koulye a, annou touye li e jete li nan youn nan fòs yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:32-33">Jen 37:32-33</ref> </char></note>nou va di: ‘yon bèt sovaj te devore li.’ Koulye a annou wè kisa rèv li yo ap devni!”<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:22">Jen 42:22</ref></char></note>Reuben te tande sa, li te retire li nan men yo, e li te di: “Annou pa pran lavi li.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Reuben te di yo anplis de sa: “Pa vèse san. Jete li nan twou sila ki nan dezè a, men pa mete men sou li” —akoz lentansyon li te gen pou fè l chape nan men yo, pou l ta kapab remèt li bay papa l.<verse eid="GEN 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Alò li te rive ke lè Joseph te rive kote frè li yo, yo te retire vètman an sou li, (sa ki te gen anpil koulè ladann nan); <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>epi yo te pran li e yo te jete li nan fòs la. Alò fòs la te vid e li pa t gen dlo ladann.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Alò, yo te chita pou manje yon manje. Epi pandan yo te leve zye yo, yo te gade, e vwala, yon ekip Izmayelit ki t ap sòti Galaad, avèk chamo ki t ap pote yon chaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:11">Jen 43:11</ref> </char></note>gòm awomatik, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:22">Jr 8:22</ref> </char></note>bòm avèk mè pou rive an Égypte.<verse eid="GEN 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Juda te di a frè li yo: “Ki avantaj sa ye si nou touye frè nou an, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:20">Jen 37:20</ref></char></note>kache san li? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:21">Jen 42:21</ref></char></note>Vini, annou vann li bay Izmayelit yo e annou pa mete men nou sou li, paske li se frè nou, pwòp chè nou.” Epi frè li yo te koute li.<verse eid="GEN 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Alò, kèk nan machann Madyanit yo te pase, epi frè l yo te rale li soti nan fòs la e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:4-5">Jen 45:4-5</ref></char></note>vann li bay Izmayelit yo pou ven sik lajan. Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:1">Jen 39:1</ref></char></note>yo te mennen Joseph antre an Égypte.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Alò, Reuben te retounen nan fòs la, e gade byen, Joseph pa t la nan fòs la; epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>chire rad li. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>Li te retounen vè frè li yo e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:13-36">Jen 42:13-36</ref> </char></note>Ti gason an pa la non; e pou mwen menm, kibò pou m ale?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:3-23">Jen 37:3-23</ref> </char></note>pran vètman Joseph la, yo te kòche yon mal kabrit, e yo te tranpe vètman an nan san an. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Yo te voye vètman anpil koulè a pote li bay papa yo e yo te di: “Nou te twouve sa a. Souple, gade l byen e wè si se vètman a fis ou a oswa non.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Li te egzamine li e te di: “Se vètman fis mwen an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:20">Jen 37:20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 44:28">Jen 44:28</ref></char></note>Yon bèt sovaj gen tan devore li. Joseph vrèman gen tan chire an mòso!”<verse eid="GEN 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Alò, Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:29">Jen 37:29</ref></char></note>chire rad li, li te mete twal sak nan ren li, e li te pase anpil jou ap lamante pou fis li a. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Alò, tout fis li yo, ak tout fi li yo te leve pou konsole li, men li te refize konsole. Epi li te di: “Vrèman mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:8">Jen 25:8</ref></char></note>desann kote fis mwen an, kote sejou mò yo ak lamante pou fis mwen an.” Epi papa li te kriye pou li.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Antretan, Madyanit yo te vann li an Égypte a Potiphar, ofisye Farawon an, chèf nan kò gad la.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Epi li te vin rive nan lè sa a ke Judas te kite frè l yo, pou te vizite yon sèten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:35">Jos 15:35</ref></char></note>Adilamit ki te rele Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>La, Juda te wè fi a yon sèten Kananeyen ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:3">I Kwo 2:3</ref></char></note>Schua. Li te pran li e te antre an relasyon ak li. <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>Konsa, li te vin ansent, li te fè yon fis, e li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref></char></note>Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Epi li te vin ansent ankò, li te bay yon fis, ki te nonmen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref></char></note>Onan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Li te fè toujou yon lòt fis, e li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:20">Nonb 26:20</ref> </char></note>Schéla. Li te nan Czib lè li te fè li.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Alò, Juda te pran yon madanm pou Er, premye ne li a, e non li te Tamar. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref> </char></note>Er, premye ne a Juda a te mechan nan zye a SENYÈ a e SENYÈ a te pran vi li.<verse eid="GEN 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Konsa, Juda te di a Onan: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Det 25:5-6</ref> </char></note>Antre an relasyon ak madanm a frè ou a; fè devwa ou kòm bòfrè li, e fè leve yon posterite pou frè ou.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Onan te konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:6">Det 25:6</ref></char></note>posterite sa yo pa t ap pou li. Konsa, li te jete jèm li an atè pou li pa fè pitit pou frè li. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>Men sa li te fè a pa t fè SENYÈ a plezi. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref></char></note>pran vi li tou.<verse eid="GEN 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Alò Juda te di a bofi li, Tamar: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:12">Rt 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="RUT 1:13">13</ref> </char></note>Rete kòm vèv lakay papa ou jiskaske fis mwen an, Schéla fin grandi.” Paske li te reflechi: “Mwen pè pou li menm tou pa ta kapab mouri menm jan ak frè li yo.” Epi Tamar te ale viv lakay papa li.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Alò, apre yon tan konsiderab, fi Schua a, madanm a Juda, te mouri. Epi lè tan tristès alanmò a te fini, Juda te monte vè ouvriye ki t ap taye lenn mouton bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:10-57">Jos 15:10-57</ref> </char></note>Thimna yo, li menm avèk zanmi li, Hira, Adilamit lan.<verse eid="GEN 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Konsa, yo te di a Tamar: “Veye byen, bòpè ou ap monte vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:10-57">Jos 15:10-57</ref> </char></note>Thimna pou taye lenn mouton li yo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>Alò, li te retire vètman vèv li a, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:65">Jen 24:65</ref></char></note>kouvri tèt li avèk yon vwal, li te vlope tèt li, e li te chita nan pòtay Énaïm nan, ki nan wout pou rive Thimna. Paske li te wè ke Shéla te fin grandi, e yo pa t vin prezante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:11-26">Jen 38:11-26</ref></char></note>li devan li kòm madanm.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Lè Juda te wè l, li te panse ke li te yon pwostitiye, paske li te kouvri figi li. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Konsa, li te vire bò kote li nan wout la, e li te di: “Alò, kite m antre an relasyon ak ou.” Paske li pa t konnen ke li te bèlfi li. Epi fi a te di: “Kisa w ap ban m pou ou ka antre an relasyon ak mwen?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Li te di konsa: “Mwen va voye ba ou yon jèn kabrit ki sòti nan twoupo a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Men li te di: “Èske ou va ban m yon bagay kòm yon sèman pou jis lè ou voye l?”<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Li te di: “Kisa pou m ta bay ou?” Epi li te di: “Ban m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:25">Jen 38:25</ref></char></note>so, kòd avèk baton ki nan men ou an.” Konsa, li te bay yo a li menm. Li te antre an relasyon ak li, e vèv la te vin ansent pa li menm. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Tamar te leve ale. Li te retire vwal la, e li te remete vètman a vèv yo.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Lè Juda te voye jèn kabrit la ak zanmi li, Adilamit lan, pou resevwa sa ke li te bay kòm sèman an, li pa t twouve li. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Li te mande mesye yo kote a: “Kote jennès tanp lan ki te akote wout la nan Énaïm nan?” Men yo te di li: “Pa t gen jennès tanp isit la.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Li te retounen a Juda, e te di: “Mwen pa t twouve li. Anplis de sa, mesye nan zòn di ke: ‘Pa t gen yon jennès tanp nan zòn sa a.’”<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Juda te di l: “Kite li pran yo pou kont li, sinon n ap vin yon betiz devan tout moun. Anfen, mwen te voye jèn kabrit sa a, men ou pa t twouve li.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Alò, li te anviwon twa mwa pita ke Juda te enfòme: “Bèlfi ou Tamar te jwe wòl jennès la. Gade byen, li vin ansent nan koze sa a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Konsa, Juda te di: “Mete li deyò e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:9">Lev 21:9</ref></char></note>kite yo brile li.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Epi pandan yo t ap mete li deyò, li te voye kote bòpè li pou di: “Mwen avèk pitit pa mesye ki se mèt a bagay sa yo.” Anplis, li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:32">Jen 37:32</ref></char></note>Souple, fè yon ankèt pou vin aprann pou kilès so siyal sila a ye, e pou kilès kòd avèk baton sila yo ye?”<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Juda te rekonèt yo, e te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:17">I Sam 24:17</ref></char></note>Li pi jis pase mwen, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:14">Jen 38:14</ref></char></note>mwen pa t bay li fis mwen an, Schéla.” Epi li pa t gen relasyon avèk li ankò.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Li te vin rive nan lè ke li t ap akouche a, gade byen, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:24-26">Jen 25:24-26</ref></char></note>jimo nan vant li. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Anplis de sa, li te rive pandan li t ap akouche a ke youn te lonje yon men deyò, e fanm saj la te mare yon fisèl wouj sou men l. Li te di: “Se sila a ki sòti avan”. <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Men li te vin rive ke pandan li t ap rale men l tounen, frè l la te sòti avan. Epi li te di: “A la chemen ou gen tan fè pou kont ou!” Konsa, li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref></char></note>Pérets. <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Apre, frè l la te vin sòti avèk fisèl wouj mare nan men l, e li te nonmen li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:4">I Kwo 2:4</ref></char></note>Zerah.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Alò, yo te pran Joseph desann an Égypte. Epi Potiphar, yon ofisye Farawon, kòmandan nan gad yo, te achte li nan men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:25-28">Jen 37:25-28-36</ref> </char></note>Izmayelit yo, ki te fè l desann la.<verse eid="GEN 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:3-23">Jen 39:3-23</ref> </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a te avèk Joseph, e li te byen reyisi. Li te lakay mèt li, Ejipsyen an. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Alò mèt li a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Jen 21:22</ref></char></note>wè ke SENYÈ a te avèk li, e ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:3">Sòm 1:3</ref></char></note>fè tout sa li te antreprann byen reyisi nan men l. <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Konsa, Joseph te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:3">Jen 18:3</ref></char></note>twouve favè nan zye li, e li te devni sèvitè pèsonèl li. Li te fè li chèf an tèt tout lakay li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2">Jen 24:2</ref></char></note>tout sa ke li te posede, li te mete yo sou chaj li. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Epi li te rive ke depi lè sa a li te fè li chèf lakay li, ak sou tout sa li te posede, ke SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:27">Jen 30:27</ref></char></note>beni lakay Ejipsyen an akoz Joseph. Benediksyon SENYÈ a te sou tout sa li te genyen, ni nan kay la, ni nan chan an. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Li te kite tout sa li te gen sou chaj Joseph. Konsa, li pa t okipe tèt li avèk anyen sof ke manje ke li te manje. Alò, Joseph te yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:17">Jen 29:17</ref></char></note>bo gason, ni nan fòm li, ni nan aparans li.<verse eid="GEN 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Li te vin rive apre evènman sa yo, ke madanm Potiphar a, te gade Joseph avèk anvi. Konsa, li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:11">II Sam 13:11</ref> </char></note>Vin kouche avè m.”<verse eid="GEN 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:23-24">Pwov 6:23-24</ref> </char></note>Joseph te refize. Li te di a madanm mèt li a: “Mèt mwen pa menm okipe li pou anyen ki nan kay la, e li te mete tout sa li posede sou chaj mwen. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:40">Jen 41:40</ref></char></note>Nanpwen pèsòn nan kay sa a ki pi gran ke mwen, e li pa refize m anyen, sof ke ou menm, paske ou se madanm li. Kijan konsa, mwen ta kapab fè gwo mal sa a, e peche kont Bondye menm?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Pandan li te pale avèk Joseph jou aprè jou, Joseph pa t koute l menm pou kesyon kouche avèk l, oswa pou li ta rete avè l.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Alò li vin rive yon jou ke li te antre nan kay la pou fè travay li, e pa t gen lòt nan ouvriye lakay yo ki te andedan kay la. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Konsa, Madanm nan te kenbe li pa vètman li. Li te di: “Kouche avè m!” Men li te kite vètman li nan men l, e te sove ale deyò.<verse eid="GEN 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Lè Madanm nan te vin wè ke li te kite vètman li nan men l, e li te kouri deyò, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>li te rele tout gason ouvriye lakay li yo, e li te di yo: “Ou wè sa, li pote bannou yon Ebre ki pou vin fè jwèt avèk nou. Li te vin antre sou mwen pou kouche avè m, men mwen te rele fò. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>Lè li tande ke m te leve vwa m pou rele fò, li te kite vètman li bò kote mwen, e li te sove ale kouri deyò.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Konsa, li te kenbe vètman an kote li jiskaske mèt li te rive nan kay la. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Alò, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Egz 23:1</ref> </char></note>pale avèk li ak pawòl sa yo: “Esklav Ebre ke ou te mennen bannou an, te antre kote mwen pou fè spò avè m, <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>men lè m te leve vwa m pou te rele fò, li te kite vètman li bò kote mwen pou te sove ale deyò.” <verse eid="GEN 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Alò, lè mèt la te tande pawòl a madanm li yo, lè li te pale pou di: “Men sa esklav ou a te fè m nan,” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:34">Pwov 6:34</ref> </char></note>li te vin brile avèk kòlè.<verse eid="GEN 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Konsa, mèt Joseph la te pran li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:3">Jen 40:3</ref></char></note>mete li nan prizon, nan plas kote prizonye ki pou wa yo te ye. Epi li te la nan prizon an. <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Men SENYÈ a te avèk Joseph. Li te fè li gras, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:21">Egz 3:21</ref> </char></note>fè li vin gen favè nan zye a chèf prizon an.<verse eid="GEN 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Chèf Kasèl la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:4">Jen 39:4</ref></char></note>fè Joseph responsab tout prizonye yo ki te nan prizon an, jiskaske nenpòt sa ki te fèt ladann, li te vin responsab. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Chèf Kasèl la pa t sipèvize anyen ki te anba direksyon Joseph, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:21">Jen 39:21</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te avèk li, paske nenpòt sa li te fè, SENYÈ a te fè l pwospere.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre bagay sa yo ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:11-13">Jen 40:11-13</ref> </char></note>chèf ki te responsab pran avan gou diven nan pou wa a, ansanm ak bòs boulanje a wa a te fè yon ofans kont mèt yo, Wa a Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Farawon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:14">Pwov 16:14</ref></char></note> te vin plen ak kòlè sou ofisye sa yo, chèf ki responsab pote tas la, avèk bòs boulanje a. <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>Alò li te sere yo nan prizon lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:1-20">Jen 39:1-20</ref> </char></note>Kaptenn a kò gad la, menm kote ke Joseph te anprizone a. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Kaptenn kò gad la te mete Joseph an chaj yo, pou li te okipe yo. Konsa, yo te nan prizon an pou kèk tan.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Epi pandan tan sa a, toude moun sa yo, chèf ki te responsab pran avan gou diven nan, ak bòs boulanje a wa a, te fè yon rèv nan menm nwit lan. Chak moun te fè pwòp rèv pa li, e chak rèv te gen pwòp entèpretasyon pa li.<verse eid="GEN 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Lè Joseph te vini kote yo nan maten, li te gade yo, e gade byen, yo te byen dekouraje. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Li te mande ofisye Farawon an sila yo, ki te anprizone avèk li nan kay mèt li a: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:2">Né 2:2</ref></char></note>Poukisa figi nou tris konsa jodi a?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Epi yo te di li: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:15">Jen 41:15</ref></char></note>Nou te fè yon rèv, e nanpwen pèsòn pou entèprete li.” Alò, Joseph te di yo: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:27-28">Dan 2:27-28</ref></char></note>Èske entèpretasyon yo pa apatyen a Bondye? Di m istwa sa a, souple.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Epi chèf responsab goute diven nan te pataje rèv li avèk Joseph, e li te di a li menm: “Nan rèv mwen an, gade byen, te gen yon pye rezen devan m, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>epi sou pye rezen an, te gen twa branch. Konsa, pandan li t ap boujonnen, flè li yo te parèt, e touf flè yo te pwodwi pakèt rezen mi. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Alò, tas Farawon an te nan men m; epi mwen te pran rezen yo, mwen te peze yo nan tas Farawon an, e mwen te mete tas la nan men Farawon.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Joseph te di l: “Men, sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:36">Dan 2:36</ref> </char></note>entèpretasyon sa a: twa branch sa yo se twa jou. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Nan yon tan twa jou, Farawon va leve tèt ou e reprann ou nan pozisyon ou. Ou va mete tas Farawon an nan men li menm jan ou te konn fè lè ou te nan sèvis responsab pote diven nan. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Sèlman, sonje mwen lè li ale byen avèk ou, e souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:12">Jos 2:12</ref></char></note>fè m gras e nonmen non mwen a Farawon pou fè m soti nan kay sa a. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:26-28">Jen 37:26-28</ref> </char></note>mwen te kidnape nan peyi Ebre yo, e menm isit la mwen pa t fè anyen pou yo ta dwe mete m nan prizon.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Lè bòs boulanje a te wè ke li te fè yon entèpretasyon favorab, li te di Joseph: “Mwen te wè nan rèv mwen an, e gade byen, te gen twa panyen pen blan sou tèt mwen. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Epi nan panyen pi wo a, te gen kèk nan tout kalite manje kwit pou Farawon, e zwazo yo te manje yo nan panyen sou tèt mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Alò, Joseph te reponn e te di: “Sa se entèpretasyon an. Twa panyen yo se twa jou. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Pandan twa jou ankò, Farawon va leve tèt ou sou ou. Li va pann ou sou yon bwa, e zwazo va retire chè sou ou e manje ou.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan twazyèm jou, ki te fèt nesans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:6">Mat 14:6</ref></char></note>Farawon an, ke li te fè yon fèt pou tout sèvitè yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:27">II Wa 25:27</ref></char></note> Epi li te leve tèt a chèf responsab pote manje a ak chèf bòs boulanje a pami sèvitè li yo. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Li te reprann chèf responsab pote tas la nan pozisyon li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:13">Jen 40:13</ref></char></note>li te ankò vin responsab mete tas la nan men Farawon. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:19">Jen 40:19</ref></char></note>te pann chèf bòs boulanje a jis jan ke Joseph te entèprete pou yo.<verse eid="GEN 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Men, chèf responsab pote manje a pa t sonje Joseph. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:14">Job 19:14</ref></char></note>bliye li.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan lafin dezane, Farawon te fè yon rèv, e gade byen, li te kanpe devan lariviyè Nil lan. <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>Konsa, gade byen, sèt bèf te sòti nan lariviyè Nil lan, byen swa, e byen gra. Yo t ap manje nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:11">Job 8:11</ref> </char></note>zèb flèv la. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Epi gade byen, sèt lòt bèf te sòti nan lariviyè Nil lan, byen lèd e mèg, e yo te kanpe akote lòt bèf bò kote lariviyè Nil lan. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Bèf ki te lèd e mèg yo te manje valè sèt bèf ki te swa e byen gra yo. Epi konsa, Farawon te vin leve nan dòmi.<verse eid="GEN 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Li te tonbe dòmi ankò, e fè rèv yon dezyèm fwa. Konsa, sèt tèt mayi te vini sou yon sèl pye mayi, ki te gwo e bon. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Epi gade byen, sèt tèt, mèg ki brile pa van lès yo, te vin boujonnen dèyè yo. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Tèt mèg yo te valè sèt tèt ki te gra e byen plen yo. Alò, Farawon te leve, e gade byen, sa se te yon rèv.<verse eid="GEN 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Alò, nan maten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:1-3">Dan 2:1-3</ref> </char></note>lespri li te vin twouble, e li te voye rele tout majisyen an Égypte yo, ak tout moun saj li yo. Konsa, Farawon te eksplike yo rèv li yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:7">Dan 4:7</ref> </char></note>pa t gen pèsòn ki te kapab entèprete yo pou Farawon.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Alò, chèf responsab pote manje a te pale a Farawon. Li te di li: “Jodi a, mwen ta dwe admèt yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:14-23">Jen 40:14-23</ref> </char></note>tò ke m genyen. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Farawon te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:2-3">Jen 40:2-3</ref> </char></note>byen fache avèk sèvitè li yo, e li te fè m anprizone lakay Kaptenn kò gad la, mwen menm avèk chèf boulanje a. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:5">Jen 40:5</ref></char></note>Nou te fè yon rèv nan menm nwit lan, mwen menm ak li menm tou. Nou chak te fè yon rèv ak pwòp entèpretasyon pa li. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Alò, te gen yon jennonm ki te la avèk nou, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:36">Jen 37:36</ref></char></note>sèvitè kaptenn kò gad la, yon Ebre. Nou te pale rèv yo a li menm, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:12">Jen 40:12</ref></char></note>li te entèprete rèv nou yo pou nou. A chak moun li te entèprete selon pwòp rèv pa li. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Epi jan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:21-22">Jen 40:21-22</ref> </char></note>li te entèprete pou nou an, konsa li te vin rive. Mwen menm te vin restore nan pozisyon mwen, e li menm, lòt la, wa a te pann.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Alò, Farawon te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:20">Sòm 105:20</ref></char></note>rele Joseph. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:25">Dan 2:25</ref></char></note>Avèk vitès, yo te mennen li sòti nan prizon an. Depi li fin taye bab li e chanje rad li, li te vini devan Farawon.<verse eid="GEN 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Farawon te di a Joseph: “Mwen te fè yon rèv, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Jen 41:8</ref></char></note>men pa gen pèsòn ki kapab entèprete li. Men mwen tande pale de ou menm ke lè ou tande yon rèv, ou kapab bay entèpretasyon li.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Joseph te reponn Farawon. Li te di: “Sa pa nan mwen, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Jen 40:8</ref></char></note>Bondye va bay Farawon yon repons favorab.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Alò, Farawon te pale avèk Joseph: “Nan rèv mwen an, men gade, mwen te kanpe arebò Rivyè Nil lan. <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>Epi gade byen, sèt bèf, gra e swa te vin monte sòti nan Nil lan; yo t ap manje nan zèb arebò rivyè a. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Epi gade byen, sèt lòt bèf te vin monte apre yo, kata, lèd e mèg, konsa, mwen pa t janm wè youn ki lèd nan tout peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Epi bèf mèg ak lèd yo te manje premye sèt bèf gra yo. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>E lè yo te fin devore yo, ou pa t kab konnen si yo te manje yo, paske yo te rete mèg menm jan yo te ye avan an. Epi se konsa mwen te vin leve.<verse eid="GEN 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>“Mwen te wè nan rèv mwen an tou, byen parèt, se te sèt tèt mayi, plen e bon te vini sou yon sèl pye. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Epi gade, sèt tèt sèch yo, ki brile pa van lès yo te vin pouse apre yo. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>Konsa, tèt sèch yo te valè sèt bon tèt yo. Epi alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:19">És 8:19</ref></char></note>mwen te pale sa a majisyen yo, men pa t gen youn ki ta kapab eksplike m afè sila a.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Alò, Joseph te di a Farawon: “Rèv a Farawon yo se yon sèl ke yo ye; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:28-32">Jen 41:28-32</ref> </char></note>Bondye te di a Farawon kisa ki prèt pou fèt. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Sèt bon bèf yo se sèt ane; epi sèt bon tèt yo se sèt ane; rèv sa yo se yon sèl yo ye. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Sèt bèf lèd ak mèg yo ki te sòti apre yo a se sèt ane, e sèt tèt mèg ki brile pa van lès la va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:1">II Wa 8:1</ref> </char></note>sèt ane ak gwo grangou.<verse eid="GEN 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>“Se tankou mwen te pale a Farawon: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:25-32">Jen 41:25-32</ref> </char></note>Bondye te montre Farawon kisa ki prèt pou rive. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:47">Jen 41:47</ref></char></note>sèt ane ak gran abondans yo ap vini nan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Epi apre yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:54-56">Jen 41:54-56</ref> </char></note>sèt ane ak gwo grangou yo va vini, tout abondans sa a va gen tan bliye nan peyi Égypte la, e gwo grangou sa a va ravaje peyi a. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Alò, abondans lan p ap sonje nan peyi a akoz konsekans gwo grangou a, paske li va vrèman rèd. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Alò, pou afè repete rèv la de fwa a, li vle di Farawon ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:25-28">Jen 41:25-28</ref> </char></note>koze sa a deja detèmine pa Bondye, e Bondye va fè l parèt byen vit.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Alò, Farawon gen pou chèche yon nonm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39">Jen 41:39</ref></char></note>konprann ak sajès, pou mete li responsab sou peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Kite Farawon aji pou chwazi administratè k ap pran chaj peyi a, e kite yo egzije yon senkyèm nan rekòlt peyi Égypte la, nan sèt ane abondans lan. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Konsa, kite yo ranmase tout manje nan bon ane sa yo k ap vini an, mete yo nan depo pou vil ki anba otorite Farawon yo, e kite yo mete yo anba gad. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Kite manje yo vini yon rezèv pou peyi a pandan sèt ane gwo grangou yo ki va fèt nan peyi Égypte la, pou peyi a pa peri pandan gwo grangou a.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Alò, plan sa a te parèt bon a Farawon, ak tout sèvitè li yo. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Alò, Farawon te di a sèvitè li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Job 32:8</ref> </char></note>“Èske nou kapab twouve yon lòt moun konsa, nan sila a ki gen Lespri Bondye?”<verse eid="GEN 41:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Epi Farawon te di a Joseph: “Akoz Bondye te fè ou konprann tout sa, nanpwen okenn lòt moun ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:33">Jen 41:33</ref></char></note>konprann ak sajès tankou ou menm. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:21">Sòm 105:21</ref></char></note>Ou va sou tout lakay mwen, e selon lòd pa ou tout pèp mwen an ap fè obeyisans. Se sèl sou twòn nan ke mwen va pi wo pase ou.”<verse eid="GEN 41:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Farawon te di a Joseph: “Ou wè, mwen plase ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:6">Jen 42:6</ref></char></note>sou tout peyi Égypte la.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Alò, Farawon te retire bag so a nan men li. Li te mete li nan men Joseph, e li te abiye l ak rad len fen ak yon kolye lò nan kou li. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Li te fè l monte nan dezyèm cha li a, epi li te pwoklame devan li: “Mete ajenou!” Epi li te plase li sou tout peyi Égypte la.<verse eid="GEN 41:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Anplis de sa, Farawon te di a Joseph: “Malgre mwen se Farawon, san pèmisyon pa ou, pèsòn p ap leve ni men li ni pye li sou tout peyi Égypte la.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Alò, Farawon te nonmen Joseph Tsaphnath-Paenéach. Li te bay li Asnath, fi a Poti-Phéra a, prèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:13">Jr 43:13</ref> </char></note>On an, kòm madanm li. Epi Joseph te plase sou tout peyi Égypte la.<verse eid="GEN 41:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Alò, Joseph te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:2">Jen 37:2</ref></char></note>laj trant ane lè li te kanpe devan Farawon, wa Égypte la. Epi Joseph te sòti nan prezans Farawon, e li te ale toupatou nan tout peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Pandan sèt ane abondans yo, peyi a te pwodwi anpil. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Konsa, Joseph te ranmase tout manje pandan sèt ane sa yo ki te ekoule nan peyi Égypte la, e li te mete manje yo nan vil yo. Li te mete nan chak vil, menm manje ki te sòti nan chan ki antoure li yo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Konsa, Joseph te ranmase sereyal an gran abondans tankou sab lanmè, jiskaske li te vin sispann mezire li, paske li te depase kontwòl.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Alò, avan ane gwo grangou a te rive, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:5">Jen 48:5</ref> </char></note>de fis te vin ne a Joseph ke Asnath, fi a Poti-Phéra a, prèt On an te fè pou li. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Joseph te nonmen premye ne a Manassé, paske li te di: “Bondye te fè m bliye tout pwoblèm mwen yo ak tout lakay papa m.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Li te nonmen dezyèm nan Éphraïm, paske li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:6">Jen 17:6</ref> </char></note>“Bondye fè mwen bay anpil fwi nan peyi afliksyon mwen an.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Sèt ane abondans ki te nan peyi Égypte la te fin pase. <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:16">Sòm 105:16</ref></char></note>sèt ane gwo grangou a te kòmanse, jis jan ke Joseph te di. Alò te vin gen gwo grangou nan tout peyi yo, men nan peyi Égypte la te gen pen. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Lè tout peyi Égypte la te grangou, yo te rele fò a Farawon pou bay pen. Konsa, Farawon te di tout Ejipsyen yo: “Ale wè Joseph. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Jn 2:5</ref></char></note>Nenpòt sa li mande nou, nou va fè l.”<verse eid="GEN 41:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Gwo grangou a te fin gaye sou tout sifas tè a. Konsa, Joseph te ouvri tout depo yo pou te vann manje bay Ejipsyen yo. Gwo grangou a te byen rèd nan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Pèp yo de tout peyi te vini an Égypte pou achte sereyal Joseph yo, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:10">Jen 12:10</ref></char></note>gwo grangou a te rèd sou tout tè a.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Trav 7:12</ref> </char></note>Jacob te wè ke te gen sereyal an Égypte, e Jacob te di fis li yo: “Poukisa nou ap gade youn sou lòt konsa?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Li te di: “Mwen tande gen sereyal an Égypte. Desann la pou achte kèk pou nou nan kote sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:8">Jen 43:8</ref></char></note>pou nou kapab viv, e pa mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Alò, dis frè Joseph yo te desann pou achte sereyal an Égypte. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Men Jacob pa t voye frè Joseph la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:18-24">Jen 35:18-24</ref> </char></note>Benjamin avèk lòt frè li yo, paske li te di: “Mwen pè pou yon mal ta kab rive li.” <verse eid="GEN 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te vini pou achte sereyal pami sila ki t ap vini yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:10">Jen 12:10</ref></char></note>paske gwo grangou a te nan peyi Canaan an tou.<verse eid="GEN 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:41-55">Jen 41:41-55</ref></char></note>Joseph te an pouvwa nan peyi a. Se te li menm ki te vann a tout pèp nan peyi a. Epi frè a Joseph yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:14">És 60:14</ref></char></note>bese ba devan li avèk figi yo atè. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Lè Joseph te wè frè li yo, li te rekonèt yo, men li te kache idantite li devan yo, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:30">Jen 42:30</ref></char></note>pale rèd avèk yo. Li te di yo: “Kote nou sòti?” Epi yo te di: “Nan peyi Canaan, pou achte manje.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Men Joseph te rekonèt frè l yo, malgre yo pa t rekonèt li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:2">Jen 37:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Joseph te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:6-9">Jen 37:6-9</ref></char></note>sonje rèv ke li te gen sou yo a, e li te di yo: “Se espyon nou ye! Nou te vin chache konnen pwen fèb nan defans peyi nou an.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Alò, yo te di li: “Non, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:8">Jen 37:8</ref></char></note>mèt mwen, men sèvitè ou yo te vin achte manje.” <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>“Nou tout se fis a yon sèl mesye. Nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:16-34">Jen 42:16-34</ref> </char></note>moun onèt, sèvitè ou, e nou pa espyon.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Malgre sa li te di yo: “Non, men nou te vin gade pwen fèb nan defans peyi nou an.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Men yo te reponn li: “Sèvitè ou yo se douz frè antou, fis a yon sèl mesye nan peyi Canaan; e gade byen, pi jenn nan avèk papa nou jodi a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:33">Jen 37:33</ref></char></note>youn pa la ankò.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Joseph te di yo: “Se tankou mwen te di nou, se espyon nou ye. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Men se konsa nou va pase a leprèv. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:55">I Sam 17:55</ref></char></note>Pa lavi Farawon, nou p ap sòti nan plas sa a amwenske pi jenn nan vin parèt isit la! <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Voye youn nan nou ale pou li kapab chache frè nou an, pandan n ap rete anprizone, pou pawòl nou yo kapab pase a leprèv, si gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:11">Jen 42:11</ref></char></note>verite nan nou. Men si non, pa lavi Farawon, vrèman nou se espyon.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Konsa, li te mete yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:4-7">Jen 40:4-7</ref> </char></note>prizon pou twa jou.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Alò, Joseph te di yo nan twazyèm jou a: “Fè sa pou viv, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:9">Jen 39:9</ref></char></note>mwen krent Bondye: <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Si nou se moun onèt, kite youn nan frè nou yo rete anprizone nan prizon nou an; men pou nou lòt yo, ale pote sereyal pou grangou ki lakay nou yo. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:34">Jen 42:34</ref></char></note>mennen pi jenn frè nou an bò kote m, pou pawòl nou yo kapab verifye, e pou nou pa mouri.” Epi konsa, yo te fè.<verse eid="GEN 42:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Yo te di youn a lòt: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:26-28">Jen 37:26-28</ref></char></note>Vrèman, nou koupab nan zafè frè nou an, akoz nou te wè jan nanm li te twouble lè li te plede avèk nou, men nou te refize tande. Pou sa, kriz sila a vin rive sou nou.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Reuben te reponn yo, e te di: “Èske mwen pa t di nou: ‘Pa peche kont tigason an;’ men nou te refize tande? Konsa, fwi san li an vin parèt.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21">Jen 37:21</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 37:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Men yo pa t konnen ke Joseph te konprann, paske te gen yon entèprèt antre yo. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Konsa, li te vire lwen yo e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:30">Jen 43:30</ref> </char></note>kriye. Men lè li te retounen vè yo, li te pale avèk yo. Li te pran Siméon nan mitan yo, e li te mare li devan zye yo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:17-21">Wo 12:17-21</ref> </char>
    </note>Konsa, Joseph te bay lòd pou plen sak yo avèk sereyal, remèt lajan a chak moun nan sak li, e bay yo pwovizyon pou vwayaj la. Epi se konsa sa te fèt pou yo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Alò, yo te chaje bourik pa yo avèk sereyal yo, e yo te soti la.<verse eid="GEN 42:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Pandan youn nan yo t ap ouvri sak li pou bay bèt la manje, li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:21-22">Jen 43:21-22</ref> </char></note>lajan pa li a. Gade byen, se la li te ye, nan bouch sak la. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Epi li te di a frè l yo: “Lajan mwen an remèt wi! E gade byen, li la menm nan sak mwen an!” Konsa kè yo plonje desann. Yo te vire, tou ap tranble, youn ak lòt, e te di: “Kisa Bondye gen tan fè nou la a?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Lè yo te rive kote papa yo Jacob, nan peyi Canaan an, yo te di li tout sa ki te rive yo. Konsa yo te di: <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>“Mesye a, mèt peyi a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:7">Jen 42:7</ref></char></note>pale byen di avèk nou. Li te panse nou te espyon nan peyi a. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Men nou te di li: ‘Nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:11">Jen 42:11</ref></char></note>moun onèt. Se pa espyon nou ye. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Nou se douz frè, fis a papa nou. Youn nan nou pa viv ankò, e pi jenn nan avèk papa nou jodi a nan peyi Canaan.’<verse eid="GEN 42:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>“Epi nonm nan, mèt peyi a, te di nou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:19-20">Jen 42:19-20</ref></char></note>‘Pa sa mwen va konnen ke nou se moun onèt: kite youn nan frè nou yo avè m, pran sereyal la pou pwoblèm grangou lakay nou yo, e ale. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Men mennen pi jenn frè ou a kote mwen pou m ka konnen ke nou pa espyon, men ke nou se moun onèt. Mwen va bay ou frè ou a, e w ap kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:10">Jen 34:10</ref></char></note>fè komès nan peyi a.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Alò, li te rive ke lè yo t ap vide sak yo, ke gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:12-21">Jen 43:12-21</ref> </char></note>bous lajan chak moun te nan sak li. Lè yo menm avèk papa yo te wè lajan an, yo te sezi. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Papa yo, Jacob te di yo: “Nou fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:14">Jen 43:14</ref></char></note>fè m pèdi pitit mwen yo! Joseph pa la ankò, Siméon pa la ankò, e nou ta vle pran Benjamin. Tout bagay sa yo kont mwen.”<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Alò, Reuben te pale avèk papa l. Li te di: “Ou kapab mete de gason mwen yo a lanmò si mwen pa mennen li retounen kote ou. Mete li sou kont mwen, e mwen va fè l retounen kote ou.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Men Jacob te di: “Fis mwen an p ap desann avèk nou. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:33-34">Jen 37:33-34</ref></char></note>frè li a mouri, e se li sèl ki rete. Si malè ta rive li nan vwayaj ke nou ap fè a, alò, nou va mennen tèt cheve blanch sa a vè sejou mò yo avèk tristès.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:10">Jen 12:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, gwo grangou a te rèd nan tout peyi a. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Epi li te vin rive ke lè yo te fin manje sereyal ke yo te achte an Égypte la, papa yo te di yo: “Ale retounen, achte yon ti manje.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Men Juda te pale avèk li. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:5">Jen 43:5</ref></char></note>Nonm nan te menase nou ke: ‘Nou p ap wè figi m sof ke frè nou an avèk nou.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Si ou voye frè nou an avèk nou, nou va desann achte manje. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Men si ou pa voye li, nou p ap desann. Paske nonm nan te di nou: ‘Nou p ap wè figi m sof ke frè nou an avèk nou.’”<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Alò, Israël te di: “Poukisa ou maltrete m konsa, pou nou te di mesye a ke nou te gen yon lòt frè toujou?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Men yo te di: “Mesye a te kesyone nou byen dirèk konsènan moun nan fanmi nou. Li te mande: ‘<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:13">Jen 42:13</ref></char></note>Èske papa nou toujou vivan? Èske nou gen yon lòt frè?’ Alò, nou te reponn kesyon li. Èske nou ta ka konnen ke li ta di: ‘Mennen frè nou an desann?’”<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Juda te di a papa li, Israël: “Voye jènjan an avèk mwen. Nou va leve ale, pou nou kapab viv e pa mouri, nou menm, ansanm ak ou, ak pitit ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:37">Jen 42:37</ref></char></note>Mwen menm, mwen va garanti pou li. Ou kapab mete m responsab li. Si mwen pa mennen l tounen bò kote ou, pou m fè l chita devan ou, alò, ke mwen rete koupab devan ou pou tout tan. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Paske si nou pa t mize, asireman kounye a nou ta gen tan retounen de fwa deja.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Alò, papa yo, Israël te di yo: “Si sa oblije fèt, alò, fè l konsa: Pran kèk nan pi bèl pwodwi peyi a nan sak nou, pou pote desann vè nonm nan kòm kado; yon ti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:25">Jen 37:25</ref></char></note> lwil, yon ti siwo myèl, yon ti gòm santi bon, myrr, grenn pistach fen avèk grenn zanmann. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Pran doub lajan nan men nou, e anplis, pran pou remèt nan men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:25-35">Jen 42:25-35</ref> </char></note>kòb ki te retounen nan bouch sak la. Petèt se te yon erè. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Pran frè nou an tou, e leve retounen vè mesye a. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Konsa, ke Bondye Toupwisan an kapab bannou gras nan zye mesye a, pou li kab lage bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:24">Jen 42:24</ref></char></note>lòt frè nou an avèk Benjamin. Epi pou mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:36">Jen 42:36</ref></char></note>si mwen pèdi pitit mwen yo, mwen pèdi nèt.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Alò, mesye yo te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:11">Jen 43:11</ref></char></note>kado sila yo, e yo te pran doub lajan nan men yo avèk Benjamin. Konsa, yo te leve desann an Égypte, e yo te kanpe devan Joseph. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Lè Joseph te wè Benjamin avèk yo, li te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:1">Jen 44:1</ref></char></note>chèf domestik lakay li a, “Mennen mesye yo nan kay la, touye yon bèt, e fè prepare l; paske mesye sa yo ap vin manje avèk mwen a midi a.”<verse eid="GEN 43:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Alò, nonm nan te fè sa ke Joseph te mande a, e li te mennen mesye yo lakay Joseph. <verse eid="GEN 43:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Alò, mesye yo te byen pè, paske yo te mennen yo lakay Joseph. Konsa, yo te di: “Se akoz lajan ki te remèt nan sak yo premye fwa a, ke yo ap mennen nou la a, pou li kapab chache okazyon kont nou, pou tonbe sou nou, e pran nou kòm esklav avèk bourik nou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Pou sa a, yo te vin pwoche chèf domestik la. Yo te pale ak li nan antre kay la, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>e yo te di: “O mèt mwen, vrèman nou te desann premye fwa a pou achte manje, <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>men sa te fè ke lè nou rive nan lojman nou, pou louvri sak nou, konsa, nou jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:27-35">Jen 42:27-35</ref> </char></note>kòb chak moun nan bouch sak li! Tout kòb nou nèt! Konsa, nou te retounen pote li nan men nou. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Nou te pote osi, lajan anplis nan men nou pou achte manje. Nou pa konnen kilès ki te mete kòb nou yo nan sak nou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Li te di: “Rete anpè, nou pa bezwen pè. Bondye pa nou an e Bondye papa nou an te bannou trezò nan sak nou yo. Mwen te resevwa kòb nou an.” Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:24">Jen 42:24</ref></char></note>li te mennen Siméon deyò bay yo.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Epi nonm nan te mennen mesye yo antre lakay Joseph. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:4">Jen 18:4</ref></char></note>bay yo dlo, e yo te lave pye pa yo. Li te bay bourik yo manje. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Konsa, yo te prepare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:11-15">Jen 43:11-15</ref> </char></note>kado yo pou lè Joseph ta vin parèt a midi, paske yo te tande ke yo te gen pou manje la.<verse eid="GEN 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Lè Joseph te rive lakay li, yo te pote kado ki te nan men yo bò kote li nan kay la, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7-10">Jen 37:7-10</ref> </char></note>bese atè devan li. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Li te mande yo si tout bagay ale byen. Li te di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:7">Jen 43:7</ref></char></note>Èske granmoun sou sila nou te pale m nan toujou vivan?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Yo te di: “Sèvitè ou a, papa nou toujou byen; li toujou vivan.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7-10">Jen 37:7-10</ref></char></note>Yo te bese ba pou bay respè.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Lè li te leve zye li, li te wè frè li, Benjamin, fis a manman l lan, e li te di: “Èske se sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:13">Jen 42:13</ref> </char></note>pi jenn frè nou ke nou te pale m nan?” Konsa, li te di: “Ke Bondye kapab fè ou gras, fis mwen.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Konsa, Joseph te fè vit ale deyò, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:26">I Wa 3:26</ref></char></note>li te tèlman touche byen fon pa prezans frè li yo, e li te chache yon kote pou l ta kab kriye. Li te antre nan chanm li an, e li te kriye la.<verse eid="GEN 43:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Alò, li te lave figi li, e li te vin parèt deyò. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Jen 45:1</ref></char></note>kontwole tèt li, e te di: “Sèvi manje a.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Epi yo te sèvi Joseph nan yon kote pou kont li, e lòt Ejipsyen yo pou kont yo, paske yon Ejipsyen pa t kapab manje avèk yon Ebre. Paske sa se yon abominasyon pou Ejipsyen yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:34">Jen 46:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 43:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Alò, yo te chita devan li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:7">Jen 42:7</ref></char></note>premye ne a, selon dwa nesans li, pi jenn nan selon jennès li, e mesye yo t ap gade youn lòt byen etone. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Li te pran pòsyon manje pa yo sòti nan pwòp tab li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:34">Jen 25:34</ref></char></note>men pòsyon Benjamin an te senk fwa plis ke tout lòt yo. Epi yo te manje e bwè, e fè kè kontan avèk li.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 42:25">Jen 42:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te pase lòd a chèf domestik la e te di: “Ranpli sak yo avèk manje, tout sa ke yo kapab pote, e mete kòb a chak moun nan bouch sak li. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Plase tas mwen an, tas fèt an ajan an nan bouch sak pi jenn nan, ansanm ak kòb li pou sereyal la.” Epi sa te fèt jan Joseph te mande a.<verse eid="GEN 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Depi li te fè klè, mesye yo te voye ale, yo menm avèk bourik yo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Yo te fenk kite vil la, e yo pa t byen lwen lè Joseph te di a chèf domestik li a: “Leve, swiv mesye sa yo. Lè nou rive sou yo, di yo konsa: ‘Poukisa nou rekonpanse mal pou byen? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Èske tas sa a se pa sila ke mèt mwen an bwè ladann, e sèvi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19:26</ref></char></note>divinasyon an? Nou te fè mal lè nou te fè sa.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Alò, li te rive sou yo, e li te pale pawòl sa ak yo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Yo te di li: “Poukisa mèt mwen an pale kalite pawòl sila yo? Sa lwen mwen pou m ta fè yon bagay konsa. <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:21">Jen 43:21</ref></char></note>lajan ke nou te twouve nan bouch sak nou yo, nou te pote yo bannou soti nan peyi Canaan. Alò, kijan nou ta ka vòlè lò, oswa lajan lakay mèt la? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:32">Jen 31:32</ref></char></note>Avèk nenpòt kilès nan sèvitè nou yo ke nou ta twouve l, ke li mouri, e nou osi, nou va devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:16">Jen 44:16</ref></char></note>esklav a mèt nou.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Alò, li te di: “Konsa kite sa fèt tankou pawòl ou; sila avèk kilès li twouve l la, li va devni esklav mwen, e tout rès nan nou va rete inosan.”<verse eid="GEN 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Alò, byen prese, chak moun te desann sak li atè, pou te ouvri sak li. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Li te fè ankèt, kòmanse avèk pi gran, fini avèk pi jenn nan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:2">Jen 44:2</ref></char></note>tas la te twouve nan sak Benjamin an. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Konsa, yo te chire rad yo, e lè chak moun te fin chaje bèt li, yo te retounen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:4">Jen 44:4</ref></char></note>nan vil la.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Lè Juda avèk frè li yo te vini lakay Joseph, li te toujou la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7-10">Jen 37:7-10</ref> </char></note>yo te tonbe atè devan li. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Joseph te di yo: “Ki zak sa ke nou te fè la a? Èske nou pa konnen ke yon nonm tankou mwen kapab vrèman pratike divinasyon?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:5">Jen 44:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Konsa, Juda te di: “Kisa nou kapab di a mèt nou? Kisa nou kapab pale? Kijan nou kapab jistifye pwòp tèt nou? Bondye te twouve inikite nan sèvitè ou yo. Gade byen, nou se esklav a mèt nou, ni nou, men osi sila ki te posede tas nou te twouve a.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Men li te di yo: “Kite sa byen lwen pou m fè sa. Mesye sou sila nou te twouve tas la, li va esklav mwen. Men pou nou, ale anpè vè papa nou.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Alò, Juda te pwoche li. Li te di: “O mèt mwen, silvouplè, èske sèvitè ou kapab pale yon mo nan zòrèy a mèt la, e li p ap vin fache avèk sèvitè ou a; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7-8">Jen 37:7-8</ref> </char></note>ou menm jan avèk Farawon. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:7">Jen 43:7</ref></char></note>Mèt mwen an te mande sèvitè li yo, e te di: ‘Èske nou genyen yon papa, oswa yon frè?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Nou te di a mèt mwen: ‘Nou gen yon papa ki granmoun, ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:3">Jen 37:3</ref></char></note>timoun li te fè nan vyeyès li. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:33">Jen 37:33</ref></char></note>frè li a gen tan mouri, li sèl ki rete kòm pitit a manman l, e papa li renmen li.’<verse eid="GEN 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>“Konsa, ou te di sèvitè ou yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:15-20">Jen 45:15-20</ref> </char></note>‘Mennen fè l desann pou m kapab fikse zye m sou li.’<verse eid="GEN 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>“Men nou te di a mèt nou: ‘Jènjan an pa kapab kite papa l; papa l ta mouri.’<verse eid="GEN 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>“Malgre sa, ou te di a sèvitè ou yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:3-5">Jen 43:3-5</ref> </char></note>‘Amwens ke pi jenn nan vin desann avèk nou, nou p ap wè figi m ankò.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>“Se te konsa li te rive ke lè nou te monte vè sèvitè ou, papa m, ke nou te pale li pawòl a mèt nou an. <verse eid="GEN 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:2">Jen 43:2</ref></char></note>Papa nou te di nou: ‘Retounen achte yon ti manje.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>Men nou te di: ‘Nou pa kapab desann. Si pi jenn frè nou an avèk nou, nou va desann. Paske nou pa kapab wè figi a nonm nan ankò, sof ke pi jenn frè nou an avèk nou.’<verse eid="GEN 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>“Sèvitè ou, papa m, te di nou: ‘Ou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:19">Jen 46:19</ref></char></note>madanm mwen te fè de fis pou mwen. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Youn nan yo te sòti kite mwen, e mwen te di: “Asireman li te chire an mòso”, e mwen pa wè li depi lè sa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:31-35">Jen 37:31-35</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Si ou pran sila a osi de mwen, e si malè rive li, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:38">Jen 42:38</ref></char></note>mennen cheve tèt blanch sa a anba nan sejou mò yo avèk tristès.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>“Alò, pou sa, lè mwen rive vè sèvitè ou, papa m, e pou jènjan an pa la avèk nou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:1">I Sam 18:1</ref></char></note>lavi li mare ansanm avèk lavi jènjan an, <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>lè li wè ke jènjan an pa avèk nou, l ap mouri. Konsa sèvitè ou yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:29">Jen 44:29</ref></char></note>mennen cheve blanch a sèvitè ou, papa nou anba nan sejou mò yo avèk tristès. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Paske sèvitè ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:9">Jen 43:9</ref></char></note>devni yon sekirite pou jènjan a papa m nan, e mwen te di: ‘Si mwen pa fè l retounen a ou menm, alò, kite m pote koupabilite sa a devan papa m pou tout tan.’<verse eid="GEN 44:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>“Alò, pou sa, kite sèvitè ou a rete, olye ke jènjan an, kòm yon esklav a mèt mwen. E kite jènjan an monte avèk frè li yo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Paske kijan mwen kapab monte vè papa m si jènjan an pa avè m?—paske mwen pè pou m ta wè malè ki vin pran papa m.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Alò, Joseph pa t kapab kontwole emosyon li devan tout moun sa yo ki te kanpe akote li yo. Li te kriye: “Fè tout moun kite mwen.” Konsa pa t gen pèsòn avèk li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Trav 7:13</ref> </char></note>lè Joseph te revele li menm a frè l yo. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:14">Jen 45:14</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:15">15</ref></char></note>Li te kriye tèlman fò ke Ejipsyen yo te tande l. Menm lakay Farawon te tande l.<verse eid="GEN 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Alò, Joseph te di a frè li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Trav 7:13</ref> </char></note>“Mwen se Joseph! Èske papa m toujou vivan?” Men frè l yo pa t kapab reponn li, paske yo te plen de gwo perèz akoz prezans li.<verse eid="GEN 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Alò, Joseph te di a frè li yo: “Souple, vin pi pre m.” Epi yo te vin pi pre. Li te di: “Mwen se frè nou, Joseph, ke nou te vann pou ale an Egypte la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">Jen 37:28</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Alò, pinga nou tris ni fache avèk pwòp tèt nou, akoz ke nou te vann mwen isit la, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:7-8">Jen 45:7-8</ref> </char></note>Bondye te voye m avan nou pou prezève lavi nou. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Paske gwo grangou a te nan peyi sa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:2">Jen 37:2</ref></char></note>dezane sa yo, e gen senk an toujou ki p ap gen ni raboure tè ni rekòlt. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:5">Jen 45:5</ref></char></note>Bondye te voye m devan nou pou prezève yon retay sou latè, e pou kenbe nou vivan pa yon gwo delivrans.<verse eid="GEN 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>“Alò, pou sa, se pa te nou ki te voye m isit la, men Bondye. Li te fè m yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:10">Jij 17:10</ref></char></note>papa pou Farawon, mèt pou tout lakay li, e gouvènè sou tout peyi Égypte la.<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>“Fè vit, monte vè papa m pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Trav 7:14</ref> </char></note>di l: ‘Se konsa ke fis ou a, Joseph pale: “Bondye gen tan fè m mèt pou tout Égypte la. Fè vit, vin desann kote mwen, e pa mize.” <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Nou va viv nan peyi Gosen an, e nou va pre mwen, nou menm avèk pitit nou yo, pitit a pitit nou yo, bann mouton nou yo, avèk twoupo nou yo, ak tout sa ke nou genyen.’” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:28">Jen 46:28</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 46:34">34</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>La, mwen va osi fè pwovizyon pou nou, paske toujou ap gen senk ane ak gwo grangou e nou menm avèk lakay nou ak tout sa nou genyen ta kapab vin megri.<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>Gade byen, zye nou wè, e zye a frè m nan Benjamin wè, ke se pwòp bouch mwen k ap pale ak nou. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Koulye a nou gen pou di papa m tout richès mwen gen an Égypte, ak tout sa nou te wè. Nou gen pou prese <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Trav 7:14</ref> </char></note>mennen papa m desann isit la.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Konsa, li te tonbe nan kou a frè l, Benjamin, e li te kriye nan kou li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:2">Jen 45:2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Li te bo tout frè li yo, li te kriye sou yo, e apre frè l yo te pale avèk li.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Trav 7:13</ref> </char></note>nouvèl la te tande kote lakay Farawon, ke frè Joseph yo te vini, sa te fè Farawon kontan, ni sèvitè li yo. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Epi Farawon te di a Joseph: “Pale a frè ou yo, ‘Men sa pou fè; chaje bèt nou pou ale nan peyi Canaan. <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>Pran papa ou avèk fanmi nou yo, e vini kote mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:28">Jen 27:28</ref></char></note>mwen va bannou pi bon tè an Égypte yo, e nou va manje tout grès tè a.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>“Koulye a mwen pase lòd: ‘Fè sa: pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:21-27">Jen 45:21-27</ref> </char></note>cha ki sòti an Égypte yo pou pitit nou yo ak madanm nou yo, e mennen papa nou vini. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Pa okipe nou de byen nou yo, paske tout sa ki pi bon nan tout peyi Égypte la se pou nou.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te fè sa. Epi Joseph te bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:19">Jen 45:19</ref></char></note>cha yo selon kòmann Farawon an, e li te bay yo pwovizyon pou vwayaj la. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>A yo chak, li te bay echanj abiman, men a Benjamin li te bay twa san pyès an ajan, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:5">II Wa 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 43:34">Jen 43:34</ref></char></note>senk echanj abiman. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>A papa li, li te voye kòm swivan: dis bourik chaje avèk pi bon bagay Égypte kab pwodwi, dis bourik femèl chaje avèk sereyal ak pen, ak nouriti pou papa l nan vwayaj la. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Konsa, li te voye frè li yo pati, e pandan yo t ap sòti, li te di yo: “Pa goumen nan vwayaj la.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Alò yo te kite Égypte monte, e yo te vini nan peyi Canaan kote papa yo, Jacob.<verse eid="GEN 45:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Yo te pale li, e yo te di li konsa: “Joseph toujou vivan! Vrèman, li se Gouvènè tout peyi Égypte la!” Men kè Jacob te febli. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:31-35">Jen 37:31-35</ref></char></note>Li pa t kwè yo. <verse eid="GEN 45:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Yo te di li tout pawòl ke Joseph te pale yo. Men lè li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:19">Jen 45:19</ref></char></note>cha yo ke Joseph te voye pou mennen li an, lespri papa yo, Jacob, te remonte.<verse eid="GEN 45:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Alò, Israël te di: “Sa sifi! Fis mwen an, Joseph toujou ap viv. M ap prale wè l avan ke m mouri.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Epi Israël te pati avèk tout sa li te genyen. Li te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:31">Jen 21:31</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba e te ofri sakrifis a Bondye a papa li a, Isaac.<verse eid="GEN 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Bondye te pale avèk Israël nan vizyon nan nwit lan. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:11">Jen 22:11</ref> </char></note>“Jacob, Jacob.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Jacob te reponn: “Men mwen isit la.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Li te di: “Mwen se Bondye, Bondye a papa ou a. Pa pè desann an Égypte, paske mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:9">Egz 1:9</ref></char></note>fè nou vin yon gran nasyon la. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref> </char></note>Mwen va desann avèk nou an Égypte. Mwen va anplis, an verite, fè nou monte ankò. Epi se men Joseph ki va fèmen zye ou.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Alò, Jacob te leve kite Beer-Schéba. Fis Israël yo te pote papa yo, Jacob, ak pitit pa yo, ak madanm yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:21">Jen 45:21</ref></char></note>cha ke Farawon te voye pou pote yo. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Yo te pran tout bèt yo avèk tout byen yo, ke yo te vin gen nan peyi Canaan an, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:5">Det 26:5</ref></char></note>te vini an Égypte, Jacob avèk tout desandan li yo, ansanm <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>avèk fis li yo, fis a fis li yo, fi li yo avèk fi a fis li yo, ak tout desandan li yo. Li te mennen tout desandan avèk li, ale an Égypte.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Alò, sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-4">Egz 1:1-4</ref></char></note>non a fis a Israël yo, Jacob avèk fis li yo ki te ale an Égypte: Reuben, premye ne a Jacob la.<verse eid="GEN 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>Fis Reuben yo: Hénoc, Pallu, Hetsron, ak Carmi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:15">Egz 6:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis Siméon yo: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakin avèk Tsochar; e Saul, fis a yon fanm Kananeyen.<verse eid="GEN 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:1">I Kwo 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Levi yo: Guerschon, Kehath, ak Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Fis a Juda yo: Er, Onan, Schéla, Pérets, ak Zarach. Men Er avèk Onan te mouri nan peyi Canaan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:3">Jen 38:3</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 38:4">4</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 38:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:5">I Kwo 2:5</ref></char></note>Fis a Pérets yo te Hetsron, avèk Hamul.<verse eid="GEN 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Fis a Issacar yo: Tholy, Puva, Job, ak Schimron.<verse eid="GEN 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Fis a Zabulon yo: Séred, Élon avèk Jahleel.<verse eid="GEN 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Sila yo se fis a Léa yo, ke li te fè pou Jacob nan Paddan-Aram, avèk fis li, Dina; tout fis li yo ak fi li yo te vin monte a trant-twa.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:15-18">Nonb 26:15-18</ref> </char>
    </note>Fis a Gad yo: Tsiphjon, Haggi, Schuni, Etsbon, Éri, Arodi avèk Areéli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Fis Aser yo: Jimna, Jischva, Jischvi, ak Beria; e sè yo, Sérach.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:17">Epi fis Beria yo: Héber avèk Malkiel. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Sila yo se fis a Zilpha, sila ke Laban te bay a fi li Léa a; epi li te fè pou Jacob sèz moun sa yo.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Fis a Rachel yo, madanm a Jacob la: Joseph avèk Benjamin.<verse eid="GEN 46:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Alò, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Jen 41:50-52</ref></char></note>Joseph nan peyi Égypte la, te ne Manassé ak Éphraïm, ke Asenath, fi a Poti-Phéra a, prèt On an te fè pou li.<verse eid="GEN 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 7:6">I Kwo 7:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Benjamin yo: Béla, Béker, Aschbel, Guéra, Naaman, Éhi, Rosch, Muppim, Huppim, ak Ard.<verse eid="GEN 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Sila yo se fis a Rachel yo, ki te fèt a Jacob; te gen katòz moun antou.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Fis a Dan yo: Huschim.<verse eid="GEN 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Fis a Nephtali yo: Jathtseel, Guni, Jetser, ak Schillem.<verse eid="GEN 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:5-7">Jen 30:5-7</ref></char></note>fis a Bilha yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:29">Jen 29:29</ref></char></note>Laban te bay a fi li, Rachel, e li te fè sa yo pou Jacob; te gen sèt moun antou.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:5">Egz 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout moun ki te pou Jacob yo te vini an Égypte, desandan ki te sòti dirèk sou li menm yo, san kontwole madanm a fis Jacob yo te swasant sis moun antou.<verse eid="GEN 46:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Fis a Joseph ki te fèt pou li an Égypte yo te de. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:22">Det 10:22</ref></char></note>Tout moun lakay Jacob ki te vini an Égypte yo te swasann-dis.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Alò, li te voye Juda devan li vè Joseph, pou montre li chemen an devan l nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:10">Jen 45:10</ref></char></note>Gosen, epi yo te vini nan peyi Gosen. <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Joseph te prepare cha li, li te monte Gosen pou rankontre papa li, Israël. Depi li te parèt devan li, li te tonbe nan kou li e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:14-15">Jen 45:14-15</ref></char></note>te kriye nan kou li pandan anpil tan.<verse eid="GEN 46:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Konsa Israël te di a Joseph: “Koulye a kite mwen mouri, paske mwen gen tan wè figi ou, ke ou toujou vivan.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Joseph te di a frè l yo e a lakay papa li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:1">Jen 47:1</ref></char></note>“Mwen va monte pou pale ak Farawon, e mwen va di li: ‘Frè m yo avèk lakay papa m, ki te nan peyi Canaan an vin kote mwen. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Mesye sa yo se bèje, paske yo te konn okipe bèt. E yo te mennen bann mouton pa yo avèk twoupo pa yo, ak tout sa yo posede.’<verse eid="GEN 46:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>“Lè Farawon rele nou e di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:2-3">Jen 47:2-3</ref></char></note>‘Kisa nou fè kòm metye.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>Nou va di: ‘Sèvitè ou yo ap okipe bèt depi lè nou te jenn jis rive koulye a, ni nou menm, ni papa nou yo,’ pou nou kapab viv nan peyi Gosen; paske tout bèje se yon abominasyon pou Ejipsyen yo.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:7-8">Jen 13:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 45:10-18">Jen 45:10-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:31">Jen 46:31</ref></char></note>Joseph te antre pou pale ak Farawon. Li te di: “Papa m avèk frè m yo, bann mouton yo, twoupo yo, avèk tout sa yo posede, te sòti nan peyi Canaan an. Epi gade byen, yo nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:10">Jen 45:10</ref></char></note>Gosen.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Li te pran senk mesye pami frè li yo, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Trav 7:13</ref> </char></note>prezante yo bay Farawon.<verse eid="GEN 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Alò, Farawon te di a frè li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:33">Jen 46:33</ref> </char></note>“Ki metye nou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Epi yo te di a Farawon: “Sèvitè nou se bèje, ni nou menm, ni zansèt nou yo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Yo te di a Farawon: “Nou te vini pou rete tankou etranje nan peyi a, paske nanpwen patiraj pou bann mouton yo paske gwo grangou a rèd nan peyi Canaan. Alò pou sa, souple, kite sèvitè nou yo viv nan peyi Gosen an.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:1">Jen 43:1</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Konsa, Farawon te di a Joseph: “Papa ou avèk frè ou yo te vin kote ou. <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>Peyi Égypte la devan ou, plase papa ou avèk frè ou yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:10-18">Jen 45:10-18</ref> </char></note>pi bon pòsyon tè a, kite yo viv nan peyi Gosen an. Epi si ou konnen moun ak kapasite pami yo, alò, fè yo responsab bèt mwen yo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Epi Joseph te mennen papa li, Jacob. Li te prezante li bay Farawon, epi Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:22">II Sam 14:22</ref></char></note>beni Farawon. <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Farawon te di a Jacob: “Konbyen ane ou gen tan viv?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Konsa, Jacob te di a Farawon: “Lane lavi m yo sou latè se san-trant. Pa anpil, e degoutan se te ane lavi m yo. Ni yo pa menm fòs avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:7">Jen 25:7</ref></char></note>lane ke zansèt mwen yo te viv pandan jou lavi pa yo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Konsa, Jacob te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:7">Jen 47:7</ref></char></note>beni Farawon, e li te sòti nan prezans li.<verse eid="GEN 47:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Epi Joseph te pozisyone papa li, ak frè li yo e li te bay yo yon teren an Égypte, nan pi bon pati nan peyi a, kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:11">Egz 1:11</ref></char></note>Ramsès la, tankou Farawon te kòmande a. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Joseph te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:11">Jen 45:11</ref></char></note>founi papa li ak frè li yo, avèk tout lakay li avèk manje, selon fòs kantite pitit pa yo. <verse eid="GEN 47:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Koulye a, pa t gen manje nan tout peyi a, akoz gwo grangou a te tèlman rèd, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:30">Jen 41:30</ref></char></note>peyi Égypte la ak peyi Canaan an te febli nèt akoz gwo grangou a.<verse eid="GEN 47:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:56">Jen 41:56</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joseph te ranmase tout lajan ki te twouve nan peyi Égypte la, ak nan peyi Canaan pou sereyal ke yo te achte a, e Joseph te pote lajan an lakay Farawon. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Lè tout lajan an te fin depanse nan tout peyi Égypte la, ak tout peyi Canaan an, tout Ejipsyen yo te vin vè Joseph, e te di li: “Bannou manje, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:19">Jen 47:19</ref></char></note>pou ki rezon nou ta dwe mouri nan prezans ou? Paske lajan nou fini.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Alò, Joseph te di: “Bay bèt nou yo, e mwen va bannou manje pou bèt yo, paske kòb nou gen tan fini.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Epi yo te mennen bèt yo kote Joseph, Joseph te bay yo manje an echanj ak cheval ak bann mouton, twoupo ak bourik. Konsa, li te bay yo manje an echanj ak tout bèt pa yo nan ane sa a.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Lè ane sa a te fini, yo te vin kote li nan lane pwochèn, e te di li: “Nou p ap kache a mèt nou ke lajan nou fin depanse, e tout twoupo bèt yo se pou mèt nou. Nanpwen anyen ki rete pou mèt la, sof ke kò nou, ak tè nou yo. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Poukisa nou ta mouri devan zye ou, ni nou menm, ni tè nou yo? Achte nou menm avèk tè nou yo, e nou va vin esklav a Farawon. Epi bannou semans pou nou ka viv, pou nou pa mouri, e pou tè a pa rete vid.” <verse eid="GEN 47:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Alò, Joseph te achte tout tè an Égypte yo pou Farawon, e chak Ejipsyen te vann tè li, akoz ke gwo grangou a te rèd sou yo. Konsa, tè a te vin pou Farawon. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Epi pou pèp la, li te deplase yo pou antre nan vil yo, sòti nan yon pwen fwontyè Égypte la, jis rive nan lòt la. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Se sèl tè prèt yo ke li pa t achte, paske prèt yo te gen yon bous ki te sòti sou Farawon, e yo te viv sou bous ke Farawon te bay yo a. Akoz sa, yo pa t vann tè pa yo a.<verse eid="GEN 47:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Epi Joseph te di a pèp la: “Veye byen, jodi a mwen te achte nou menm avèk tè nou yo pou Farawon. Men semans lan se pou nou, e nou kapab simen nan tè a. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Nan rekòlt la, nou va bay yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:24">Jen 31:24</ref></char></note>senkyèm a Farawon, e kat senkyèm nan ap rete pou nou pou simen nan tè a pou manje pou nou menm avèk sa ki lakay nou yo, ak pou pitit nou yo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Epi yo te di: “Ou gen tan sove lavi nou! Kite nou twouve favè nan zye a mèt nou, e nou va vin esklav Farawon.”<verse eid="GEN 47:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Joseph te fè yon règleman selon peyi Égypte la ki valab jis rive jou sa a ke Farawon te gen dwa a yon senkyèm nan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:22">Jen 47:22</ref></char></note>Sèl tè a prèt yo ki pa t vin pou Farawon.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Alò, Israël te viv nan peyi Égypte la, nan Gosen. Yo te gen tèren ladann, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:5">Det 26:5</ref></char></note>te vin trè pwodiktif, e yo te peple anpil.<verse eid="GEN 47:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Jacob te viv nan peyi Égypte pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:9">Jen 47:9</ref></char></note>disèt ane'. Pou sa, fòs lavi li te san-karant-sèt ane. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Lè pou Israël mouri an t ap pwoche. Li te rele fis li, Joseph, e te di li: “Souple, si mwen te twouve favè nan zye ou, koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2">Jen 24:2</ref></char></note>plase men ou anba fant janm mwen, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:49">Jen 24:49</ref></char></note>aji avèk mwen nan bòn fwa ak tandrès. Souple, pa antere mwen an Égypte, <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>men lè m kouche avèk zansèt mwen yo, nou va pote mwen deyò de Égypte, pou antere mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:17-20">Jen 23:17-20</ref> </char></note>plas antèman a yo menm nan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Epi Joseph te di: “M ap fè jan ou di m nan.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Konsa, li te di: “Sèmante ban mwen.” Epi li te sèmante ba li. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:47">I Wa 1:47</ref></char></note>Israël te bese pou adore nan tèt kabann nan.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Alò, li te rive ke apre bagay sa yo, ke Joseph te vin enfòme: “Gade byen, papa ou malad.” Li te pran de fis li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:51-52">Jen 41:51-52</ref> </char></note>Manassé ak Éphraïm avèk li. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Epi moun yo te pale a Jacob: “Gade byen, fis ou a, Joseph gen tan vin kote ou.” Konsa, Israël te ranmase fòs li. Li te chita sou kabann nan.<verse eid="GEN 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Epi Jacob te di a Joseph: “Bondye Toupwisan an te parèt a mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>Luz nan peyi Canaan an e Li te beni mwen. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>Li te di mwen: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va fè nou donnen anpil fwi, e miltipliye anpil. Mwen va fè ou vin yon konpanyen pèp la, e Mwen va bay peyi sa a a desandan aprè ou, kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:8">Jen 17:8</ref></char></note>posesyon k ap dire pou tout tan.’<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>“Alò, de fis ou yo ki te fèt a ou menm nan peyi Égypte la avan mwen te vin kote ou an Égypte la, se pa m. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Jen 41:50-52</ref></char></note>Éphraïm avèk Manassé se pou mwen, menm jan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:1-2">I Kwo 5:1-2</ref></char></note>Ruben avèk Siméon va pou mwen. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Men pitit ou yo ki te fèt apre yo, va pou ou. Yo va rele selon non frè pa yo nan eritaj yo. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Alò, pou mwen, lè m te retounen nan Paddan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:19">Jen 35:19</ref></char></note>Rachel te mouri, nan tristès mwen, nan peyi Canaan an pandan vwayaj la, lè te toujou gen yon distans pou rive nan Ephrata (ki vle di Bethléem).”<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Lè Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:10">Jen 48:10</ref></char></note>te wè fis a Joseph yo, li te di: “Kilès moun sa yo ye?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Joseph te di a papa li: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:5">Jen 33:5</ref></char></note>Sa yo se fis mwen yo, ke Bondye te ban mwen isit la.” Epi li te di: “Mennen yo isit souple, pou m kapab beni yo.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:1">Jen 27:1</ref> </char></note>zye Israël yo te tèlman vin fèb akoz laj ke li pa t kapab wè. Epi Joseph te mennen yo toupre li, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27">Jen 27:27</ref> </char></note>bo yo e li te anbrase yo.<verse eid="GEN 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Israël te di a Joseph: “Mwen pa t janm sipoze ke m ta wè figi ou, e gade byen, Bondye kite mwen wè pitit ou yo tou.”<verse eid="GEN 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Epi Joseph te mennen yo soti antre jenou li yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:6">Jen 42:6</ref></char></note>bese ba avèk figi li jis atè. <verse eid="GEN 48:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Joseph te pran yo toude, Ephraïm nan men dwat li vè bò goch Israël, e nan men goch li, Manassé vè bò dwat Israël. Konsa, li te mennen yo toupre li. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Men Israël te lonje men dwat li, li te mete li sou Éphraïm, ki te pi jenn nan, e men goch li te sou tèt Manassé, avèk men l kwaze, poutan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:51-52">Jen 41:51-52</ref> </char></note>Manassé te premye ne.<verse eid="GEN 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Li te beni Joseph, e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Bondye devan sila zansèt mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Abraham avèk Isaac te mache a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:24">Jen 49:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye ki te bèje m nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">pandan tout vi m jis rive jounen jodi a,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:11-18">Jen 22:11-18</ref> </char>
    </note>zanj ki te rachte mwen de tout mal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">beni jènjan sa yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">epi ke non mwen kapab viv toujou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">nan yo, e non a zansèt mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Abraham avèk Isaac.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ke yo kapab grandi vin fè yon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">gwo pèp nan mitan mond lan.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Lè Joseph te vin wè ke papa li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:14">Jen 48:14</ref></char></note>poze men dwat li sou tèt Éphraïm, sa te fè l pa kontan. Li te sezi men papa li pou deplase li sou Éphraïm, ale vè tèt Manassé. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Joseph te di papa l: “Se pa sa, papa, paske se sila a ki premye ne a. Mete men dwat ou sou tèt li.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Men papa li te refize. Li te di: “Mwen konnen, fis mwen, mwen konnen. Li osi va devni yon pèp, e li osi va vin gran. Poutan, pi jenn frè li a va pi gran pase li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:14">Jen 28:14</ref></char></note>desandan li yo va devni yon gran pèp a nasyon yo.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Li te beni yo nan jou sa a, e te di: “Pa nou menm, Israël va eksprime benediksyon li yo e va di: ‘Ke Bondye kapab fè nou tankou Éphraïm ak Manassé!’”<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Konsa, Israël te di a Joseph: “Gade byen, mwen prèt pou mouri, men Bondye va avèk ou, e Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Jen 28:15</ref></char></note>mennen ou retounen nan peyi a zansèt ou yo. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Mwen bay ou yon pòsyon anplis ke frè ou yo, ke m te pran nan men Amoreyen yo avèk nepe mwen ak banza mwen.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Epi Jacob te rele fis li yo e te di: “Rasanble nou menm pou m kapab di nou sa k ap rive nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:14">Nonb 24:14</ref> </char></note>nan jou k ap vini yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>Rasanble nou ansanm e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:11">Sòm 34:11</ref></char></note>tande, fis a Jacob yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:2">Koute Israël, papa nou.<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>Ruben, se ou ki premye ne mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">pouvwa mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:17">Det 21:17</ref></char></note>kòmansman nan gwo fòs mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">premye nan respè e premye nan fòs.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>San kontwòl tankou dlo k ap bouyi, ou p ap genyen premye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">akoz ke ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Jen 35:22</ref></char></note>monte sou kabann papa ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">epi ou te souye li. Li te monte sou kabann mwen.<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 34:25-30">Jen 34:25-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Siméon avèk Lévi se frè yo ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:5">Nepe pa yo se zouti vyolans.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 64:2">Sòm 64:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa kite nanm mwen antre nan konsèy pa yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">pa kite glwa mwen vin reyini avèk asanble pa yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Akoz nan kòlè yo, yo te touye moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">e nan volonte egoyis pa yo, yo te koupe blese jarèt bèf.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Modi se kòlè yo, paske li fewòs;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">epi vanjans yo, paske li te mechan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 19:1-9">Jos 19:1-9</ref> </char>
    </note>Mwen va separe yo nan Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">e gaye yo nan Israël.<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>Juda, frè ou yo va ba ou lwanj;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">men ou ap sou kou lènmi ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:29">Jen 27:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a papa ou yo va vin bese ba devan ou.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Juda se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:5-7">Éz 19:5-7</ref> </char></note>jèn pòtre a yon lyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">depi nan manje ou, fis mwen, ou gen tan monte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Li bese kò l, li kouche tankou yon lyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">e tankou yon lyon, se kilès ki gen kouraj pou fè l leve?<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Nonb 24:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Baton gouvènans p ap janm sòti sou Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">ni bwa règleman p ap janm antre pye li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">jis lè Schilo vini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:8-11">Sòm 72:8-11</ref></char></note>a li menm va parèt obeyisans a tout nasyon yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>Li mare jenn bourik li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">ak pi bèl pye rezen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:2">És 63:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li lave vètman li yo nan diven,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">ak manto li yo nan san rezen yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Zye li fonse wouj akoz diven an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:12">e dan li blanchi nan lèt la.<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:18-19">Det 33:18-19</ref> </char>
    </note>Zabulon va demere bò lanmè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">li va yon pwotèj pou gwo bato yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Lizyè l va ak Sidon.<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>Issacar se yon bourik gwo fòs</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:14">k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:16">Jij 5:16</ref></char></note>kouche ba nan mitan makout bèt.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>Lè li te wè ke plas repo sa a te dous,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">e tè a te fè l plezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">li te double zepòl li pou pote chaj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">e li te devni yon esklav pou kòve.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:22">Det 33:22</ref> </char>
    </note>Dan va jije pèp li kon youn nan tribi Israël yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dan va yon sèpan ki nan wout,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">yon koulèv avèk kòn nan chemen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">k ap mòde talon cheval la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">pou fè chevalye li tonbe an aryè.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:2">Egz 15:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske delivrans ou m ap tann, o SENYÈ.<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:20">Det 33:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou Gad, piyajè yo va piyaje li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:19">men li va piyaje vè talon pa yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:24-25">Det 33:24-25</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou Aser, manje li va rich, e li va pwodwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:20">bagay ki delika e ki wayal.<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:23">Det 33:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nephthali se yon bich ki vin lage.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:21">Li donnen bèl pitit.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:13-17">Det 33:13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joseph se yon branch ki donnen fwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">yon branch avèk fwi toupre yon sous.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">Branch li yo kouri sou yon miray.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Achè yo te atake avèk rayisman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:23">yo te tire sou li e yo te anmède li;<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>men banza li te rete fèm, e bwa li yo te fò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">depi nan men Toupwisan Jacob la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">(depi la se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Sòm 23:1</ref></char></note>Bèje a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">És 28:16</ref></char></note>Wòch Israël la),<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>Depi nan Bondye a papa ou ki bay ou soutyen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Toupwisan an ki beni ou avèk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:28">Jen 27:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>benediksyon anwo nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">benediksyon ki sòti nan fon ki anba a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">e benediksyon tete matris ak vant ki te fè ou a.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Benediksyon a papa ou yo gen tan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">fin depase sila a zansèt pa m yo jis rive</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">nan limit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:15-16">Det 33:15-16</ref></char></note>kolin ki dire pou tout tan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Yo va rete sou tèt a Joseph,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">sou kouwòn a tèt ki byen distenge pami frè li yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>Benjamin se yon lou voras;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">nan maten li va devore sa ke li kenbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">e nan aswè, li va divize piyaj la.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Tout sa yo se douz tribi Israël yo, e se sa ke papa yo te di yo lè li te beni yo. Li te beni yo, yo chak avèk yon benediksyon ke yo te merite.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Konsa, li te bay yo chaj, e li te di yo: “Mwen prèt pou ranmase vè moun mwen yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:30">Jen 47:30</ref></char></note>Antere mwen avèk zansèt mwen yo nan kav ki nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16-20">Jen 23:16-20</ref></char></note>chan Éphron a, Etyen an, <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Jen 23:3-20</ref></char></note>kav ki nan chan Macpéla a, ki avan Mamré nan peyi Canaan an, ke Abraham te achte ansanm avèk chan nan men Éphron, Etyen an pou yon plas antèman.<verse eid="GEN 49:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>“La menm yo te antere <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9">Jen 25:9</ref></char></note>Abraham avèk madanm li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:19">Jen 23:19</ref></char></note>Sarah, la yo te antere Isaac avèk madanm li Rebecca, e se la mwen te antere Léa; <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>chan an avèk kav ki ladann nan, te achte nan men fis a Heth yo.”<verse eid="GEN 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Lè li te fin chaje fis li yo, li te rale pye li anndan kabann nan, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Trav 7:15</ref></char></note> respire dènye souf li, e li te vin ranmase vè moun li yo.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Joseph te tonbe sou figi a papa li. Li te kriye sou li, e li te bo li. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Joseph te kòmande sèvitè li yo avèk doktè yo pou anbome kò papa l. Donk, doktè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:12">Mat 26:12</ref> </char></note>anbome Israël. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Alò, karant jou te nesesè pou sa, paske se tan sa a li te pran pou anbome. Epi Ejipsyen yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:29">Nonb 20:29</ref> </char></note>kriye pou li pandan swasanndi jou.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Lè jou doulè pou li yo te fin pase, Joseph te pale a lakay Farawon, e te di: “Si koulye a mwen jwenn favè nan zye nou, souple, pale avèk Farawon, e di: <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Jen 47:29-31</ref></char></note>Papa m te fè m sèmante e te di: ‘Gade byen, mwen prèt pou mouri. Nan tonm mwen ke m te fouye pou mwen menm nan peyi Canaan an, se la nou va antere mwen.’ Alò, pou sa, kite mwen monte pou antere papa m; epi mwen va retounen.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Farawon te di: “Ale monte antere papa ou, jan li te fè ou sèmante a.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Alò, Joseph te monte pou antere papa li, e avèk li te monte tout sèvitè a Farawon yo, ansyen lakay li yo, ak tout ansyen a peyi Égypte yo. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Tout lakay Joseph avèk frè li yo, ak lakay papa li te ale. Yo te kite sèlman timoun yo, bann mouton yo ak twoupo yo nan peyi Gosen an. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Osi te monte avèk li, cha yo avèk chevalye yo. Epi se te yon gran konpanyen.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Lè yo te vin nan glasi vannen kote Athad la, glasi ki lòtbò Jourdain an, yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:2">Trav 8:2</ref> </char></note>anpil kriye avèk gwo lamantasyon byen tris. Li te obsève sèt jou lamantasyon pou papa li. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Alò, lè abitan nan peyi a, Kananeyen yo te wè lamantasyon sa a nan glasi vannen Athad la, yo te di: “Sa se yon lamantasyon trè di pou Ejipsyen yo.” Pou rezon sa a, yo te rele li Abel-Mitsraïm, ki vle di lòtbò Jourdain an.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Se konsa fis li yo te fè pou li jan li te kòmande yo a; <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>paske fis li yo te pote li nan peyi Canaan an. Yo te antere li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16-20">Jen 23:16-20</ref></char></note>kav kote chan a Macpéla a avan Mamré, ke Abraham te achte ansanm avèk chan an pou yon kote antèman nan men Éphron, Etyen an.<verse eid="GEN 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Apre li te antere papa li, Joseph te retounen an Égypte—li menm, frè li yo, ak tout moun ki te monte avèk li pou antere papa li yo.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Lè frè a Joseph yo te wè ke papa yo te mouri, yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:28">Jen 37:28</ref></char></note>“Kisa ki va rive si Joseph toujou pote lahèn kont nou, e deside fè vanjans pou sa nou te fè l la?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Epi yo te voye vè Joseph e te di: “Papa ou te pase lòd avan li te mouri. Li te di: <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>‘Konsa ou va di a Joseph: Souple, mwen mande ou padon pou transgresyon a frè ou yo avèk peche pa yo, paske yo te fè ou tò.’ Koulye a, souple, padone transgresyon sèvitè Bondye a papa ou yo.” Epi Joseph te kriye lè yo te pale avèk li.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Frè li yo anplis, te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:8-10">Jen 37:8-10</ref></char></note>tonbe ba devan li, e yo te di: “Gade byen, nou se sèvitè ou.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Konsa, Joseph te di yo: “Pa pè; èske mwen nan plas Bondye? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Pou nou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:26-27">Jen 37:26-27</ref></char></note>nou te anvizaje mal kont mwen, men Bondye te anvizaje sa ki bon pou Li ta kapab fè rive rezilta ke nou wè koulye a devan nou an, pou L ta kapab prezève vi a anpil moun. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Pou sa, pa pè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:11">Jen 45:11</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè pwovizyon pou nou avèk pitit nou yo.” Li te rekonfòte yo e li te pale avèk tandrès avèk yo.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Alò, Joseph te rete an Égypte, li menm avèk lakay papa li, epi Joseph te viv pandan san-dis ane. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Joseph te wè twazyèm jenerasyon nan fis Ephraim yo, e anplis, fis a Makir yo, fis a Manassé a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:3">Jen 30:3</ref></char></note>fèt sou jenou a Joseph.<verse eid="GEN 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Joseph te di frè li yo: “Mwen prèt pou mouri men Bondye va asireman pran swen nou, e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:16-17">Egz 3:16-17</ref> </char></note>va fè nou sòti nan peyi sa a vè peyi ke li te pwomèt nan sèman li a Abraham, Isaac, ak Jacob la.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Konsa, Joseph te fè fis Israël yo sèmante. Li te di: “Anverite, Bondye va pwoteje nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Egz 13:19</ref></char></note>nou va pote zo mwen monte kite isit la.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Alò, Joseph te mouri nan laj san-dis ane. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:2">Jen 50:2</ref></char></note> anbome e yo te plase li nan yon sèkèy an Égypte.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
